...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/8926"}}, {tmdbId:"44420", properties:{imdbId:"0688999", name:"Victor Poletti", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/44420"}}, {tmdbId:"44419", properties:{imdbId:"0148149", name:"Peter Cellier", bio:"Peter Cellier (born 1928) is an English actor who has appeared in film, stage and television.  He is perhaps best known for his role as Sir Frank Gordon in Yes Ministerand then Yes, Prime Minister in the 1980s...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/44419"}}, {tmdbId:"15799", properties:{bornIn:"Augusta, Georgia, US", imdbId:"0902188", born:date('1958-12-22'), name:"Lenny von Dohlen", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nLenny Von Dohlen (born December 22, 1958) is an American film and stage actor, best known for his performance as the agoraphobic Harold Smith in Twin Peaks and the architect Miles Harding in the movie Electric Dreams.  Von Dohlen currently resides in New York and Los Angeles...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yZfisRYu3aEDRa0AaEIjMhkmW8w.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/15799"}}, {tmdbId:"12519", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0000515", born:date('1961-09-11'), name:"Virginia Madsen", bio:"Virginia Madsen (born September 11, 1961 height 5' 5\" (1,65 m)) is an American actress and documentary film producer.  She came to fame during the 1980s, having appeared in several films aimed at a teenage audience.  Two decades later, she had an Academy Award and Golden Globe-nominated role in the 2004 film Sideways...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2u72BF7i189nAcX1kEJLjGMsb0c.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/12519"}}, {tmdbId:"17652", properties:{bornIn:" Brooklyn, New York, USA", imdbId:"0757854", born:date('1954-08-20'), name:"Theresa Saldana", bio:"Theresa Saldana (August 20, 1954 – June 6, 2016) was an American actress and author, known for her work in film and television.  She is perhaps best known for her role as Rachel Scali, the wife of Police Commissioner Tony Scali, in the 1990s television series The Commish, for which she received a Golden Globe nomination for Best Performance by an Actress in a Supporting Role, in 1994...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/VWTUbbQQX1Sq1b8AIwbXDuT93u.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17652"}}, {tmdbId:"58691", properties:{bornIn:"Westwood, Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0000181", born:date('1961-09-25'), name:"Heather Locklear", bio:"Heather Deen Locklear is an American actress best known for her television roles as Sammy Jo Carrington on Dynasty, Officer Stacy Sheridan on T. J.  Hooker, Amanda Woodward on Melrose Place, and Caitlin Moore on Spin City...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6l2mI19qopJPfk2Tl7GHgMpTNyT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58691"}}, {tmdbId:"17444", properties:{bornIn:"Toronto, Ontario, Canada", imdbId:"0000433", born:date('1971-12-23'), name:"Corey Haim", bio:"Corey Ian Haim (December 23, 1971 – March 10, 2010) was a Canadian actor, known for a 1980s Hollywood career as a teen idol.  He starred in a number of films such as Lucas, Silver Bullet, Murphy's Romance, License to Drive and Dream a Little Dream.  His best-known role was alongside Corey Feldman in The Lost Boys, which made Haim a household name...", died:date('2010-03-10'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ygcYkFPIzXTbwYN9udzJpJOeKlo.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17444"}}, {tmdbId:"108729", properties:{imdbId:"0565267", name:"Molly McCarthy", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/108729"}}, {tmdbId:"79007", properties:{imdbId:"0311774", name:"Martha Gehman", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eC29RtivFeqNNsUoIuO1ilqIpkF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/79007"}}, {tmdbId:"26456", properties:{bornIn:"Corpus Christi, Texas, USA", imdbId:"0001742", born:date('1957-11-06'), name:"Lori Singer", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nLori Singer is an American actress and cellist born on November 6th, 1957, in Corpus Christi, Texas.  She is perhaps best known for her role in the 1984 feature film Footloose, and as Julie Miller in the television series Fame. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Lori Singer, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rcp1Gmaf3W0pUQia2mXn92XCZ5s.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/26456"}}, {tmdbId:"1902", properties:{bornIn:"Kansas City, Missouri, USA ", imdbId:"0001848", born:date('1948-03-28'), name:"Dianne Wiest", bio:"An American actress.  She has had a successful career on stage, television, and film, and has won two Academy Awards, two Emmy Awards and a Golden Globe Award.  Wiest has also been nominated for a BAFTA Award...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/axqtFLgJNNz0N9i443USHCOvrmY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1902"}}, {tmdbId:"58813", properties:{imdbId:"0026687", name:"Erich Anderson", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nErich Anderson is an actor, sometimes credited as E.  Erich Anderson, who has starred in film and on television.  He is best known for his first film role in the 1984 horror film Friday the 13th: The Final Chapter as Rob Dyer.  He also starred in the 1988 film Bat*21 and in the 2002 drama film Unfaithful...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hb89TAid82AM8MJLZEQ70WWISNv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58813"}}, {tmdbId:"72541", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0036978", born:date('1964-06-07'), name:"Judie Aronson", bio:"is an American actress who has starred in many films and a television show.  She played Sara Duncan on the short-lived series Pursuit of Happiness (1987–88)  Aronson was born in Los Angeles, California in 1964.  Her first film role was in the 1984 horror film Friday the 13th: The Final Chapter as Samantha.  In 1985, she starred in the hit comedy movie Weird Science as Hilly[3] and in the action movie American Ninja...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hEHVwsPdemBYboJsNUyHd9W1QF9.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/72541"}}, {tmdbId:"2174", properties:{bornIn:"Glendale, California, U.S.", imdbId:"0065206", born:date('1956-01-09'), name:"Kimberly Beck", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nKimberly Beck (born January 9, 1956; Glendale, California) is an American actress with over sixty television and film roles to her credit...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/blzWJxPixJWCGQld3DtGLcIjRmy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2174"}}, {tmdbId:"72398", properties:{imdbId:"0849006", name:"Ken Tanaka", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5af2OkUypOvWDHzKrglD8vl9kSh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/72398"}}, {tmdbId:"19591", properties:{imdbId:"0768005", born:date('1965-06-11'), name:"Yasuko Sawaguchi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19591"}}] AS row
