ikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nKerry Fox (born July 30, 1966) is a New Zealand actress.  She came to prominence playing author Janet Frame in the movie An Angel at My Table directed by Jane Campion, which gained her a Best Actress Award from the New Zealand Film and Television Awards. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kerry Fox, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qTN8PjqgOdICj6egcAhJ7qXfEk1.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17258"}}, {tmdbId:"28735", properties:{imdbId:"0449038", name:"Alexia Keogh", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yYpQJLoSpEKC2bcX8sxBxbUcKqq.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28735"}}, {tmdbId:"28736", properties:{imdbId:"0272649", name:"Karen Fergusson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28736"}}, {tmdbId:"28737", properties:{imdbId:"0161515", name:"Iris Churn", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28737"}}, {tmdbId:"17770", properties:{bornIn:" Los Angeles, California, United States", imdbId:"0001798", born:date('1944-08-13'), name:"Kevin Tighe", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.  Kevin Tighe (b.  Jon Kevin Fishburn; August 13, 1944) is an American character actor primarily known for his roles on television.  Tighe is best known for his role as Roy DeSoto, a senior paramedic, on the NBC series Emergency! (1972–77).  He and Randolph Mantooth, his partner in the series, have remained close friends.  In the 2000's he played Anthony Cooper the father of John Locke on the ABC series Lost...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/t4LMNB2Rhu9SLbr64gOW5V4sW96.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17770"}}, {tmdbId:"27106", properties:{bornIn:"Wilkes-Barre, Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"0468772", born:date('1957-01-28'), name:"Harley Jane Kozak", bio:"An American actress and author. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Harley Jane Kozak, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9BMCJq4owniBRXkf8y8kEN12JTS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/27106"}}, {tmdbId:"23705", properties:{bornIn:"Lemberg, Galicia, Austria-Hungary [now Lviv, Ukraine]", imdbId:"0297249", born:date('1911-05-15'), name:"Leo Fuchs", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nLeo Fuchs (May 15, 1911 — December 31, 1994) was a Polish-born Jewish American actor.  According to YIVO, born Avrum Leib Fuchs in Warsaw; according to Schechter, born in Lemberg, Galicia, then Poland, now Lviv, Ukraine). \n\nFuchs performed in many Yiddish and English plays and movies throughout the mid-twentieth century, and was famed as a comic, a dancer, and a coupletist.  He wrote much of his own material and toured widely...", died:date('1994-12-31'), url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23705"}}, {tmdbId:"23706", properties:{bornIn:"Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, U.S.", imdbId:"0072126", born:date('1960-06-25'), name:"Eve Gordon", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nEve Gordon (also known as Eve Bennett-Gordon; born June 25, 1960) is an American actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iQVDcTPEGijnAVveBUqcxlOjMYB.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23706"}}, {tmdbId:"12647", properties:{bornIn:"Tilsit, East Prussia, Germany", imdbId:"0000090", born:date('1930-12-17'), name:"Armin Mueller-Stahl", bio:"Armin Mueller-Stahl  (born 17 December 1930) is a German film actor, painter, writer and musician...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/64No2eAAlOX4OuEDOFe33MywNVA.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/12647"}}, {tmdbId:"199", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, U.S.", imdbId:"0001413", born:date('1950-09-07'), name:"Julie Kavner", bio:"Julie Deborah Kavner (born September 7, 1950) is an American film and television actress, comedian and voice artist.  Noted for her role as Marge Simpson on The Simpsons, she also voices other characters for the show...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/x3oG3OXtBfTFgqXPqxI1GKVEiaQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/199"}}, {tmdbId:"67761", properties:{bornIn:"Saginaw, Michigan, USA", imdbId:"0625724", born:date('1905-08-02'), name:"Ruth Nelson", died:date('1992-09-12'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1o6rBGNCGU3DFZIObZ5519GsaO3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/67761"}}, {tmdbId:"68848", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, U.S.", imdbId:"0005571", born:date('1961-04-05'), name:"Lisa Zane", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   Elizabeth Frances \"Lisa\" Zane (born April 5, 1961) is an American actress and singer who has starred on stage, in film and television. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Lisa Zane, licensed under CC-BY-SA,full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/m3PAg0tEsZzpioi90vcenngfmYu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/68848"}}] AS row
