on series...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/c9wvQRvHWGrYE2fDz9SiEcqAcWC.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/3134"}}, {tmdbId:"85500", properties:{bornIn:"Sacramento, California, U.S.", imdbId:"0793634", born:date('1943-07-31'), name:"Sab Shimono", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nSab Shimono (born July 31, 1943) is an American actor who has appeared in dozens of movies and television shows in character roles. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Sab Shimono, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aMmU3CK8TkHAJSDhsRBCYkse4Ck.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85500"}}, {tmdbId:"32596", properties:{imdbId:"0395949", name:"Shizuko Hoshi", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nXlbbqtjdAItcpTUU6OXAhvx0oD.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/32596"}}, {tmdbId:"2016586", properties:{name:"Julie Sedgewick", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2016586"}}, {tmdbId:"85", properties:{bornIn:"Owensboro, Kentucky, USA ", imdbId:"0000136", born:date('1963-06-09'), name:"Johnny Depp", bio:"John Christopher \"Johnny\" Depp II (born June 9, 1963 in Kentucky) is an American actor and musician.  He has been nominated for three Academy Awards and has won the Golden Globe and Screen Actors Guild Awards for Best Actor. \n\nDepp rose to prominence on the 1980s television series 21 Jump Street, becoming a teen idol...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/532tIC5wzmmR1jO7oA83rTiLvBx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85"}}, {tmdbId:"21412", properties:{bornIn:"Trenton, New Jersey, U.S.", imdbId:"0000504", born:date('1971-12-19'), name:"Amy Locane", bio:"Amy Rose Locane (born December 19, 1971) is an American television and film actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kzbLeGmII0LIiJ1efSwFr7D9zwh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/21412"}}, {tmdbId:"70182", properties:{bornIn:"Amiens, Somme, France", imdbId:"0110507", born:date('1966-11-22'), name:"Anne Brochet", bio:"Anne Brochet (born 22 November 1966) is a French comedienne and actress.  She has appeared in such films as Cyrano de Bergerac, Le temps des porte-plumes, 30 ans, Une journée de merde! and Tous les matins du monde.  She has also appeared in several episodes the television show Voici venir l'orage. . . .  Brochet won a César Award in the Best Supporting Actress category for her work in Tous les matins du monde.  She lived with actor Gad Elmaleh from 1998 to 2002 They had one son, Noé...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/54HWpxmTKuJuJ3MnUEfS0CQJjwj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70182"}}] AS row
