amara (born March 31, 1965) is an American actor. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article William McNamara, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yhDt7oJLDBXZQk7zL7munAyC8Xb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/18687"}}, {tmdbId:"133968", properties:{bornIn:"West Covina - California - USA", imdbId:"0577601", born:date('1972-12-01'), name:"Ron Melendez", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/133968"}}, {tmdbId:"133969", properties:{bornIn:"Skokie - Illinois - USA", imdbId:"0334398", born:date('1956-04-28'), name:"Nancy Lee Grahn", bio:"Nancy Lee Grahn is an actress and writer...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/133969"}}, {tmdbId:"12671", properties:{bornIn:"Beijing, China", imdbId:"0910947", born:date('1969-08-08'), name:"Faye Wong", bio:"Faye Wong is a Chinese singer-songwriter and actress, often referred to as a \"diva\" in Chinese-language media.  Early in her career she briefly used the stage name Shirley Wong...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aGNMbB8qM4d74RoZ4qvHTWCCHqR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/12671"}}, {tmdbId:"43661", properties:{bornIn:"Taipei, Taiwan", imdbId:"0437580", born:date('1973-10-11'), name:"Takeshi Kaneshiro", bio:"Takeshi Kaneshiro, born October 11, 1973, is a Taiwanese and Japanese actor of mixed heritage – his father is Ryukyuan and his mother is Taiwanese.  He speaks Japanese, Mandarin, Cantonese, Taiwanese Hokkien and English...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mOxNGub5nW9i35FQrg6gltW3PQd.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/43661"}}, {tmdbId:"23629", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"0641168", born:date('1969-12-20'), name:"Brian O'Halloran", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nBrian Christopher O'Halloran (born December 20, 1969) is an American actor best known for his roles in Kevin Smith's View Askewniverse films, notably as Dante Hicks in Smith's debut film Clerks and its 2006 sequel, Clerks II.  Aside from this, he has made small appearances in most of Smith's films, either as his Clerks character Dante Hicks or one of Dante's cousins...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2kuOeDJKV0M1oR2pFEjglLpmwqf.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23629"}}, {tmdbId:"23630", properties:{bornIn:"Monmouth County, New Jersey, USA", imdbId:"0026879", born:date('1970-04-21'), name:"Jeff Anderson", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nJeffrey Allan \"Jeff\" Anderson  (born April 21, 1970) is an American film actor, film director, and screenwriter best known for starring as Randal Graves in Clerks and Clerks II.  In between, he has appeared in other Kevin Smith-directed films and has written, directed, and starred in Now You Know...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zYiqTggru4hiR6szR88V17u1nm6.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23630"}}, {tmdbId:"23631", properties:{imdbId:"0003870", name:"Marilyn Ghigliotti", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23631"}}] AS row
