nown for her roles in the films Highlander III: The Sorcerer, Crash, The Game, Payback, The Hurricane, White Noise, Silent Hill, 88 Minutes and The Way...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/evY74tOR3o5zvU6lQFfRNNzE3y.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/13549"}}, {tmdbId:"134119", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0309637", born:date('1971-12-28'), name:"William Gates", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nWilliam Gates (28 December 1971 in Chicago, Illinois) is an American former high school and college basketball player and a subject of the 1994 Kartemquin Films documentary Hoop Dreams...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/134119"}}, {tmdbId:"134120", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, U.S.", imdbId:"0012932", born:date('1972-10-22'), name:"Arthur Agee", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nArthur \"Man\" Agee, Jr.  (born October 22, 1972) is one of two Chicago-area high school basketball players whose lives were chronicled in the 1994 Kartemquin Films documentary, Hoop Dreams...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/134120"}}, {tmdbId:"141828", properties:{imdbId:"0249924", name:"David Edwards", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/141828"}}, {tmdbId:"141827", properties:{imdbId:"0575168", name:"Angela Means", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/141827"}}] AS row
