e:"Natasha Henstridge", bio:"Natasha T.  Henstridge (born August 15, 1974) is a Canadian fashion model turned actress.  Her most notable on-screen roles include Species, The Whole Nine Yards, It Had To Be You, and the Canadian TV mini-series Would Be Kings, for which she won the Gemini Award for best actress.  Her most recent regular role was as Taylor Wethersby in the TV series Eli Stone. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Natasha Henstridge, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n9q8h6bur5Z5jGXc3tvz1MXndaL.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57395"}}, {tmdbId:"7471", properties:{bornIn:"Englewood, New Jersey, USA", imdbId:"0340260", born:date('1954-02-12'), name:"Zach Grenier", bio:"Zach Grenier is an American stage and screen actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fSyQKZO39sUsqY283GXiScOg3Hi.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/7471"}}, {tmdbId:"939584", properties:{bornIn:"Dunfermline, Fife, Scotland, UK", imdbId:"0026815", born:date('1947-08-10'), name:"Ian Anderson", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4DliLk3CLH3kNgc68yWVZgqwdZI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/939584"}}, {tmdbId:"91477", properties:{bornIn:"Redditch, Worcestershire, England", imdbId:"0094496", born:date('1948-05-31'), name:"John Bonham", bio:"An English musician and songwriter, best known as the drummer of Led Zeppelin.  Bonham was esteemed for his speed, power, fast right foot, distinctive sound, and \"feel\" for the groove.  He is widely considered to be one of the greatest drummers in the history of rock music.  Rolling Stone readers named him the \"best drummer of all time\" in 2011...", died:date('1980-09-25'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4TTNncdvgMsFCJv9at0kOodE99y.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/91477"}}, {tmdbId:"1229014", properties:{name:"Richard Ingram", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1229014"}}, {tmdbId:"2498659", properties:{name:"Laura Weekes", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2498659"}}, {tmdbId:"14", properties:{bornIn:"Metairie, Louisiana, USA", imdbId:"0001122", born:date('1958-01-26'), name:"Ellen DeGeneres", bio:"Ellen DeGeneres is an American stand-up comic, television host, and actress.  She hosts the syndicated talk show The Ellen DeGeneres Show, and was also a judge on American Idol for one year, having joined the show in its ninth season. \n\nDeGeneres has hosted both the Academy Awards and the Primetime Emmys.  As a film actress, she starred in Mr...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/z8IEEid4z63CBlJtxrTKEfsW7NA.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/14"}}, {tmdbId:"30488", properties:{bornIn:"Washington, District of Columbia, USA", imdbId:"0762153", born:date('1951-11-16'), name:"Miguel Sandoval", bio:"Miguel Sandoval  (born November 16, 1951) is an American film and television actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/v5tHxTkgOqcdWgjoEhUj0a50NIK.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/30488"}}, {tmdbId:"186573", properties:{imdbId:"0241033", born:date('1987-04-15'), name:"Zack Duhame", bio:"Doubles: Ben Foster, Shia LaBeouf...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/186573"}}, {tmdbId:"553473", properties:{imdbId:"0772432", name:"Katie Schlossberg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/553473"}}, {tmdbId:"9188", properties:{bornIn:"Anderston, Glasgow, Scotland, UK", imdbId:"0175262", born:date('1942-11-24'), name:"Billy Connolly", bio:"A Scottish comedian, musician, presenter and actor.  He is sometimes known, especially in his native Scotland, by the nickname The Big Yin (The Big One).  His first trade, in the early 1960s, was as a welder (specifically a boilermaker) in the Glasgow shipyards, but he gave it up towards the end of the decade to pursue a career as a folk singer in the Humblebums and subsequently as a soloist...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/imqsEA1EPet7OvHx80VfTYfFcWf.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/9188"}}, {tmdbId:"12094", properties:{bornIn:"Sleaford, Lincolnshire, England, UK", imdbId:"0766837", born:date('1958-07-12'), name:"Jennifer Saunders", bio:"Jennifer Jane Saunders is an English comedienne, screenwriter, singer and actress.  She has won two BAFTAs, an International Emmy Award, a British Comedy Award, a Rose d'Or Light Entertainment Festival Award, two Writers' Guild of Great Britain Awards, and a Peoples Choice Award. \n\nShe first came into widespread attention in the 1980s and early 1990s when she became a member of The Comic Strip after graduating from the Central School of Speech and Drama...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pTgxwHcz9L8SNVYvPJS0o0lgHya.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/12094"}}, {tmdbId:"19996", properties:{bornIn:"Orpington, London, England, UK", imdbId:"0084107", born:date('1980-06-18'), name:"Kevin Bishop", bio:"Kevin Brian Bishop is an English actor and comedian, best known for The Kevin Bishop Show, which he co-wrote with Lee Hupfield...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uiRRSgBK05xrjzGecbp2Oz8SYN8.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19996"}}, {tmdbId:"30019", properties:{imdbId:"0064546", born:date('1958-11-06'), name:"Trace Beaulieu", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nTrace Beaulieu (born November 6, 1958) is an American puppeteer, writer, and actor.  He is best known for his roles on Mystery Science Theater 3000 (MST3K). \n\n \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Trace Beaulieu, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2AB4g7ZSEU3Q5C5Bt6xthvOYK87.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/30019"}}] AS row
