llhättan, Älvsborgs län, Sweden [now Västra Götalands län, Sweden]", imdbId:"0137907", born:date('1981-08-04'), name:"Erica Carlson", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lUsE6fLvwTta4HwI0bELnM2rKzf.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70095"}}, {tmdbId:"70094", properties:{bornIn:"Trollhättan, Älvsborgs län, Sweden [now Västra Götalands län, Sweden]", imdbId:"0751798", born:date('1982-03-24'), name:"Mathias Rust", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70094"}}, {tmdbId:"22063", properties:{bornIn:"Leeds, West Yorkshire, England, UK ", imdbId:"0289656", born:date('1968-03-14'), name:"James Frain", bio:"A British stage, film and television actor, best known for playing Thomas Cromwell in the television series \"The Tudors\".  He graduated in Drama and Film from the University of East Anglia, Norwich, England, UK, and went on to study acting at London's Central School of Speech and Drama...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tQLuwlPodwk8CWd3ly067s1x1dh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/22063"}}, {tmdbId:"18616", properties:{bornIn:"Everton, Liverpool, England, UK", imdbId:"0607375", born:date('1964-06-21'), name:"David Morrissey", bio:"David Mark Morrissey (born 21 June 1964) is an English actor and director.  Morrissey grew up in the Kensington and Knotty Ash areas of Liverpool.  He learned to act at the Everyman Youth Theatre, alongside Ian Hart, Mark and Stephen McGann, and Cathy Tyson.  At the age of 18, he and Hart were cast in the television series One Summer (1983), which won them recognition throughout the country...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n26A1ikHCBoCL6nsVvY1P17XPxK.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/18616"}}, {tmdbId:"39678", properties:{bornIn:"Irvine, Ayrshire, Scotland, UK", imdbId:"0012683", born:date('1953-01-30'), name:"Rab Affleck", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/39678"}}, {tmdbId:"24564", properties:{imdbId:"0019336", name:"Stéphane Algoud", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lNX3IXAddKvlrZUjd7F7ochqrUP.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/24564"}}, {tmdbId:"214644", properties:{imdbId:"0032485", name:"Edwin Apps", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/214644"}}, {tmdbId:"1715", properties:{bornIn:"Springs, South Africa", imdbId:"0047549", born:date('1937-12-04'), name:"David Bailie", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jt1BtEWsFB4ghrZhpwGkGWmibCb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1715"}}, {tmdbId:"78018", properties:{bornIn:"Stockholm, Sweden", imdbId:"0179680", born:date('1950-04-02'), name:"Allan Corduner", bio:"Allan Corduner (born 2 April 1950) is an English actor born in Stockholm to a German mother and a Russo-Finnish father.  He grew up in a secular Jewish home in London.  After earning a BA (Hons) in English and Drama at Bristol University he trained at the Bristol Old Vic Theatre School.  He has worked extensively on stage, TV, and film, both in the UK and in the United States.  His voice is familiar from many BBC radio plays, audio books and TV documentaries...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9bZTEBUjY02UeooNnghZXxKfiO7.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/78018"}}, {tmdbId:"1219786", properties:{imdbId:"0810058", born:date('1964-09-23'), name:"Sukie Smith", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ivxNsJx7rSEBoUdGR9A9ldnU83l.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1219786"}}, {tmdbId:"2501130", properties:{name:"Roger Heathcott", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2501130"}}, {tmdbId:"10750", properties:{bornIn:"Kennett, Missouri, USA", imdbId:"0002028", born:date('1962-02-11'), name:"Sheryl Crow", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nSheryl Suzanne Crow (born February 11, 1962) is an American singer-songwriter, record producer, musician, and actress.  Her music incorporates elements of rock, folk, hip hop, country and pop.  She has won nine Grammy Awards from the National Academy of Recording Arts and Sciences...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sdUg1uajdH78Bq0ARjxQqCUkYxh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/10750"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"21978", properties:{bornIn:"Glasgow, Scotland, UK", imdbId:"0328765", born:date('1962-01-01'), name:"Louise Goodall", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/k4YGC99QtEVpCMQezJnPUewQmEj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/21978"}}, {tmdbId:"1839", properties:{imdbId:"0570670", born:date('1964-05-13'), name:"Lorraine McIntosh", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lIpIsKU1GdKxI0eL6wJFL3uzQT7.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1839"}}, {tmdbId:"28640", properties:{bornIn:"Shaker Heights, Ohio, USA", imdbId:"0788340", born:date('1964-09-16'), name:"Molly Shannon", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nMolly Helen Shannon (born September 16, 1964) is an American comic actress best known for her work as a cast member on Saturday Night Live from 1995–2001 and for starring in the films Superstar and Year of the Dog.  More recently, she starred in NBC's Kath &amp; Kim from 2008–2009 and on the TBS animated series Neighbors from Hell...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gFuqGF0IO4e9IjiJYAvGI9205Sq.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28640"}}, {tmdbId:"52794", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, U.S.", imdbId:"0379114", born:date('1967-02-20'), name:"David Herman", bio:"David Herman (born February 20, 1967) is an American actor, comedian and voice actor best known as an original cast member of MADtv and for his role as Michael Bolton in Office Space.  He is also known for his voice roles on television programs such as Futurama and King of the Hill. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article David Herman, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rMY168K2qAk5eBg368WK3y2yOEI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52794"}}, {tmdbId:"20666", properties:{bornIn:"Paris, France", imdbId:"0618651", born:date('1961-07-02'), name:"Samy Naceri", bio:"Samy Naceri was born on July 2, 1961 in Paris, France as Saïd Naceri.  He is an actor and producer, known for Taxi (1998), Taxi Taxi (2000) and Léon - Der Profi (1994).  He has been married to Marie Guillard since 2005.  His father Djilali comes from Algeria and his mother Jacqueline from Normandy.  Samy grew up in modest circumstances with seven siblings.  An older brother died of complications from drug use.  Naceris father left the family when he was 16 years old...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yT3QZbpp6Pd6xJ2FzxESQ7sDudm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20666"}}, {tmdbId:"23943", properties:{bornIn:"Saint-Mandé, Val-de-Marne, France", imdbId:"0225899", born:date('1968-07-26'), name:"Frédéric Diefenthal", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8PTUTBeUACLVpt8waRgkyGnsEBk.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23943"}}, {tmdbId:"8293", properties:{bornIn:"Paris, France", imdbId:"0182839", born:date('1975-09-30'), name:"Marion Cotillard", bio:"Marion Cotillard (born 30 September 1975) is a French actress.  She garnered critical acclaim for her roles in films such as My Sex Life. . .  or How I Got Into an Argument, Taxi, Furia, Pretty Things and Inception. \n\nShe won the Academy Award for Best Actress, BAFTA Award for Best Actress, César for Best Actress and the Golden Globe for Best Actress in Musical or a Comedy for her portrayal of French singer Édith Piaf in La Vie en Rose...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1RAG22zsofkiAJkZm0qb5q4OQaT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/8293"}}, {tmdbId:"23983", properties:{imdbId:"0332659", born:date('1949-07-10'), name:"Manuela Gourary", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xrIzHhIY3qD90Lbw91quTBZDTpk.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23983"}}, {tmdbId:"4455", properties:{bornIn:"Odense, Denmark", imdbId:"0860947", born:date('1963-12-06'), name:"Ulrich Thomsen", bio:"Ulrich Thomsen is a Danish actor.  Thomsen was born in Fyn, Denmark and graduated from the Danish National School of Theatre and Contemporary Dance in 1993, after which playing on several theatres in Copenhagen, such as Dr.  Dantes Aveny, Mungo Park and Østre Gasværks Teater.  His film debut was in 1994 in Nattevagten, (Nightwatch) directed by Ole Bornedal...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/e1XN63iALgaAc9gKAvd4uG2ljws.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4455"}}, {tmdbId:"4456", properties:{imdbId:"0605786", born:date('1928-08-03'), name:"Henning Moritzen", died:date('2012-08-11'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eR3ZbtLcgUQVD7fRvMVYGT5InBn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4456"}}, {tmdbId:"4457", properties:{imdbId:"0488917", born:date('1963-11-27'), name:"Thomas Bo Larsen", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3j2Iq6wkpgNwKz1H2kkywKB6go.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4457"}}, {tmdbId:"4458", properties:{bornIn:"Frederiksberg, Denmark", imdbId:"0824785", born:date('1964-11-03'), name:"Paprika Steen", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nPaprika Steen (born 3 November 1964) is a Danish actress and film director best known for her performances in the films Festen, The Idiots and Open Hearts.  Steen was the first Danish actress since Karin Nellemose in 1949 to win both Best Actress (for Okay) and Best Supporting Actress (Open Hearts) in the same year at the Robert Festival, the Danish equivalent of the Oscars...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iolKUDKp6sxWoclOOosRgyEbp4z.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4458"}}, {tmdbId:"6120", properties:{bornIn:"Denmark", imdbId:"0433697", born:date('1961-03-03'), name:"Bodil Jørgensen", bio:"Bodil Jørgensen (born 3 March 1961) is a Danish film actress.  She has appeared in 40 films since 1992.  She starred in The Idiots, which was entered into the 1998 Cannes Film Festival. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Bodil Jørgensen, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aYUOgjqBMJgQOTn6VWN6O7JYxM4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6120"}}, {tmdbId:"6121", properties:{bornIn:"Bogense, Denmark", imdbId:"0016850", born:date('1965-01-03'), name:"Jens Albinus", bio:"Jens Albinus (born 3 January 1965 in Bogense) is a Danish actor.  Description above from the Wikipedia article Jens Albinus, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wJbiOWFsumcIlgaXcYdYpcrBtWx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6121"}}, {tmdbId:"6122", properties:{bornIn:"Horsens, Denmark", imdbId:"0368482", born:date('1967-09-17'), name:"Anne Louise Hassing", bio:"​Anne Louise Hassing er en dansk skuespiller, der er uddannet fra Statens Teaterskole i 1997.  Hun er datter af overlæge Folmer Hassing Nielsen og børnetandlæge Linnea Rasmussen.   Hun filmdebuterede i Nils Malmros' Kærlighedens smerte (1992), for hvilken hun vandt både en Robert og en Bodil for bedste kvindelige hovedrolle.  Hun fik igen en Bodil i 1999 - denne gang for sin næste filmpræstation i Lars von Triers Idioterne...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jrurcCEvLmYG9010wA7nGoC79Nn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6122"}}, {tmdbId:"6123", properties:{imdbId:"0527937", born:date('1966-10-15'), name:"Troels Lyby", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wZViPCp2ESCQ1j1HCj8u7WWIOrq.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6123"}}, {tmdbId:"11282", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"0822062", born:date('1934-08-16'), name:"John Standing", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nSir John Ronald Leon Standing, 4th Baronet (born 16 August 1934) is an English actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/m3vyuNLRH0k4SShJGhvEsOKfEKu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11282"}}, {tmdbId:"69032", properties:{imdbId:"0216221", name:"Matthew Delamere", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/69032"}}, {tmdbId:"70230", properties:{imdbId:"0857458", name:"Jeremy Theobald", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wa2vU6NXa2t4WN1vTXTnojN0irT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70230"}}, {tmdbId:"70224", properties:{imdbId:"0369918", name:"Alex Haw", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eTqvHRjfRIMzKdHP2zSED2QVUES.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70224"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"28749", properties:{bornIn:"England, UK", imdbId:"0751301", born:date('1972-01-01'), name:"Lucy Russell", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nLucy Russell (born 1972) is an English actress, possibly best known for starring as Grace Elliott in Éric Rohmer's L'Anglaise et le duc (English: The Lady and the Duke).  Her first starring role was in Christopher Nolan's Following.  They met at University College, London, where Nolan studied English and Russell Italian. \n\nIn 2002 she was named as one of European films' \"Shooting Stars\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6aNWltms1Imbl9J4aXWk4p2KRZX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28749"}}, {tmdbId:"70225", properties:{bornIn:"London - England - UK", imdbId:"0634297", born:date('1938-04-22'), name:"John Nolan", bio:"John Nolan is an actor...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70225"}}, {tmdbId:"140898", properties:{bornIn:"Poughkeepsie, New York, USA", imdbId:"0820767", born:date('1944-01-31'), name:"Michael St. Michaels", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/140898"}}, {tmdbId:"2017390", properties:{name:"Douglass Bell", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2017390"}}, {tmdbId:"1806276", properties:{name:"Al Millan", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1806276"}}, {tmdbId:"1231399", properties:{imdbId:"0682070", name:"Matthew Pidgeon", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gvVPBKpZtJLZSH9putW78Cb17hb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1231399"}}, {tmdbId:"1211862", properties:{bornIn:" Malaysia", imdbId:"0659373", born:date('1966-01-08'), name:"Adrian Pang", bio:"Adrian Pang Yeow Soon is a Malaysian-born, Singapore-based actor and TV host...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fOSFPav79lx1YmSj1R1IrsZ87On.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1211862"}}, {tmdbId:"583346", properties:{imdbId:"0848872", name:"Medaline Tan", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/583346"}}, {tmdbId:"551618", properties:{bornIn:"Singapore", born:date('1973-10-29'), name:"Pierre Png", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bOuCGjhZMbWHlvM6grenqOD7dcu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/551618"}}, {tmdbId:"583254", properties:{imdbId:"0290081", name:"Anna Belle Francis", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/583254"}}, {tmdbId:"10860", properties:{bornIn:"Ely, Minnesota, USA", imdbId:"0004754", born:date('1982-03-03'), name:"Jessica Biel", bio:"Jessica Biel is an American actress, model and singer. \n\nShe began her career as a vocalist appearing in musical productions until she was cast as Mary Camden in the family-drama series 7th Heaven.  Biel has since starred in many films, including The Rules of Attraction, The Texas Chainsaw Massacre, Blade: Trinity, Stealth, I Now Pronounce You Chuck and Larry, The A-Team, and The Truth About Emanuel...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/u5DzbWKvAzS0M4ZhYqpUR9MZr2M.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/10860"}}, {tmdbId:"56487", properties:{bornIn:"New Haven, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"0492220", born:date('1981-03-01'), name:"Adam LaVorgna", bio:"Adam LaVorgna (born March 1, 1981) is an American actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hWZuLvqVIPRQGbpkDbgsVv1Drbt.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/56487"}}, {tmdbId:"35551", properties:{bornIn:"Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"0004748", born:date('1972-05-01'), name:"Julie Benz", bio:"Julie M.  Benz (born May 1, 1972) is an American actress, best known for her role as Rita Bennett on Dexter, for which she won the 2006 Satellite Award for Best Actress in a Supporting Role in a Series, Mini-Series or Motion Picture Made for Television.  She starred on the series No Ordinary Family until it was cancelled on May 13, 2011.  Among her previous well-known roles was Darla on Buffy the Vampire Slayer and Angel.  She will star in the upcoming CBS show A Gifted Man...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4rLq98jWRAOJIMzGZW0bB5Y6fGX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/35551"}}, {tmdbId:"20750", properties:{bornIn:"Detroit - Michigan - USA", imdbId:"0339460", born:date('1975-07-20'), name:"Judy Greer", bio:"Judy Greer (born July 20, 1975, height, 5' 8\" (1,73 m)) is an American actress known for portraying a string of supporting characters, including Kitty Sanchez on the Fox/Netflix series Arrested Development and Cheryl Tunt on the animated comedy series Archer.  Greer has had a supporting role in a number of romantic comedy films, including The Wedding Planner, 13 Going on 30, 27 Dresses and Love and Other Drugs.  She also had a supporting role in the 2011 film The Descendants...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jW4ui3qQj7kH34OsmcNRsJ9fSdQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20750"}}, {tmdbId:"1115237", properties:{imdbId:"0934965", born:date('1892-08-14'), name:"Paul Wing", died:date('1957-05-29'), url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1115237"}}, {tmdbId:"36802", properties:{bornIn:"Detroit - Michigan - USA", imdbId:"0834626", born:date('1925-02-02'), name:"Elaine Stritch", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nElaine Bawson Stritch (born February 2, 1925)  is an American actress  and vocalist.  She has appeared in numerous stage plays and musicals,  feature films, and many television programs.  She is known for her  performance of \"The Ladies Who Lunch\" in Stephen Sondheim's 1970 musical  Company, her 2001 one-woman show Elaine Stritch at Liberty, and  recently for her role as Jack Donaghy's mother Colleen on NBC's 30 Rock...", died:date('2014-07-17'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5OzcpY0VflrCJlgimHcpSpPAt45.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/36802"}}, {tmdbId:"108665", properties:{imdbId:"0157644", name:"Daniel Chilson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/108665"}}, {tmdbId:"58113", properties:{imdbId:"0486174", name:"Niklaus Lange", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58113"}}, {tmdbId:"108668", properties:{bornIn:"Herndon, Virginia, USA", imdbId:"0359534", born:date('1971-11-26'), name:"Don Handfield", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/108668"}}, {tmdbId:"108669", properties:{imdbId:"0141779", name:"Linna Carter", bio:"Linna Carter is an actress and director...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/108669"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"24264", properties:{bornIn:"Glasgow, Scotland, UK", imdbId:"0272401", born:date('1962-05-17'), name:"Craig Ferguson", bio:"Craig Ferguson (born 17 May 1962) is a Scottish-born, naturalized American television host, stand-up comedian, writer, actor, director, and producer.  He is the host of The Late Late Show with Craig Ferguson, an Emmy Award-nominated, Peabody Award-winning late-night talk show that airs on CBS.  In addition to hosting that program and performing stand-up comedy, Ferguson has written two books: Between the Bridge and the River, a novel, and American on Purpose, an autobiography...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sN9x6gELldBvQ9cuRUBSLl8MVf8.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/24264"}}, {tmdbId:"167449", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"0486413", born:date('1949-04-14'), name:"Chris Langham", bio:"Christopher Langham is an English writer, actor, and comedian.  He is known for playing the cabinet minister Hugh Abbot in the BBC Four sitcom The Thick of It, and as presenter Roy Mallard in People Like Us, first on BBC Radio 4 and later on its transfer to television on BBC Two, where Mallard is almost entirely an unseen character.  He subsequently created several spoof adverts in the same vein...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/167449"}}, {tmdbId:"70440", properties:{bornIn:"Montreal, Quebec, Canada", imdbId:"0303981", born:date('1936-09-22'), name:"Robin Gammell", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aCbZa9rJOeGWfAVUJT6a22RgzBG.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70440"}}, {tmdbId:"86044", properties:{bornIn:"Chadderton, Greater Manchester, England, UK", imdbId:"0038673", born:date('1977-01-13'), name:"William Ash", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nWilliam Ash, (born 13 January 1977) is a British TV and film actor.  His appearances include Mad About Mambo, Lilies, Burn It, All the King's Men, A Midsummer Night's Dream, Doctor Who and more recently Hush and Waterloo Road.  He began his career in the ITV series Where the Heart Is.  His stage credits include the premiere production of How to Disappear Completely and Never Be Found with Sheffield Theatres...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pQgdzvRQVT3gDItNptsHhaCdRiU.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/86044"}}, {tmdbId:"2263875", properties:{name:"Maclean Stewart", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2263875"}}, {tmdbId:"943211", properties:{imdbId:"0516385", name:"Tim Loane", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/943211"}}, {tmdbId:"6548", properties:{bornIn:"Saint-Malo, Ille-et-Vilaine, France", imdbId:"0719224", born:date('1966-11-24'), name:"Isabelle Renauld", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sFCZqQFyxiznqsCIJZ1FPDNqgLQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6548"}}, {tmdbId:"121732", properties:{bornIn:"Milan, Lombardy, Italy", imdbId:"0072768", born:date('1957-01-04'), name:"Fabrizio Bentivoglio", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nFabrizio Bentivoglio (born January 4, 1957) is an Italian cinema and theatre actor and a screenwriter. \n\nFabrizio Bentivoglio was born in Milan (his father is Venetian).  After only one season in the juvenile team of Inter, he left his sporting career because of an injury to his left knee and attended the school of the Piccolo Teatro in Milan.  He debuted on stage acting in Timone d'Atene by William Shakespeare and also pursued his artistic career in cinema...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sza1QBzHUEKLvri5muqaDRa8uXn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/121732"}}, {tmdbId:"150568", properties:{imdbId:"0804093", name:"Achileas Skevis", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/150568"}}, {tmdbId:"51391", properties:{bornIn:"Ridgewood, New Jersey, USA", imdbId:"0005260", born:date('1985-12-05'), name:"Frankie Muniz", bio:"Frankie Muniz (born December 5, 1985) is a former American child actor.  He is best known for his role as Malcolm in the family sitcom Malcom in the Middle...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tBckW8eJHv4vz8B3DJYH1rLAtyN.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/51391"}}, {tmdbId:"65437", properties:{bornIn:"Beppu, Ōita Prefecture, Japan", imdbId:"0412585", born:date('1970-02-18'), name:"Junko Iwao", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nJunko Iwao (岩男 潤子, Iwao Junko, born February 18, 1970 in Beppu, Ōita) is a Japanese voice actress and singer.  Her most notable role is in Cardcaptor Sakura, providing the voice to Sakura's best friend and cousin, Tomoyo Daidōji.  She also voiced lead character Mima Kirigoe in Perfect Blue,[3] Ceres in Ceres, Celestial Legend, and Kikyo in Hunter x Hunter...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65437"}}, {tmdbId:"65424", properties:{bornIn:"Yokohama, Kanagawa Prefecture, Japan", imdbId:"0559551", born:date('1968-11-30'), name:"Rica Matsumoto", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ykm6ZpLcX5wblCNp7rOAoZpCh3L.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65424"}}, {tmdbId:"65438", properties:{bornIn:"Chiba, Japan", imdbId:"0875320", born:date('1956-10-20'), name:"Shinpachi Tsuji", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nShinpachi Tsuji (born October 20, 1956 in Chiba prefecture) is a Japanese voice actor. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Shinpachi Tsuji, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nZWaQaXSpGMSWm8D9v5v62XS71U.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65438"}}, {tmdbId:"1685", properties:{imdbId:"0959991", name:"Masaaki Ôkura", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lQmV0Nzww7i3cmbr2ToqGJ5q6qr.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1685"}}, {tmdbId:"5444", properties:{bornIn:"Paris, France", imdbId:"0619600", born:date('1938-12-24'), name:"Philippe Nahon", bio:"Philippe Nahon (24 December 1938 - 19 April 2020) was a French actor.  Nahon is best known for his roles in French horror and thriller films, including I Stand Alone, Humains, Calvaire, Irréversible, The Pack and Haute Tension, and he has been featured as a nameless butcher in three films by Gaspar Noé – Carne, I Stand Alone, and Irréversible (cameo)...", died:date('2020-04-19'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/t3MmEzK38r2dKgARwE8VPLNOO3K.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/5444"}}, {tmdbId:"17614", properties:{imdbId:"0502133", name:"Blandine Lenoir", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bGEI9iE02Gii7jixkE41PtuGnm7.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17614"}}, {tmdbId:"17618", properties:{imdbId:"0656803", name:"Frankie Pain", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2Jn8zDKxb6fw69zYJU75ONHWUXb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17618"}}, {tmdbId:"17617", properties:{imdbId:"0041626", name:"Martine Audrain", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17617"}}, {tmdbId:"178452", properties:{imdbId:"0347909", born:date('1962-04-01'), name:"Tony Guma", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/178452"}}, {tmdbId:"1338646", properties:{imdbId:"0234779", name:"Rami Doueiri", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1338646"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"1338647", properties:{imdbId:"3353014", name:"Naamar Sahli", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1338647"}}, {tmdbId:"1338648", properties:{imdbId:"0150124", name:"Mohamad Chamas", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1338648"}}, {tmdbId:"1338649", properties:{imdbId:"0015635", name:"Rola Al Amin", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1338649"}}, {tmdbId:"19", properties:{bornIn:"Boston, Massachusetts, USA", imdbId:"0005049", born:date('1959-11-19'), name:"Allison Janney", bio:"Allison Brooks Janney (born November 19, 1959) is an American actress born in Boston, Massachusetts who studied at Kenyon College where she studied under Paul Newman.  Janney pursued acting partially due to Newman's encouragement, going on to study drama at the Neighborhood Playhouse and the Royal Academy of Dramatic Art.  Janney rose to prominence for her role as White House Press Secretary (and later Chief of Staff) C. J.  Cregg on the television series The West Wing...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cDcB8mKP1GiIeoM3Qe7GIucs0iv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19"}}, {tmdbId:"58520", properties:{imdbId:"0645711", name:"Daniel Okrent", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/FCkRrWHbhOQgpb5w9dkX2DFLqv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58520"}}, {tmdbId:"28040", properties:{imdbId:"0602821", name:"Dan Moran", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28040"}}, {tmdbId:"16921", properties:{bornIn:"Levallois-Perret, Hauts-de-Seine, France", imdbId:"0183660", born:date('1969-04-03'), name:"Clotilde Courau", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nClotilde, Princess of Venice and Piedmont (née Clotilde Marie Pascale Courau 3 April 1969) is a French actress, and the wife of Emanuele Filiberto, a member of the House of Savoy and the grandson of the last king of Italy. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Clotide, Princess of Venice and Piedmont, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jSy63zL0jdoQsSGzbUFZICZIrpW.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/16921"}}, {tmdbId:"13635", properties:{bornIn:"Washington, D.C., USA", imdbId:"0005060", born:date('1967-09-20'), name:"Kristen Johnston", bio:"Kristen Johnston studied acting at the Atlantic Theater Company Acting School in New York City. \n\nShe won two Emmys for her role on 3rd Rock from the Sun (1996).  She has appeared on many other television shows, including Ugly Betty (2006), ER (1994), Bored to Death (2009) and, perhaps most memorably, as the party girl whose famous final words were \"I'm so bored I could die\" on Sex and the City (1998)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/am4NUVEhhaIVjaojq8XXBmtVWkz.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/13635"}}, {tmdbId:"13636", properties:{bornIn:"Parsippany, New Jersey, USA", imdbId:"0005105", born:date('1968-10-11'), name:"Jane Krakowski", bio:"Jane Krakowski (born October 11, 1968) is an American actress and singer.  She is known for playing Elaine Vassal on Ally McBeal and Jenna Maroney on 30 Rock, winning Screen Actors Guild Awards for both roles.  She also regularly performs on the stage, winning a Tony Award for her performance in Nine, and an Olivier Award for Guys and Dolls in London's West End. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jane Krakowski, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia ...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/25PXq7sobZZbrqiNW8mpvQHLoyI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/13636"}}, {tmdbId:"25461", properties:{bornIn:"Chiyoda, Tokyo, Japan", imdbId:"0435299", born:date('1947-03-24'), name:"Meiko Kaji", bio:"Meiko Kaji , born Masako Ôta, is a Japanese actress and enka singer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vX5QZ9oyncMWL6zyhhVycepN4tm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25461"}}, {tmdbId:"25463", properties:{bornIn:"Yokohama, Kanagawa Prefecture, Japan", imdbId:"0475910", born:date('1944-02-04'), name:"Toshio Kurosawa", bio:"Toshio Kurosawa (黒沢年雄) was born on February 4, 1944 in Yokohama, Kanagawa, Japan.  He is an actor, known for Lady Snowblood (1973), Urutora Q (1965) and Samurai Assassin (1965)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5B8Q0HCgrKwxi5gGzBWrmWs9MVy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25463"}}, {tmdbId:"25464", properties:{bornIn:"Takasago, Hyogo Prefecture, Japan", imdbId:"0197379", born:date('1949-03-10'), name:"Masaaki Daimon", bio:"Masaaki Daimon is an actor, known for Godzilla contre Mecanik Monster (1974), Shurayukihime (1973) and Tempyo no iraka (1980)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tAGRwj3jjubukWYr5N3TB1HJjiX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25464"}}, {tmdbId:"25465", properties:{imdbId:"0015128", name:"Miyoko Akaza", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cWOQQSyPKNcqQcbzDiYNZPxg3jM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25465"}}, {tmdbId:"64182", properties:{bornIn:"Yardley, Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"0057321", name:"Bill Barretta", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nBill Barretta has been performing with the Muppets since 1991, when he performed the body of family father Earl Sinclair on Dinosaurs.  He later developed several new characters on Muppets Tonight, including Pepe the King Prawn, Johnny Fiama and Bobo the Bear. \n\nAlong with having his own Muppet characters, Bill has taken over several of Jim Henson's roles, such as Dr...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7QLC4U4iL1cdCd1WDJgk3FmDW1w.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/64182"}}, {tmdbId:"6542", properties:{bornIn:"Covington, Tennessee, USA", imdbId:"0005002", born:date('1942-08-20'), name:"Isaac Hayes", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia  Isaac Lee Hayes, Jr.  (August 20, 1942 – August 10, 2008) was an American songwriter, musician, singer, and occasionally an actor.  Hayes was one of the creative influences behind the southern soul music label Stax Records, where he served both as an in-house songwriter and as a record producer, teaming with his partner David Porter during the mid-1960s...", died:date('2008-08-10'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wHZOIi0LJNZ55dswVMX5AqKtMlT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6542"}}, {tmdbId:"935934", properties:{imdbId:"0869089", name:"Pep Tosar", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/smKTVFGwQxxB7xViCg7pp3TST9R.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/935934"}}, {tmdbId:"1681778", properties:{name:"Jordi Tarrida", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1681778"}}, {tmdbId:"1681779", properties:{name:"Ángel Tarris", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1681779"}}, {tmdbId:"1068684", properties:{imdbId:"0171731", name:"Xevi Collellmir", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1068684"}}, {tmdbId:"1803535", properties:{name:"Thomas Goodridge", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1803535"}}] AS row
