ornIn:"St. Pölten, Austria", imdbId:"0496441", born:date('1951-07-30'), name:"Erwin Leder", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nErwin Alois Robert Leder (born 30 July 1951 in St.  Pölten, Lower Austria, Austria) is an Austrian actor.  He is best known for his role as Chief Mechanic Johann in Das Boot, a 1981 feature film directed by Wolfgang Petersen about a mission of one World War II U-boat and its crew. \n\nIn 2003, Leder appeared as the lycan scientist Singe in the gothic horror/action film Underworld.  He reprised his role in the sequel in a brief cameo as a corpse...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4V6ewUr0KAMl8C2xvWvg8JPjsab.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/3970"}}, {tmdbId:"83866", properties:{bornIn:"Hefenhofen, Switzerland", imdbId:"0402234", born:date('1953-05-07'), name:"Robert Hunger-Bühler", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uaiGySybwRbO00aPNOu6wpDoNfz.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83866"}}, {tmdbId:"83867", properties:{imdbId:"0704850", name:"Silvia Rabenreither", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83867"}}, {tmdbId:"83868", properties:{imdbId:"0819735", name:"Karin Springer", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83868"}}, {tmdbId:"1894", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0004790", born:date('1976-08-23'), name:"Scott Caan", bio:"Scott Andrew Caan (born August 23, 1976) is an American actor.  He stars in the CBS television series Hawaii Five-0.  He is the son of actor James Caan...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/67V8YrMglGzvuTOZGpqygDhNK1z.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1894"}}, {tmdbId:"240275", properties:{imdbId:"0396796", born:date('1971-04-20'), name:"Allan Houston", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/240275"}}, {tmdbId:"4133", properties:{bornIn:"Key Largo, Florida, USA", imdbId:"0004709", born:date('1979-04-25'), name:"Giuseppe Andrews", bio:"Giuseppe Andrews (born Joey Andrews; April 25, 1979) is an American film actor, writer, and director known for his roles as Lex in the 1999 film Detroit Rock City, a bizarre sheriff's deputy in Cabin Fever (2002), a small role in Never Been Kissed (1999), as well as appearances in The Smashing Pumpkins videos \"1979\" and \"Perfect\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bnz3wNaeUI6Biq389PmuAvgrmOy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4133"}}, {tmdbId:"35768", properties:{bornIn:"Hartford, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"0004867", born:date('1980-06-09'), name:"James DeBello", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nJames DeBello (born June 9, 1980) is an American film actor. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article James DeBello, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gINKuNS2Btou5ndJqFulojvKav5.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/35768"}}, {tmdbId:"53492", properties:{bornIn:"Peterborough, New Hampshire, USA", imdbId:"0403134", born:date('1982-04-01'), name:"Sam Huntington", bio:"Sam Huntington (born April 1, 1982) is an American actor.  He is best known for his starring role as Josh Levison, a werewolf in the Syfy series Being Human, and for his role as Jimmy Olsen in the superhero film Superman Returns.  For its two seasons from September 2015 to April 2017, Huntington had a recurring role on the Fox series Rosewood.  He also played Mimi-Siku Cromwell in the Disney movie Jungle 2 Jungle.  He also had a cameo in the December 2017 USA Network TV-film Psych: The Movie...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2g45h4mb0zjDxyhrl3pJF2mQaGC.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53492"}}, {tmdbId:"7708", properties:{bornIn:"Beirut, Lebanon", imdbId:"0451376", born:date('1958-09-06'), name:"Arsinée Khanjian", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   Arsinée Khanjian (born 1958 in Beirut, Lebanon Արսինէ Խանճեան) is an Armenian-Canadian actress and producer.  In addition to her independent work and stage roles, she is regularly cast by her husband, Canadian filmmaker Atom Egoyan, in his films.  She has a bachelor's degree in French and Spanish from Concordia University and a master's degree in political science from the University of Toronto...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/esBqKPyFIMVKzp5Tqja0qqrxSLl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/7708"}}, {tmdbId:"20054", properties:{bornIn:"Kilcoole, Wicklow, Ireland", imdbId:"0144187", born:date('1979-12-31'), name:"Elaine Cassidy", bio:"Elaine Cassidy (born December 31, 1979) is an Irish actress best known for Harper's Island, Felicia's Journey, Disco Pigs and The Others...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20054"}}, {tmdbId:"28002", properties:{bornIn:"Willimantic, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"0868110", born:date('1937-08-04'), name:"John Tormey", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28002"}}, {tmdbId:"2511130", properties:{name:"Dennis Liu", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2511130"}}, {tmdbId:"27559", properties:{imdbId:"0249378", born:date('1975-08-22'), name:"Matthew Edison", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hYMwq4AP58Sr3YlmUeCMyFBUQdG.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/27559"}}] AS row
