001).  He has appeared in numerous French TV series and productions, including most of the films directed by Jean-Pierre Jeunet.  He had the lead role in the movie Train de vie (1998), an award-winning tragicomedy about the Holocaust...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aC6rEJrBgCNjeG6vetJPBdgj5h3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2407"}}, {tmdbId:"32162", properties:{bornIn:"Cairo, Egypt", imdbId:"0361824", born:date('1919-02-10'), name:"Clément Harari", died:date('2008-05-16'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iVykmgZ9Ue5qIQ7mNczefwNVXN8.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/32162"}}, {tmdbId:"21659", properties:{bornIn:"Vienna, Austria", imdbId:"0612204", born:date('1966-09-09'), name:"Michel Muller", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nMichel Muller (born 9 September 1966 in Vienna) is a French actor, screenwriter and director.  He is most recently known for playing Charles VIII of France in the television series The Borgias. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Michel Muller, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cEx6kjnvMbHzyozAfvAQJ2BnGNp.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/21659"}}, {tmdbId:"52422", properties:{bornIn:"The Bronx, New York, USA", imdbId:"0217716", born:date('1959-10-31'), name:"Michael DeLorenzo", bio:"An American actor, director and musician.  He is best known for his portrayal of NYPD Detective Eddie Torres on the Fox Thursday night mid-1990s television series New York Undercover. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Michael DeLorenzo, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dAYG7AcOYG4ZNEvC8isxBxe5Vjx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52422"}}, {tmdbId:"2478", properties:{bornIn:"Glasgow, Ecosse, Royaume-Uni", imdbId:"0281107", born:date('1965-07-03'), name:"Tommy Flanagan", bio:"Tommy Flanagan (born 3 July 1965) is a Scottish film actor. \n\nFlanagan was born in Glasgow, Scotland, the 3rd of five children.  Flanagan first television roles were in Screen One, 1992 and Taggart in 1993.  Flanagan worked in Carlyle's Raindog Theatre for three years before being cast in Braveheart (1995).  He has had roles in Face/Off, The Game, Sunset Strip, Gladiator, Alien vs...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5OnvT1KpEk3juZavqOCSAEYOtwl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2478"}}, {tmdbId:"110953", properties:{imdbId:"0560103", name:"Mandy Matthews", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/110953"}}, {tmdbId:"110950", properties:{imdbId:"0247035", name:"William Eadie", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/110950"}}, {tmdbId:"135035", properties:{imdbId:"0829672", name:"Michelle Stewart", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/135035"}}, {tmdbId:"133", properties:{bornIn:"Belleville, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0765597", born:date('1971-03-07'), name:"Peter Sarsgaard", bio:"John Peter Sarsgaard (born March 7, 1971 in Belleville, Illinois) is an American film and stage actor.  He landed his first feature role in the movie Dead Man Walking in 1995.  He then appeared in the 1998 independent films Another Day in Paradise and Desert Blue.  That same year, Sarsgaard received a substantial role in The Man in the Iron Mask (1998), playing Raoul, the son of Athos.  Sarsgaard later achieved critical recognition when he was cast in Boys Don't Cry (1999) as John Lotter...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5UANyM4co2nwYPgSEmGeNlZRm7V.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/133"}}, {tmdbId:"1834", properties:{bornIn:"Forres, Morayshire, Scotland", imdbId:"0376602", born:date('1965-11-24'), name:"Shirley Henderson", bio:"Shirley Henderson is a Scottish film and television actress, best known for playing Moaning Myrtle in the \"Harry Potter\" movie franchise as well as Jude in several \"Bridget Jones\" movies.  She's a graduate from the Guildhall School of Music and Drama, London, England, UK...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dxVvLjGNKVMl5lDXXInJ7xWpCvl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1834"}}] AS row
