UNWIND [{tmdbId:"28472", properties:{bornIn:"Wahroonga - New South Wales - Australia", imdbId:"0305081", born:date('1973-06-01'), name:"Adam Garcia", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nAdam Garcia (born Adam Gabriel Garcia, 1 June 1973, Wahroonga, New South Wales, Australia) is an Australian actor and tap dancer of partial Colombian descent (his father is from Colombia)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kPw3QKgO56JgWx1JPnwlCxDE7wz.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28472"}}, {tmdbId:"23671", properties:{bornIn:"Belœil, Belgique", imdbId:"0220183", born:date('1981-08-29'), name:"Émilie Dequenne", bio:"Émilie Dequenne (born 29 August 1981) is a Belgian actress.  She first gained attention for playing the title character in the film Rosetta (1999), which earned her the Cannes Film Festival Award for Best Actress.  She then went on to star in many films such as Brotherhood of the Wolf (2001), The Light (2004), The Girl on the Train (2009), Our Children (2012), Not My Type (2014) and This Is Our Land (2017)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aNGdK8n9GCzgHbxcucqdgmKM8lR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23671"}}, {tmdbId:"70312", properties:{bornIn:"Brussels, Belgium", imdbId:"0740090", born:date('1973-03-03'), name:"Fabrizio Rongione", bio:"Fabrizio Rongione (born 3 March 1973) is a Belgian screenwriter, film producer and actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kgaewGtlV13vK3CjwqPJS3U1rt9.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70312"}}, {tmdbId:"70311", properties:{imdbId:"0947650", name:"Anne Yernaux", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70311"}}, {tmdbId:"45152", properties:{bornIn:"Namur, Belgium", imdbId:"0332709", born:date('1963-07-22'), name:"Olivier Gourmet", bio:"Olivier Gourmet (born 22 July 1963 in Namur) is a Belgian actor.  He won the Best Actor award at the 2002 Cannes Film Festival for his role in Le Fils by Jean-Pierre and Luc Dardenne.  He also appeared in La Promesse, Rosetta and L'Enfant...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mWQI1SSVcdnCxrZ4TVSRLW0MwrY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/45152"}}, {tmdbId:"6497", properties:{bornIn:"Barabanki, Uttar Pradesh, India", imdbId:"0787462", born:date('1949-07-20'), name:"Naseeruddin Shah", bio:"Naseeruddin Shah is an Indian film and stage actor and director, and a prominent figure in Indian parallel cinema.  Shah has won numerous awards in his career, including three National Film Awards, three Filmfare Awards and an award at the Venice Film Festival.  The Government of India has honoured him with the Padma Shri and the Padma Bhushan awards for his contributions to Indian cinema...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qgkbFx0LXjLjGvlI37E38uRtsVo.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6497"}}, {tmdbId:"52763", properties:{bornIn:"Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", imdbId:"0451148", born:date('1965-03-14'), name:"Aamir Khan", bio:"Aamir Khan is an Indian actor, director, producer, filmmaker and television talk-show host who has established himself as one of the most popular and influential actors of Indian cinema.  Starting his career as a child actor in his uncle Nasir Hussain's film Yaadon Ki Baaraat (1973), Khan began his professional career eleven years later with Holi (1984) and had his first commercial success with Qayamat Se Qayamat Tak (1988)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1gx1Dve0lVQktdK7CsyFrER0oOP.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52763"}}, {tmdbId:"35754", properties:{bornIn:"Mumbai - India", imdbId:"0007114", born:date('1975-01-01'), name:"Sonali Bendre", bio:"Sonali was born in Mumbai into a Marathi speaking Chandraseniya Kayastha Prabhu family. She studied in Bangalore and Mumbai in Kendriya Vidyalaya Malleswaram and Holy Cross Convent High School, Thane.  Thereafter she went to Welham Girls School, Dehradun.  She married film director Goldie Behl on 12 November 2002.  On 11 August 2005, she gave birth to a son, Ranveer, at the Breach Candy Hospital. \n\nBendre started out as a model before being selected for the \"Star Dust Talent Search\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4xvVvT9RyLvOa2hQjecIhYuSPjx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/35754"}}, {tmdbId:"585404", properties:{bornIn:"Kathua, Jammu and Kashmir, India", imdbId:"0728262", born:date('1956-04-19'), name:"Mukesh Rishi", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iNLleMqHTHrbAlVRCFyye4NZxxb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/585404"}}, {tmdbId:"2680", properties:{bornIn:"Dorchester, Boston, Massachusetts, USA", imdbId:"0005531", born:date('1969-08-17'), name:"Donnie Wahlberg", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nDonald Edward \"Donnie\" Wahlberg, Jr.  (born August 17, 1969) is an American singer, actor and film producer.  He is a member of the popular 1980s and 1990s boy band New Kids on the Block.  His work background includes music, feature films, and television.  Donnie has had featured roles in the Saw films, The Sixth Sense, Boomtown and Righteous Kill, also appearing in the award-winning World War II miniseries Band of Brothers...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9IMR2PKHzqIXWVKmYrCAl0bA3Af.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2680"}}, {tmdbId:"55467", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"1304386", born:date('1979-11-30'), name:"Stephen Campbell Moore", bio:"Stephen Campbell Moore (born Stephen Thorpe; November 30, 1979) is an English actor, best known for his roles in the Alan Bennett play The History Boys and its subsequent film. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia Stephen Campbell Moore, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hpaTZT1QfyFpk8jjHeBUQZX5rtu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/55467"}}, {tmdbId:"1670", properties:{bornIn:"Epping, Essex, England, UK", imdbId:"0990547", born:date('1978-03-31'), name:"Daniel Mays", bio:"Daniel Mays was born on March 31, 1978 in Epping, Essex, England as Daniel Alan Mays.  He is an actor, known for The Adventures of Tintin: The Secret of the Unicorn (2011), The Bank Job (2008) and Atonement (2007).  He has performed five plays at the Royal Court Theatre in London including two in the theatre's 50th Anniversary year in parts that were specifically written for him...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2qmA5mXnhA7Nelu2BTbJTvzq35u.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1670"}}, {tmdbId:"17735", properties:{bornIn:"Pasadena, California, USA", imdbId:"0925234", born:date('1970-06-28'), name:"Mike White", bio:"Michael Christopher White (born June 28, 1970) is an American writer, actor and producer.  He is known as the co-creator of the HBO comedy-drama series Enlightened (2011–2013), as well as the screenwriter for films, such as Chuck & Buck (2000), Orange County (2002), The Good Girl (2002), The School of Rock (2003) and Beatriz at Dinner (2017)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eJpW9GKmWh0W7enmjjZQ8MIEzoI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17735"}}, {tmdbId:"28779", properties:{bornIn:"El Paso, Texas, U.S.", imdbId:"0648913", born:date('1942-09-17'), name:"Lupe Ontiveros", bio:"Lupe Ontiveros (1942—2012) is an American film and television actress.  Ontiveros has acted in numerous films and television shows, most often playing a maid...", died:date('2012-07-26'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zUFJEShPSoGksyrFMOiWUbj6AXf.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28779"}}, {tmdbId:"588421", properties:{imdbId:"0003991", name:"Beth Colt", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/588421"}}, {tmdbId:"1101331", properties:{imdbId:"0328291", name:"Justo González", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1101331"}}, {tmdbId:"57381", properties:{imdbId:"0386977", name:"Paul Hittscher", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4IDZBdbD2MlL3ESzuhezvJPZf5g.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57381"}}, {tmdbId:"116289", properties:{imdbId:"0864856", name:"Orgyen Tobgyal", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116289"}}, {tmdbId:"233102", properties:{imdbId:"0158923", name:"Neten Chokling", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/233102"}}, {tmdbId:"116291", properties:{imdbId:"0517155", name:"Jamyang Lodro", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116291"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"1189229", properties:{imdbId:"0159098", name:"Lama Chonjor", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1189229"}}, {tmdbId:"81295", properties:{bornIn:"Baton Rouge, Louisiana, USA", imdbId:"0922342", born:date('1978-06-10'), name:"Shane West", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nShane West (born Shannon Bruce Snaith; June 10, 1978 height 5' 11¾\" (1,82 m)) is an American actor, punk rock musician and songwriter.  West is best known for portraying Eli Sammler in the ABC family drama Once and Again, Landon Carter in A Walk to Remember, Darby Crash in What We Do Is Secret, Dr.  Ray Barnett in the NBC medical drama ER and the male leading role of Michael Bishop in The CW spy drama Nikita...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9hmX9lPLEtwqPpiMPVjZiQ6Snd.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/81295"}}, {tmdbId:"179510", properties:{imdbId:"0409430", born:date('1978-04-22'), name:"Manu Intiraymi", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zh4pgr1kWwmPfrUmVa3grTjJ19l.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/179510"}}, {tmdbId:"72576", properties:{imdbId:"0094495", name:"Jason Bonham", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/70ck4RKq8o4oMk3CHTCNDTXgA1q.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/72576"}}, {tmdbId:"17920", properties:{bornIn:"East Harlem, New York City", imdbId:"0621393", born:date('1965-11-22'), name:"Kathrine Narducci", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nKathrine Narducci (born August 12, 1965 in East Harlem, New York City) is an American actress, mostly known for her role as Charmaine Bucco, Artie Bucco's wife, on the HBO TV series The Sopranos.  In addition to her role on The Sopranos, she has also film credits including A Bronx Tale and Two Family House and some other guest TV appearances on shows such as Law &amp; Order, NYPD Blue and Third Watch...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bOxhHtEtmhdfVmnL0KyG4SPDlwJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17920"}}, {tmdbId:"53923", properties:{bornIn:"San Francisco, California, USA", imdbId:"0254712", born:date('1969-02-21'), name:"Aunjanue Ellis", bio:"​Aunjanue L.  Ellis is an American producer, stage and screen actress, best known for her film roles in \"Ray\", \"Undercover Brother\", and on the television series \"The Mentalist\".  She has an BA in African-American Studies from Brown University, and an MFA in Acting from the Tisch School of the Arts, New York University...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2D6pjfVK8yTkoPIerDUVgiWs5cl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53923"}}, {tmdbId:"6972", properties:{bornIn:"Blackburn, Lancashire, England, UK", imdbId:"0574534", born:date('1942-09-29'), name:"Ian McShane", bio:"Ian David McShane (born 29 September 1942) is an English actor.  Although he has appeared in numerous films, it is by his television roles that he is generally known, starting with the BBC's Lovejoy (1986–94) and particularly in the HBO Western drama Deadwood (2004–06).  He starred as King Silas Benjamin in NBC series Kings and as Blackbeard in Pirates of the Caribbean: On Stranger Tides...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/q9qKbux5Jo76Sj8g3luxBt6rYtz.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6972"}}, {tmdbId:"70633", properties:{bornIn:"Brighton, England", imdbId:"0714985", born:date('1957-08-12'), name:"Amanda Redman", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70633"}}, {tmdbId:"6003", properties:{bornIn:"Råsunda, Solna, Stockholms län, Sweden", imdbId:"0511841", born:date('1968-06-03'), name:"Lisa Lindgren", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6003"}}, {tmdbId:"6283", properties:{bornIn:"Stockholm, Stockholms län, Sweden", imdbId:"0638824", born:date('1960-11-08'), name:"Michael Nyqvist", bio:"Rolf Åke Mikael Nyqvist (8 November 1960 – 27 June 2017), better known as Michael Nyqvist, was a Swedish actor.  Educated at the School of Drama in Malmö, he became well known for playing police officer Banck in the first series of Martin Beck films made in 1997, and later for his leading role in the film Grabben i graven bredvid in 2002...", died:date('2017-06-27'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ycMhmLinY7v3DABqYy0CL92BG27.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6283"}}, {tmdbId:"11038", properties:{imdbId:"0760571", name:"Emma Samuelsson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11038"}}, {tmdbId:"11039", properties:{imdbId:"0450269", name:"Sam Kessel", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11039"}}, {tmdbId:"103", properties:{bornIn:"Kenosha, Wisconsin, USA", imdbId:"0749263", born:date('1967-11-22'), name:"Mark Ruffalo", bio:"Mark Alan Ruffalo (born November 22, 1967) is an American actor, director, producer and screenwriter.  He has worked in films including Eternal Sunshine of the Spotless Mind, Zodiac, Shutter Island, Just Like Heaven, You Can Count on Me and The Kids Are All Right for which he received an Academy Award nomination for Best Supporting Actor. \n\nRuffalo portrays Bruce Banner/ The Hulk in the Marvel Cinematic Universe, taking over for Edward Norton in the role...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/z3dvKqMNDQWk3QLxzumloQVR0pv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/103"}}, {tmdbId:"28042", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"0191412", born:date('1989-07-21'), name:"Rory Culkin", bio:"Rory Culkin is an American film and television actor, best known for his role in the feature film \"Signs\" and for many roles in independent feature films such as \"The Chumscrubber\", \"Lymelife\", and \"Columbus\".  He's the younger brother of actors Macaulay Culkin and Kieran Culkin...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6SkUiLHFlPEEFtKpLc7VrczaqDx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28042"}}, {tmdbId:"1084", properties:{bornIn:"Herne, Germany", imdbId:"0473166", born:date('1957-06-17'), name:"Joachim Król", bio:"Joachim Król is a German actor, known for his appearances in the films Run Lola Run, Maybe, Maybe Not, and Anne Frank: The Whole Story.  German dubbing voice of Peter Davison in All Creatures Great and Small (1978).  His father was a miner and union activist.   Lives in Cologne with his wife Heidrun and their son Tom.  \"Król\" means \"king\" in Polish.  Resides in Cologne, Germany with his wife and son...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bmBp4wMk11OGM4cAV4wdMNR7ZkX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1084"}}, {tmdbId:"1087", properties:{bornIn:"Wittmund, Germany", imdbId:"0748964", born:date('1966-08-18'), name:"Lars Rudolph", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qiWu2gphSg64igYl3Nx0hEIOQF3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1087"}}, {tmdbId:"21985", properties:{imdbId:"0809277", name:"Mary Jo Smith", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/21985"}}, {tmdbId:"45922", properties:{bornIn:"Roseville, California, USA", imdbId:"0057075", born:date('1986-08-05'), name:"Brendon Ryan Barrett", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nBrendan Ryan Barrett (born August 5, 1986) is an American actor and acting coach. \n\nBarrett was born in Roseville, California.  He grew up in Folsom, California, with his veterinarian parents and his sister, Caitlin Barrett.  He is perhaps best known as the voice of Casper the Friendly Ghost in Casper's Haunted Christmas and as Chris Carson in the 1997 film Casper: A Spirited Beginning.  Brendan graduated from Folsom High School in 2005...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zTiegut9pjAZghxg6NT3xJd5e0E.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/45922"}}, {tmdbId:"171841", properties:{imdbId:"0858858", name:"Gay Thomas Wilson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/171841"}}, {tmdbId:"114026", properties:{bornIn:"Healdsburg, California, USA", imdbId:"0064375", born:date('1986-09-26'), name:"Raquel Beaudene", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oDCuxD46B07xdVV2WlnzZFL94sZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/114026"}}] AS row
