ye Thomas (born October 31, 1980) is an American film, television, and stage actor who rose to prominence in 1999 as Paul Finch in the American Pie film series. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Eddie Kaye Thomas, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/glUDeCvXfoLXgE0JJ5CboDpFW4R.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52480"}}, {tmdbId:"155206", properties:{imdbId:"0083781", name:"Cecelia Ann Birt", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dbNmmVbZZgqsgVNEajI6ywnePpU.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/155206"}}, {tmdbId:"1296511", properties:{imdbId:"0634342", name:"Paul L. Nolan", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yIQ0e6vnNc4j1N3slp5NodawXMs.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1296511"}}, {tmdbId:"1077235", properties:{imdbId:"0282665", name:"Carol Florence", bio:"Carol Florence is an American actress who has had a number of minor roles in some high profile Hollywood films.  She has a reputation for playing nurses or doctors.  She appeared in the 1995 film 12 Monkeys as an astrophysicist.  In 2001 she provided a voice to Ocean's Eleven.  In 2005, she appeared in the Cameron Diaz film In Her Shoes as a woman walking her dog...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/meNpeUFqyU8CrXsG2STGTGugh9D.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1077235"}}, {tmdbId:"18354", properties:{bornIn:"Binghamton, New York, United States", imdbId:"0005256", born:date('1971-04-28'), name:"Bridget Moynahan", bio:"Kathryn Bridget Moynahan (born April 28, 1971 height 5' 9½\" (1,77 m)), best known as Bridget Moynahan, is an American model and actress.  After graduating from Longmeadow High School in 1989, Moynahan pursued a career in modeling.  She was signed by a modeling agency, which led her to appear in department store catalogs and the covers of widely known magazines.  After doing television commercials, she began taking acting lessons, in order to change occupations...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7WuwRCcwtBmJZ64pNsLbwhQCEA4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/18354"}}, {tmdbId:"41088", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0781981", born:date('1980-01-18'), name:"Jason Segel", bio:"Jason Jordan Segel (born January 18, 1980) is an American television and film actor, screenwriter, musician, known for his work with producer Judd Apatow on the short-lived television series Freaks and Geeks and Undeclared, the movies Forgetting Sarah Marshall, Knocked Up, I Love You, Man, Gulliver's Travels, and Despicable Me, and also for his role as Marshall Eriksen in the CBS sitcom How I Met Your Mother...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lcAoILbiybmS6ftQCaD9h9O626u.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/41088"}}, {tmdbId:"11520", properties:{bornIn:"Brooklyn, New York, USA", imdbId:"0549535", born:date('1977-09-27'), name:"Michael C. Maronna", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vLmaPosdi7sLutyg5QkJHceRY5F.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11520"}}, {tmdbId:"40304", properties:{bornIn:"Marciac - Gers - France", imdbId:"0634500", born:date('1943-08-31'), name:"Jacques Nolot", bio:"Jacques Nolot was born on 31 August 1943 in Marcillac, France and is a well known stage and character actor whose first feature film L'arrière pays (1998) won the First Film Special Distinction Award at the Montreal World Film Festival and a FIPRESCI Special Mention Award at the Venice Film Festival both in 1998.  It earned a nomination for Best New Director of a Feature Film at the César Awards in 1999...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/z7JvsShybj6qofzsGMzTWDbnTOx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/40304"}}, {tmdbId:"1090780", properties:{imdbId:"1701596", born:date('1992-08-25'), name:"Angelica Mandy", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1090780"}}, {tmdbId:"5314", properties:{imdbId:"0661311", name:"Aurelien Parent Koenig", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oniYyrnZhNaMWbmq7Hj3rytTGAL.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/5314"}}, {tmdbId:"5310", properties:{imdbId:"0317884", name:"Antonio Gil", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/5310"}}, {tmdbId:"10979", properties:{imdbId:"1196732", name:"Saunders Triplets", bio:"The Saunders Triplets are three brothers who played the baby version of Harry Potter in the film adaptation of Harry Potter and the Philosopher's Stone.  They portrayed baby Harry during an early scene when he is being brought to his aunt and uncle's house.  Their first names are unknown as they are just credited as \"Saunders triplets\"...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/10979"}}, {tmdbId:"87341", properties:{bornIn:"Passos, Minas Gerais, Brazil", imdbId:"0578080", born:date('1972-12-30'), name:"Selton Mello", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sd9pWha3ThWyX5DPsVnZVPKSJ9W.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/87341"}}, {tmdbId:"933165", properties:{bornIn:"São Paulo, São Paulo, Brazil", imdbId:"0181395", born:date('1932-08-28'), name:"Raul Cortez", bio:"Raul Cortez was a Brazilian film and television actor...", died:date('2006-07-18'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/b0jBRkF9WoZLZrKUXpnp2b8zkSY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/933165"}}] AS row
