LelKoPNiyJCSEtQTz1FGv4TLGc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1813"}}, {tmdbId:"1935252", properties:{name:"André Vippolis", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/roGjh39cdo3NnHGHeeO612MNCz0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1935252"}}, {tmdbId:"84763", properties:{bornIn:"Kentucky, U.S.", imdbId:"0449466", born:date('1976-09-05'), name:"Joey Kern", bio:"Joseph Daniel \"Joey\" Kern (born September 5, 1976) is an American actor.  He is most widely known for his roles in the 2003 films Cabin Fever and Grind. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Joey Kern licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4XjucDsVJ52sMaceCmVmusDdHwO.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84763"}}, {tmdbId:"5375", properties:{bornIn:"Manhattan, New York, USA", imdbId:"0034309", born:date('1978-02-28'), name:"Geoffrey Arend", bio:"Born Feb.  28th, 1978 in Queens.  Is of Pakistani and German decent.  Married to Christina Hendricks (of Mad Men).  Graduated from LaGuardia High School of Music and Arts in 1996.  Attended both Carnegie Melon and Tisch (NYU) but never completed his bachelors...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bpqF3V5lK5GxuIU4VuTaVaztIvw.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/5375"}}, {tmdbId:"56252", properties:{bornIn:"Minneapolis, Minnesota", imdbId:"0831479", born:date('1968-08-23'), name:"Erik Stolhanske", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nErik Stolhanske (born August 23, 1968) is an American actor, writer, and producer, and one of the members of the Broken Lizard comedy group.  He graduated from Breck School, then Colgate University.  At Colgate he was part of the troupe Charred Goosebeak, which included the others of Broken Lizard. \n\nHe is a member of Beta Theta Pi at Colgate University...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eVMov7majKwNO8eOMcwweaAnBJj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/56252"}}, {tmdbId:"21266", properties:{imdbId:"0871136", name:"Stephen Trask", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/m5zZDSin3R0HvKcdKRhwvDkTuP4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/21266"}}, {tmdbId:"126684", properties:{imdbId:"0514007", name:"Theodore Liscinski", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/126684"}}, {tmdbId:"1653805", properties:{bornIn:"Lima, Perú", born:date('1954-10-10'), name:"Juliane Koepcke", bio:"Juliane Margaret Koepcke is a German-Peruvian biologist, born in Peru to German expatriates, who was the only survivor of 92 passengers and crew in the 24 December 1971 crash of LANSA Flight 508 in the Peruvian rainforest.  When the airliner broke up in mid-air, she survived after plummeting about 3 km (~10,000 feet) while still strapped to her seat, before crashing through the rain forest canopy and coming to rest on the forest floor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hOWjt0z9ellJ5gqRHVmV8W1KKK4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1653805"}}, {tmdbId:"35742", properties:{bornIn:"New Delhi, Delhi, India", imdbId:"0451321", born:date('1965-11-02'), name:"Shah Rukh Khan", bio:"Shah Rukh Khan (born November 2, 1965) is a prominent Bollywood actor and producer.  He made his film debut in Deewana (1992).  In 2005, the Government of India honoured him with the Padma Shri for his contributions towards Indian Cinema. \n\nIn 2003, he founded the motion picture production company Red Chillies Entertainment together with his wife Gauri Khan...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1w76N732BRbwQegkHnhwE4zgls0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/35742"}}, {tmdbId:"37233", properties:{bornIn:" Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", imdbId:"0004626", born:date('1980-09-21'), name:"Kareena Kapoor", bio:"Kareena Kapoor often informally referred to as Bebo,  is an Indian  film actress who appears in Bollywood  films.  Born into a film family where both her parents, Randhir Kapoor and Babita, and her elder sister Karisma were actors, Kapoor faced the media spotlight from a very young age.  However, she did not make her acting debut until the 2000 film Refugee, which earned her the Filmfare Best Female Debut Award...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sYOSVzSaXVddlxusGKwKArofFCK.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/37233"}}, {tmdbId:"14596", properties:{bornIn:"Sikkim, India", imdbId:"0219939", born:date('1948-02-25'), name:"Danny Denzongpa", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nTshering Phintso Denzongpa, widely known by his acting name \"Danny\" Denzongpa (born 25 February 1948) is an Indian actor of Sikkimese ancestry working in Bollywood films. \n\nDenzongpa was born in the state of Sikkim, at that time an independent Bhutia monarchy.  He is an ethnic Bhutia and speaks Bhutia as his mother tongue. \n\nHe started his career by singing Indian and Nepali songs and acting in Indian and Nepali movies...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xDNLtgG8iDXxNRvSDjpuNSNfKvX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/14596"}}, {tmdbId:"37234", properties:{imdbId:"0222144", name:"Rahul Dev", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wjADAt1yCyQML0qQIQiGLP9xNUm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/37234"}}, {tmdbId:"146242", properties:{bornIn:"Lyon, France", imdbId:"0484189", born:date('1973-01-19'), name:"Karen Lancaume", died:date('2005-01-28'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fJ0QOItsrCGtBBmCwaQNncVdffM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/146242"}}, {tmdbId:"146243", properties:{bornIn:"Montfermeil, France", imdbId:"0027303", born:date('1976-01-08'), name:"Raffaëla Anderson", bio:"Anderson studied to be a secretary.  She entered the French pornography business in 1994 at the age of 18 and left it four years later.  Still a virgin at that time, she had her first sexual intercourse with a porn actor on a film set. [1] During her adult film career, she was raped by two men who had recognized her...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xcCemvy9iMy3L2vUi62PWlOBI6C.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/146243"}}] AS row
