arring roles in the feature films of his brother, Josef Fares...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dLIVOrhSO2vSDt1gz3gURXBeOaN.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57012"}}, {tmdbId:"57013", properties:{bornIn:"Lund, Sweden", imdbId:"0677471", born:date('1969-08-19'), name:"Torkel Petersson", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   Torkel Petersson is a Swedish actor born in Lund, Sweden, on August 19, 1969.   Description above from the Wikipedia article Torkel Petersson, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ltBSPYNAXKinfrp70hLTWguEXVB.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57013"}}, {tmdbId:"67737", properties:{bornIn:" Stockholm,  Sweden", imdbId:"0637259", born:date('1979-12-21'), name:"Tuva Novotny", bio:"An actress and director born in Stockholm, Sweden...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2rnxPAJ4q66sECbmQR2V15NwXOL.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/67737"}}, {tmdbId:"67738", properties:{bornIn:"Bandar-e Anzali, Iran", imdbId:"0693837", born:date('1982-06-10'), name:"Laleh Pourkarim", bio:"Laleh Pourkarim is a Swedish singer-songwriter, record producer, guitarist, pianist, actress and record company manager...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qjjIhXLyov2yD1k13cs97NciAuZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/67738"}}, {tmdbId:"49168", properties:{bornIn:" Paris, France", imdbId:"0527852", born:date('1964-12-14'), name:"Noémie Lvovsky", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kgSd2MdvEIDM04gH3WoSvyOTq5P.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/49168"}}, {tmdbId:"71395", properties:{bornIn:"Kaohsiung, Taiwan", imdbId:"0155365", born:date('1969-11-27'), name:"Shiang-chyi Chen", bio:"Chen Shiang-chyi (Chinese: 陳湘琪; pinyin: chén xiāng qí; born 27 November 1969) is a Taiwanese actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yqr5dnPZqI2K2F5VZC9CmIhjaNV.jpg", url:"