he presence of a rambunctious imaginary friend from childhood.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/v2kadCRcRdq8a0aRbQg4yVk3Xmd.jpg", released:"1991-05-24", budget:6788000}}, {movieId:"1127", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1989, imdbId:"0096754", runtime:145, imdbRating:7.6, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:127925, title:"Abyss, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/2756", revenue:90000098, tmdbId:"2756", plot:"A civilian diving team is enlisted to search for a lost nuclear submarine and face danger while encountering an alien aquatic species.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jel2BuDv7Bq4fuv2pUrTfiBm69o.jpg", released:"1989-08-09", budget:70000000}}, {movieId:"1128", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1980, imdbId:"0080749", runtime:89, imdbRating:6.8, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:44771, title:"Fog, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/790", revenue:21378361, tmdbId:"790", plot:"Legend says that Antonio Bay was built in 1880 with blood money obtained from shipwrecked lepers but no one believes it. On the eve of the town's centennial many plan to attend the celebrations, including the murdered lepers.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nXoJcdeHQ1SGBo4yciPhK6mTn4U.jpg", released:"1980-02-08", budget:1000000}}, {movieId:"1129", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1981, imdbId:"0082340", runtime:99, imdbRating:7.2, countries:["UK", " USA"], imdbVotes:87459, title:"Escape from New York", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/1103", revenue:50244700, tmdbId:"1103", plot:"In 1997, when the US President crashes into Manhattan, now a giant maximum security prison, a convicted bank robber is sent in to rescue him.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yreqWiQ7IOkXWVB2Tz4LJIs7xqA.jpg", released:"1981-07-10", budget:6000000}}, {movieId:"1130", properties:{languages:["English", " Spanish"], year:1981, imdbId:"0082533", runtime:91, imdbRating:6.6, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:21873, title:"Howling, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/11298", revenue:17985893, tmdbId:"11298", plot:"After a bizarre and near fatal encounter with a serial killer, a television newswoman is sent to a remote mountain resort whose residents may not be what they seem.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qUvpw5aYH0xPmILiRXzBZtSvCMv.jpg", released:"1981-04-10", budget:1000000}}, {movieId:"1131", properties:{languages:["French"], year:1986, imdbId:"0091288", runtime:120, imdbRating:8.1, countries:["France", " Switzerland", " Italy", " Austria"], imdbVotes:19206, title:"Jean de Florette", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/4480", tmdbId:"4480", plot:"A greedy landowner and his backward nephew conspire to block the only water source for an adjoining property in order to bankrupt the owner and force him to sell.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/car13dBvNvVN8EgQWXYqOSFwbDq.jpg", released:"1987-08-28", budget:4940939}}, {movieId:"1132", properties:{languages:["French"], year:1986, imdbId:"0091480", runtime:113, imdbRating:8.0, countries:["Italy", " France", " Switzerland"], imdbVotes:16291, title:"Manon of the Spring (Manon des sources)", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/4481", tmdbId:"4481", plot:"A beautiful but shy shepherdess plots vengeance on the men whose greedy conspiracy to acquire her father's land caused his death years earlier.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1qpu6Zc1PSDL3UbDNIZJ6YuhJDW.jpg", released:"1987-12-04"}}, {movieId:"1133", properties:{tmdbId:"575751", languages:["English"], year:1994, imdbId:"0111357", runtime:87, imdbRating:5.7, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:31, title:"Talking About Sex", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3tNISfteDbGI09O5HZnedzOFekb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/575751"}}, {movieId:"1135", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1980, imdbId:"0081375", runtime:109, imdbRating:6.1, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:17591, title:"Private Benjamin",