273, title:"Star Trek II: The Wrath of Khan", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/154", revenue:96800000, tmdbId:"154", plot:"With the assistance of the Enterprise crew, Admiral Kirk must stop an old nemesis, Khan Noonien Singh, from using the life-generating Genesis Device as the ultimate weapon.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/53J4DyS0wMp5r3XYJvzUh9cf0Hz.jpg", released:"1982-06-04", budget:12000000}}, {movieId:"1375", properties:{languages:["English", " Klingon", " Russian", " French"], year:1984, imdbId:"0088170", runtime:105, imdbRating:6.6, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:56546, title:"Star Trek III: The Search for Spock", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/157", revenue:87000000, tmdbId:"157", plot:"Admiral Kirk and his bridge crew risk their careers stealing the decommissioned Enterprise to return to the restricted Genesis planet to recover Spock's body.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eTdeYHxxeYNXPbit62ng9HXe1h5.jpg", released:"1984-06-01", budget:18000000}}, {movieId:"1376", properties:{languages:["English", " Finnish"], year:1986, imdbId:"0092007", runtime:119, imdbRating:7.3, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:59221, title:"Star Trek IV: The Voyage Home", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/168", revenue:133000000, tmdbId:"168", plot:"To save Earth from an alien probe, Admiral Kirk and his fugitive crew go back in time to 20th century Earth to retrieve the only beings who can communicate with it, humpback whales.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9bjUUgrdmUzed0rP1FYT0ycfXue.jpg", released:"1986-11-26", budget:24000000}}, {movieId:"1377", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1992, imdbId:"0103776", runtime:126, imdbRating:7.0, countries:["USA", " UK"], imdbVotes:206980, title:"Batman Returns", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/364", revenue:280000000, tmdbId:"364", plot:"When a corrupt businessman and the grotesque Penguin plot to take control of Gotham City, only Batman can stop them, while the Ca