ous expedition. He discovers a planet ruled by apes and an underground city run by telepathic humans.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/v1r5mBh9hxxWpvZl9G3cP7d1Mh9.jpg", released:"1970-05-26", budget:3000000}}, {movieId:"2531", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1973, imdbId:"0069768", runtime:93, imdbRating:5.5, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:22174, title:"Battle for the Planet of the Apes", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/1705", revenue:8844595, tmdbId:"1705", plot:"Ten years after conquering the Earth, ape leader Caesar wants the ruling apes and enslaved humans to live in peace. But warring factions of apes led by a militant gorilla general as well as various human groups threaten the stability.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dP5dYjLp5p2CG103cJMio4Nj29d.jpg", released:"1973-06-15", budget:1700000}}, {movieId:"2532", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1972, imdbId:"0068408", runtime:88, imdbRating:6.1, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:22514, title:"Conquest of the Planet of the Apes", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/1688", revenue:9700000, tmdbId:"1688", plot:"In a futuristic world that has embraced ape slavery, Caesar, the son of the late simians Cornelius and Zira, surfaces after almost twenty years of hiding out from the authorities, and prepares for a slave revolt against humanity.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cOJbDBeee9Ktl6oN6ZqWw8D1EJK.jpg", released:"1972-06-30", budget:1700000}}, {movieId:"2533", properties:{languages:["English"], year:1971, imdbId:"0067065", runtime:98, imdbRating:6.3, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:22674, title:"Escape from the Planet of the Apes", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/1687", revenue:12348905, tmdbId:"1687", plot:"The world is shocked by the appearance of three talking chimpanzees, who arrived mysteriously in a U.S. spacecraft. They become the toast of society; but one man believes them to be a threat to the human race.", poster:"https://image.tm