oth, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/28476", tmdbId:"28476", plot:"Milo is a boy who is bored with life. One day he comes home to find a toll booth in his room. Having nothing better to do, he gets in his toy car and drives through - only to emerge in a world full of adventure.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pBhvLo2CGu68Xt9S0ec1BvkxFf2.jpg", released:"1972-12-01"}}, {movieId:"8016", properties:{languages:["English", " Spanish"], year:1972, imdbId:"0068638", runtime:122, imdbRating:7.5, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:20381, title:"Getaway, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/5916", revenue:36734619, tmdbId:"5916", plot:"A recently released ex-con and his loyal wife go on the run after a heist goes awry.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1NjAoGMpb5rE4DcdXPwLeHVoULJ.jpg", released:"1972-12-13", budget:3352254}}] AS row
