n office worker and his Indian stoner friend embark on a quest to satisfy their desire for White Castle burgers.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5vO7R4xYlDipTp8gzfRbWegO8eb.jpg", released:"2004-07-30", budget:9000000}}, {movieId:"8808", properties:{languages:["English", " Greek", " French", " Spanish"], year:2004, imdbId:"0368933", runtime:113, imdbRating:5.7, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:50821, title:"Princess Diaries 2: Royal Engagement, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/11130", revenue:95149435, tmdbId:"11130", plot:"Now settled in Genovia, Princess Mia faces a new revelation: she is being primed for an arranged marriage to an English suitor.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/q4BAu7ksjFISEKMGmFjrxZK9cDg.jpg", released:"2004-08-11", budget:40000000}}, {movieId:"8810", properties:{languages:["English", " Italian"], year:2004, imdbId:"0370263", runtime:101, imdbRating:5.6, countries:["USA", " UK", " Czech Republic", " Canada", " Germany"], imdbVotes:139204, title:"AVP: Alien vs. Predator", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/395", revenue:171183863, tmdbId:"395", plot:"During an archaeological expedition on Bouvetøya Island in Antarctica, a team of archaeologists and other scientists find themselves caught up in a battle between the two legends. Soon, the team realize that only one species can win.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2DKoPom57PVtJWcJlq7bS7JpahU.jpg", released:"2004-08-13", budget:70000000}}, {movieId:"8811", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2004, imdbId:"0403703", runtime:89, imdbRating:4.4, countries:["Japan", " USA"], imdbVotes:6128, title:"Yu-Gi-Oh!", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/11052", revenue:29170410, tmdbId:"11052", plot:"Underneath the sands of Egypt, Anubis, an ancient evil spirit, has awakened. It's up to Yugi, who defeated Anubis centuries ago, to use his skill and determination to rid the world of evil once again.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_