IPrEej8q4baE1RYXOXwFB.jpg", released:"2006-04-28", budget:15000000}}, {movieId:"45221", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2006, imdbId:"0430634", runtime:103, imdbRating:6.4, countries:["Germany", " USA"], imdbVotes:21887, title:"Stick It", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/10115", tmdbId:"10115", plot:"After a run-in with the law, Haley Graham (Missy Peregrym) is forced to return to the world from which she fled some years ago. Enrolled in an elite gymnastics program run by the legendary Burt Vickerman (Jeff Bridges), Haley's rebellious attitude gives way to something that just might be called team spirit.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uMcylxIC7nBpBd8Uf6Apr4MJ1pf.jpg", released:"2006-04-28"}}, {movieId:"45382", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2005, imdbId:"0398027", runtime:114, imdbRating:6.5, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:16445, title:"Down in the Valley", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/7870", revenue:852872, tmdbId:"7870", plot:"Set in the present-day San Fernando Valley, the project revolves around a delusional man who believes he's a cowboy and the relationship that he starts with a rebellious young woman.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qgyp48naq0W7j4NbOttFi91DlYW.jpg", released:"2005-12-09", budget:8000000}}, {movieId:"45431", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2006, imdbId:"0327084", runtime:83, imdbRating:6.8, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:123616, title:"Over the Hedge", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/7518", revenue:343397247, tmdbId:"7518", plot:"A scheming raccoon fools a mismatched family of forest creatures into helping him repay a debt of food, by invading the new suburban sprawl that popped up while they were hibernating...and learns a lesson about family himself.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6qKM3Rl1tQgOFO1fMA7DAizWZ5n.jpg", released:"2006-05-19", budget:80000000}}, {movieId:"45440", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2006, imdbId:"0364955", runtime:102, imdbRating:6.3, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:14664, title:"Art School Confidential", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/9786", tmdbId:"9786", plot:"Starting from childhood attempts at illustration, the protagonist pursues his true obsession to art school. But as he learns how the art world really works, he finds that he must adapt his vision to the reality that confronts him.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yVCO6dv6Apu0QhxTGMeo6vQQz7I.jpg", released:"2006-05-12"}}, {movieId:"45442", properties:{languages:["English", " Spanish"], year:2006, imdbId:"0409182", runtime:98, imdbRating:5.6, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:80805, title:"Poseidon", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/503", revenue:181674817, tmdbId:"503", plot:"On New Year's Eve, the luxury ocean liner Poseidon capsizes after being swamped by a rogue wave. The survivors are left to fight for their lives as they attempt to escape the sinking ship.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cCx2Ead8KoZhHofsAAr7tyrjfDo.jpg", released:"2006-05-12", budget:160000000}}, {movieId:"45447", properties:{languages:["English", " French", " Latin", " Spanish"], year:2006, imdbId:"0382625", runtime:149, imdbRating:6.5, countries:["USA", " Malta", " France", " UK"], imdbVotes:304340, title:"Da Vinci Code, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/591", revenue:767820459, tmdbId:"591", plot:"A murder inside the Louvre and clues in Da Vinci paintings lead to the discovery of a religious mystery protected by a secret society for two thousand years -- which could shake the foundations of Christianity.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6jexEWBXepwB1ZLpCEllI04Agrb.jpg", released:"2006-05-19", budget:125000000}}, {movieId:"45499", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2006, imdbId:"0376994", runtime:104, imdbRating:6.8, countries:["Canada", " USA", " UK"], imdbVotes:366175, title:"X-Men: The Last Stand", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/36668", revenue:459359555, tmdbId:"36668", plot:"When a cure is found to treat mutations, lines are drawn amongst the X-Men, led by Professor Charles Xavier, and the Brotherhood, a band of powerful mutants organized under Xavier's former ally, Magneto.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9jDzVM003nH0NfQ57qMLHxcMQYU.jpg", released:"2006-05-26", budget:210000000}}, {movieId:"45501", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2006, imdbId:"0452594", runtime:106, imdbRating:5.8, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:99362, title:"Break-Up, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/9767", revenue:205668210, tmdbId:"9767", plot:"In a bid to keep their luxurious condo from their significant other, a couple's break-up proceeds to get uglier and nastier by the moment.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yN3b4ElUOMA2lNcwAzr9TEBpmy.jpg", released:"2006-06-02", budget:52000000}}, {movieId:"45506", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2005, imdbId:"0417385", runtime:94, imdbRating:7.6, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:6042, title:"Twelve and Holding", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/18164", revenue:95687, tmdbId:"18164", plot:"After his twin brother is accidentally killed by vengeful bullies, a 12-year old boy and his friends face the harsh realities of death, teenage hormones, and family dysfunction.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jOs1N3B7w5ASq80hvTu1m9DiPmE.jpg", released:"2006-07-07", budget:400000}}, {movieId:"45517", properties:{languages:["English", " Italian", " Japanese", " Yiddish"], year:2006, imdbId:"0317219", runtime:117, imdbRating:7.2, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:249945, title:"Cars", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/920", revenue:461983149, tmdbId:"920", plot:"A hot-shot race-car named Lightning McQueen gets waylaid in Radiator Springs, where he finds the true meaning of friendship and family.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qa6HCwP4Z15l3hpsASz3auugEW6.jpg", released:"2006-06-09", budget:120000000}}, {movieId:"45521", properties:{languages:["Spanish", " English"], year:2005, imdbId:"0413466", runtime:111, imdbRating:6.0, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:4027, title:"Wassup Rockers", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/18484", revenue:634074, tmdbId:"18484", plot:"Instead of adhering to the norms of their South Central neighborhood, a group of skater boys opt to bus into Hollywood and Beverly Hills, where they attract local rich girls - and plenty of...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1pzjKXhYxNou5c0ssmfmCpaMqSN.jpg", released:"2006-04-05"}}, {movieId:"45662", properties:{languages:["English", " Italian"], year:2006, imdbId:"0466909", runtime:110, imdbRating:5.5, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:47923, title:"Omen, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/806", revenue:119188334, tmdbId:"806", plot:"A remake of the horror classic The Omen (1976), an American official realizes that his young son may literally be the devil incarnate.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kf1Qq9b32jn4umll9qD2ue5ftnh.jpg", released:"2006-06-06", budget:25000000}}, {movieId:"45666", properties:{languages:["English", " Spanish"], year:2006, imdbId:"0457510", runtime:92, imdbRating:5.7, countries:["Germany", " USA"], imdbVotes:64208, title:"Nacho Libre", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/9353", revenue:99255460, tmdbId:"9353", plot:"Berated all his life by those around him, a monk follows his dream and dons a mask to moonlight as a Luchador (Mexican wrestler).", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kh7B91bMl2lZ0mH9WhPfaNUIEQH.jpg", released:"2006-06-16", budget:35000000}}] AS row
