ion.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/m2iVkJPxDrrink7NiE412nFBMQj.jpg", released:"2007-02-16"}}, {movieId:"51084", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2007, imdbId:"0758766", runtime:96, imdbRating:6.5, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:79100, title:"Music and Lyrics", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/11172", revenue:145896422, tmdbId:"11172", plot:"A washed up singer is given a couple days to compose a chart-topping hit for an aspiring teen sensation. Though he's never written a decent lyric in his life, he sparks with an offbeat younger woman with a flair for words.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lMtPt9qvZHiCzoOvT8FAWuyJgbz.jpg", released:"2007-02-14", budget:40000000}}, {movieId:"51086", properties:{languages:["English", " Chinese"], year:2007, imdbId:"0481369", runtime:101, imdbRating:6.4, countries:["USA", " Germany"], imdbVotes:161080, title:"Number 23, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/3594", revenue:77566815, tmdbId:"3594", plot:"Walter Sparrow becomes obsessed with a novel that he believes was written about him. As his obsession increases, more and more similarities seem to arise.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mlNU8a1SkTu6cKA4LAoZxfNPng0.jpg", released:"2007-02-23", budget:30000000}}, {movieId:"51088", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2007, imdbId:"0499554", runtime:84, imdbRating:5.9, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:23606, title:"Reno 911!: Miami", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/10090", revenue:20342161, tmdbId:"10090", plot:"A rag-tag team of Reno cops are called in to save the day after a terrorist attack disrupts a national police convention in Miami Beach during spring break. Based on the Comedy Central series.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/l9v3nqTU4Gj2zuASGDLJX4YD8ma.jpg", released:"2007-02-23", budget:10000000}}, {movieId:"51091", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2006, imdbId:"0462200", runtime:116, imdbRating:7.0, countries:["USA"]