r a rich New York family. Ensconced in their home, she has to juggle their dysfunction, a new romance, and the spoiled brat in her charge.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8hX6rcxnCidaqegPCyeFm9PODBn.jpg", released:"2007-08-24", budget:20000000}}, {movieId:"54785", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2007, imdbId:"0373883", runtime:109, imdbRating:6.1, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:86248, title:"Halloween", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/2082", revenue:80253908, tmdbId:"2082", plot:"After being committed for 17 years, Michael Myers, now a grown man and still very dangerous, escapes from the mental institution (where he was committed as a 10 year old) and he immediately returns to Haddonfield, where he wants to find his baby sister, Laurie. Anyone who crosses his path is in mortal danger.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kX0tl6NyfLw1N2vegNEVO0SNZAg.jpg", released:"2007-08-31", budget:15000000}}, {movieId:"54787", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2007, imdbId:"0804461", runtime:105, imdbRating:6.8, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:58980, title:"Death Sentence", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/11835", revenue:16974459, tmdbId:"11835", plot:"Nick Hume is a mild-mannered executive with a perfect life, until one gruesome night he witnesses something that changes him forever. Transformed by grief, Hume eventually comes to the disturbing conclusion that no length is too great when protecting his family.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/o1d4SMAcBDJXx0vexedKvK50ZEH.jpg", released:"2007-08-31", budget:20000000}}, {movieId:"54881", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2007, imdbId:"0923752", runtime:79, imdbRating:8.2, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:29879, title:"King of Kong, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/13958", tmdbId:"13958", plot:"Die-hard gamers compete to break world records on classic arcade games.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xA1F4P4ZYxVA12Aa5mK9R8q4oIc