inds himself awake and aware, but paralyzed, during heart surgery. His mother must wrestle with her own demons as a turn of events unfolds around them, while trying to unfold the story hidden behind her son's young wife.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kUGl1mzttD15TEpsKVMyUjHug80.jpg", released:"2007-11-30", budget:86000000}}, {movieId:"56171", properties:{languages:["English", " Icelandic", " Russian", " French"], year:2007, imdbId:"0385752", runtime:113, imdbRating:6.1, countries:["USA", " UK"], imdbVotes:146156, title:"Golden Compass, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/2268", revenue:372234864, tmdbId:"2268", plot:"In a parallel universe, young Lyra Belacqua journeys to the far North to save her best friend and other kidnapped children from terrible experiments by a mysterious organization.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lyaS7S4emzEaYUcSnCvyqfJpOcA.jpg", released:"2007-12-07", budget:180000000}}] AS row
