pressive Malcolm. In short order, the storm the sisters create leaves behind a mess of thrashed relationships and exposed family secrets.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ftloyPvxWMELW5Qg0C82a5UBwJH.jpg", released:"2007-12-14", budget:10000000}}, {movieId:"56286", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2007, imdbId:"0368794", runtime:135, imdbRating:7.0, countries:["USA", " Germany", " Canada"], imdbVotes:47315, title:"I'm Not There", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/3902", revenue:4001121, tmdbId:"3902", plot:"Ruminations on the life of Bob Dylan, where six characters embody a different aspect of the musician's life and work.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xhUWSLP1FvoZSDOvVN8veIWtX6h.jpg", released:"2007-12-07", budget:20000000}}, {movieId:"56333", properties:{languages:["English", " German", " Cantonese"], year:2007, imdbId:"0775529", runtime:113, imdbRating:7.2, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:31807, title:"Savages, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/8272", tmdbId:"8272", plot:"A sister and brother face the realities of familial responsibility as they begin to care for their ailing father.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nY54gSmTOmSXlQpWDB7DWp4u8a7.jpg", released:"2008-02-01"}}, {movieId:"56336", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2007, imdbId:"0804555", runtime:93, imdbRating:5.5, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:28552, title:"Wrong Turn 2: Dead End", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/13186", tmdbId:"13186", plot:"A group of reality show contestants find themselves fighting for their survival against a family of hideously deformed inbred cannibals who plan to ruthlessly butcher them all.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/g3ivyNtj5GjoZ5lHqzEIjY7Jhxt.jpg", released:"2007-10-09", budget:4000000}}, {movieId:"56339", properties:{languages:["Spanish"], year:2007, imdbId:"0464141", runtime:105, imdbRating:7.5, countries:["Spain"], imdbVotes:117597, title:"Orphanage, The (