.org/movie/17332", revenue:31720158, tmdbId:"17332", plot:"A Los Angeles journalist befriends a homeless Juilliard-trained musician, while looking for a new article for the paper.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/72arszszwsfECPDdkwFpxH1LHQ9.jpg", released:"2009-04-24", budget:60000000}}, {movieId:"68945", properties:{languages:["Japanese"], year:1997, imdbId:"0169880", runtime:101, imdbRating:7.6, countries:["Japan"], imdbVotes:7301, title:"Neon Genesis Evangelion: Death & Rebirth (Shin seiki Evangelion Gekijô-ban: Shito shinsei)", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/21832", tmdbId:"21832", plot:"The Evangelion saga from TV is artfully recounted, with some additional scenes, in part one see: Shin Seiki Evangelion (1995) Part two starts immediately afterward, where the NERV ...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hFAuP14o9oeYDXA8C6zlqyenBus.jpg", released:"1997-03-15"}}, {movieId:"68952", properties:{languages:["English", " Spanish", " Hungarian", " Czech"], year:2009, imdbId:"1127180", runtime:99, imdbRating:6.6, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:154162, title:"Drag Me to Hell", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/16871", revenue:90810892, tmdbId:"16871", plot:"A loan officer who evicts an old woman from her home finds herself the recipient of a supernatural curse. Desperate, she turns to a seer to try and save her soul, while evil forces work to push her to a breaking point.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/Ak9lfPN80XNE1xpGj6XfFFbbPOE.jpg", released:"2009-05-29", budget:30000000}}, {movieId:"68954", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2009, imdbId:"1049413", runtime:96, imdbRating:8.3, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:629663, title:"Up", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/14160", revenue:735099082, tmdbId:"14160", plot:"Seventy-eight year old Carl Fredricksen travels to Paradise Falls in his home equipped with balloons, inadvertently taking a young stowaway.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_f