uest takes Captain and his crew from the shores of Blood Island to the foggy streets of Victorian London.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gxQWAhT2Hpsid1aBQQmQyYP6brw.jpg", released:"2012-04-27", budget:60000000}}, {movieId:"94864", properties:{languages:["English", " Scottish Gaelic"], year:2012, imdbId:"1446714", runtime:124, imdbRating:7.0, countries:["USA", " UK"], imdbVotes:442170, title:"Prometheus", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/70981", revenue:403170142, tmdbId:"70981", plot:"Following clues to the origin of mankind a team journey across the universe and find a structure on a distant planet containing a monolithic statue of a humanoid head and stone cylinders of alien blood but they soon find they are not alone.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qsYQflQhOuhDpQ0W2aOcwqgDAeI.jpg", released:"2012-06-08", budget:130000000}}, {movieId:"94896", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2011, imdbId:"1704573", runtime:104, imdbRating:6.8, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:43682, title:"Bernie", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/92591", revenue:9206470, tmdbId:"92591", plot:"In small-town Texas, an affable mortician strikes up a friendship with a wealthy widow, though when she starts to become controlling, he goes to great lengths to separate himself from her grasp.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gDCYRqLONVy2OgrK86kHndKMSNu.jpg", released:"2012-06-22", budget:5000000}}, {movieId:"94919", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2010, imdbId:"1196340", runtime:83, imdbRating:6.7, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:5329, title:"Inhale", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/12645", revenue:55089, tmdbId:"12645", plot:"A couple goes to dangerous lengths to find a lung donor for their daughter.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7S97BXpis6X9XdFwZ6WcyX2Ne1L.jpg", released:"2010-10-22", budget:10000000}}, {movieId:"94931", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2011, imdbId:"1592281", runtime:11