d) (Doragon bôru Z: Kono yo de ichiban tsuyoi yatsu)", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/39100", tmdbId:"39100", plot:"The Z-Fighters must stop a mad scientist out to take over the world.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5elbm3iLgGQ6nA5vqUmi9vIojbF.jpg", released:"1998-05-26"}}, {movieId:"95167", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1217209", runtime:93, imdbRating:7.2, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:261453, title:"Brave", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/62177", revenue:538983207, tmdbId:"62177", plot:"Determined to make her own path in life, Princess Merida defies a custom that brings chaos to her kingdom. Granted one wish, Merida must rely on her bravery and her archery skills to undo a beastly curse.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fg57nIBn2xQw8JZKIX6AzMa3pEp.jpg", released:"2012-06-22", budget:185000000}}, {movieId:"95182", properties:{languages:["Japanese"], year:1990, imdbId:"0142233", runtime:60, imdbRating:7.1, countries:["Japan"], imdbVotes:4298, title:"Dragon Ball Z the Movie: The Tree of Might (Doragon bôru Z 3: Chikyû marugoto chô kessen)", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/39101", tmdbId:"39101", plot:"A group of aliens visit Earth to plant the Tree of Might, a plant that grants cosmic power by draining the Earth's life force.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fDX4Dp8IKvjBAaEb5MOJrGkxWX0.jpg", released:"1998-03-17"}}, {movieId:"95199", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1586265", runtime:110, imdbRating:5.7, countries:["USA"], title:"What to Expect When You're Expecting", imdbVotes:55598, url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/76494", revenue:79700000, tmdbId:"76494", plot:"Follows the lives of five interconnected couples as they experience the thrills and surprises of having a baby, and realize that no matter what you plan for, life does not always deliver what is expected.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/WlaRQOeoUfKntGmNsuZDu3r6h6.jpg", released:"2012-05-18", budget:40000000}}, {movieId:"95201", properties:{languages:["English", " Italian"], year:2012, imdbId:"1859650", runtime:112, imdbRating:6.3, countries:["USA", " Italy", " Spain"], imdbVotes:65758, title:"To Rome with Love", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/81836", revenue:73244881, tmdbId:"81836", plot:"The lives of some visitors and residents of Rome and the romances, adventures and predicaments they get into.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fsjsSeBFVuih7XpxyNVatq5vi39.jpg", released:"2012-07-06", budget:17000000}}, {movieId:"95207", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1611224", runtime:105, imdbRating:5.9, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:125341, title:"Abraham Lincoln: Vampire Hunter", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/72331", revenue:116471580, tmdbId:"72331", plot:"Abraham Lincoln, the 16th President of the United States, discovers vampires are planning to take over the United States. He makes it his mission to eliminate them.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qv8deK0ZmutAuEpejruQKApIy6r.jpg", released:"2012-06-22", budget:69000000}}, {movieId:"95307", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1336608", runtime:123, imdbRating:5.9, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:60561, title:"Rock of Ages", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/80585", revenue:59418613, tmdbId:"80585", plot:"A small town girl and a city boy meet on the Sunset Strip, while pursuing their Hollywood dreams.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vQiMImdW7T28ETeftN9YIxn9HDf.jpg", released:"2012-06-15", budget:75000000}}, {movieId:"95309", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1307068", runtime:101, imdbRating:6.7, countries:["USA", " Singapore", " Malaysia", " Indonesia"], imdbVotes:84192, title:"Seeking a Friend for the End of the World", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/88005", revenue:9636289, tmdbId:"88005", plot:"As an asteroid nears Earth, a man finds himself al