ed to be bridesmaids at a wedding of a woman they used to ridicule back in high school.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4yBMcZPbb6ytBjYXfJ6lHtMkbeV.jpg", released:"2012-09-06", budget:3000000}}, {movieId:"96588", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1981677", runtime:112, imdbRating:7.2, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:204568, title:"Pitch Perfect", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/114150", revenue:115400000, tmdbId:"114150", plot:"Beca, a freshman at Barden University, is cajoled into joining The Bellas, her school's all-girls singing group. Injecting some much needed energy into their repertoire, The Bellas take on their male rivals in a campus competition.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ntRIoh8Qf1BI1AYGx0STfq0wUmb.jpg", released:"2012-10-05", budget:17000000}}, {movieId:"96590", properties:{languages:["English", " Spanish"], year:2012, imdbId:"1366365", runtime:93, imdbRating:4.9, countries:["USA", " Spain"], imdbVotes:27805, title:"Cold Light of Day, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/77948", revenue:16863583, tmdbId:"77948", plot:"After his family is kidnapped during their sailing trip in Spain, a young Wall Street trader is confronted by the people responsible: intelligence agents looking to recover a mysterious briefcase.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jLmKMhibZjHUYtsHQLIa5UBwqcc.jpg", released:"2012-09-07", budget:20000000}}, {movieId:"96606", properties:{year:2011, imdbId:"0770802", runtime:102, imdbRating:8.5, countries:["USA", " Indonesia", " Singapore", " Thailand", " Kenya", " Denmark", " Brazil", " Jordan", " United Arab Emirates", " Saudi Arabia", " South Africa", " Italy", " Ghana", " Egypt", " China", " Japan"], imdbVotes:20856, title:"Samsara", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/89708", tmdbId:"89708", plot:"Filmed over nearly five years in twenty-five countries on five continents, and shot on seventy-millimetre film, Samsara transports us to the varied worlds of sacred grounds, disaster zones, industrial complexes, and natural wonders.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wqoxzWwHn93heUxfcMYPhNqQ45d.jpg", released:"2012-08-23", budget:4000000}}, {movieId:"96610", properties:{languages:["English", " French"], year:2012, imdbId:"1276104", runtime:119, imdbRating:7.4, countries:["USA", " China"], imdbVotes:414789, title:"Looper", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/59967", revenue:47042000, tmdbId:"59967", plot:"In 2074, when the mob wants to get rid of someone, the target is sent into the past, where a hired gun awaits - someone like Joe - who one day learns the mob wants to 'close the loop' by sending back Joe's future self for assassination.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sNjL6SqErDBE8OUZlrDLkexfsCj.jpg", released:"2012-09-28", budget:30000000}}, {movieId:"96616", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1232200", runtime:116, imdbRating:5.6, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:68230, title:"That's My Boy", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/87428", revenue:58058367, tmdbId:"87428", plot:"While in his teens, Donny fathered a son, Todd, and raised him as a single parent up until Todd's 18th birthday. Now, after not seeing each other for years, Todd's world comes crashing down when Donny resurfaces just before Todd's wedding.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/k2p75dVFoIw5nxlm97hnE0yYgFG.jpg", released:"2012-06-15", budget:70000000}}, {movieId:"96634", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2011, imdbId:"1757742", runtime:80, imdbRating:5.1, countries:["Spain"], imdbVotes:9286, title:"Apartment 143", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/97795", revenue:4132000, tmdbId:"97795", plot:"A team of parapsychologists try to figure out a strange phenomenon occurring in an apartment building.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/boNcJHHlJfuFDh5BrmUCxw7ffXy.jpg", released:"2012-05-04"}}, {movieId:"96655", properties:{languages:["English"], year: