ures she hopes will help her come to terms with approaching 30 as a single woman.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fnPAvlWX3HhHC8HlQWKJHgLrwVD.jpg", released:"2012-06-08"}}, {movieId:"96728", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1560747", runtime:144, imdbRating:7.1, countries:["USA"], imdbVotes:100728, title:"Master, The", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/68722", revenue:28258060, tmdbId:"68722", plot:"A Naval veteran arrives home from war unsettled and uncertain of his future - until he is tantalized by The Cause and its charismatic leader.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rUSjbyvYWN9H4az8xt0tDtU7I6v.jpg", released:"2012-09-21", budget:32000000}}, {movieId:"96737", properties:{languages:["English"], year:2012, imdbId:"1343727", runtime:95, imdbRating:7.0, countries:["UK", " USA", " India", " South Africa"], imdbVotes:196098, title:"Dredd", url:"https://themoviedb.org/movie/49049", revenue:41037742, tmdbId:"49049", plot:"In a violent, futuristic city where the police have the authority to act as judge, jury and executioner, a cop teams with a trainee to take down a gang that deals the reality-altering drug, SLO-MO.", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wLx65gtGVnUFCxceHWGszcruCZj.jpg", released:"2012-09-21", budget:50000000}}] AS row
