of Florida by lethal injection on October 9, 2002...", died:date('2002-10-09'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oKR3uMXK6DDGDn57r2fLDXPrr2E.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/978103"}}, {tmdbId:"2048005", properties:{imdbId:"3613206", name:"Terry Humphreys-Slay", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2048005"}}, {tmdbId:"2048052", properties:{name:"Leitha Prather", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2048052"}}, {tmdbId:"2978", properties:{bornIn:"Hampstead, London, England, UK", imdbId:"1540404", born:date('1985-09-16'), name:"Max Minghella", bio:"Max Giorgio Choa Minghella (born 16 September 1985) is an English actor.  The son of late film director Anthony Minghella, he has appeared in several dramatic American films, making his feature film debut in 2005's Bee Season and starring in 2006's Art School Confidential.  He also appears as Divya Narendra, one of the Harvard upperclassmen who sues Mark Zuckerberg for stealing the idea behind Facebook, in 2010's The Social Network...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/Ss5K1HMrYtB8jtirYXK27EwwzV.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2978"}}, {tmdbId:"3971", properties:{bornIn:"London, United Kingdom", imdbId:"0617009", born:date('1980-03-18'), name:"Sophia Myles", bio:"Sophia Jane Myles is an English actress, best known in film for portraying Erika in Underworld, Lady Penelope Creighton-Ward in the live-action Thunderbirds film, Isolde in Tristan and Isolde and Darcy in Transformers: Age of Extinction, and has received critical acclaim for her television work, particularly as Madame de Pompadour in the Doctor Who episode \"The Girl in the Fireplace\" and Beth Turner in Moonlight...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9BfeK3boi3r1BNUkmcR6iwtxL4Z.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/3971"}}, {tmdbId:"59373", properties:{bornIn:"St Germain en Laye, France", imdbId:"0858048", born:date('1981-07-17'), name:"Mélanie Thierry", bio:"Mélanie Thierry began her career as a sought-after child and teen model in France, then moved into acting.  She began with a series of roles in French productions, choosing her parts carefully as most of them were critically acclaimed.  Not long thereafter, the actress scored an international crossover hit at age 18 as the love interest of ship-bound Danny Boodman T. D.  Lemon 1900 in The Legend of 1900...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tFLXyZDtZi6dloxOCqCr8wpj9hu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/59373"}}, {tmdbId:"60722", properties:{imdbId:"0033505", born:date('1971-11-13'), name:"Nathaniel Arcand", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4PJfx6692MnXtI6R0lryc4OLXhE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/60722"}}, {tmdbId:"62911", properties:{bornIn:"Toronto, Ontario, Canada", imdbId:"0100068", born:date('1970-04-08'), name:"JR Bourne", bio:"David J. R.  Bourne (born April 8, 1970) is a Canadian actor.  He is perhaps best known in Canada for his appearance in a Molson I Am Canadian television commercial.  Outside of Canada, he is best known in Stargate SG-1 as Martouf...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jrcOdB3xmXjXBjmBLMoCDolfm3P.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/62911"}}, {tmdbId:"1222431", properties:{bornIn:"Seoul, South Korea", imdbId:"4949776", born:date('1957-04-07'), name:"Kap-su Kim", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6XdYfZY8FAuhRFdn9ND9izYjvQM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1222431"}}, {tmdbId:"37939", properties:{bornIn:"Seoul, South Korea", imdbId:"0947514", born:date('1972-07-28'), name:"Jung-ah Yum", bio:"Yum Jung-ah is a South Korean actress.  Her notable films include A Tale of Two Sisters, The Big Swindle, The Old Garden, and Cart, as well as the television series Royal Family.  She is best known for her role of Han Seo Jin in the jTBC drama \"SKY Castle\". \n\nShe was also the first runner-up in the 1991 Miss Korea Beauty Pageant...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qFDiH42llLwhhY2wF7VwK4Zxsya.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/37939"}}, {tmdbId:"57770", properties:{imdbId:"0587920", name:"Arlin Miller", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57770"}}] AS row
