UNWIND [{tmdbId:"57771", properties:{imdbId:"2140514", name:"Azucena Medina", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57771"}}, {tmdbId:"57772", properties:{imdbId:"0583664", name:"Jonah Meyerson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57772"}}, {tmdbId:"47774", properties:{bornIn:"Bronx - New York - USA", imdbId:"0665114", born:date('1946-07-14'), name:"Vincent Pastore", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nVincent Pastore (born July 14, 1946) is an Italian-American actor, often cast as a mobster and best known for the role of Salvatore \"Big Pussy\" Bonpensiero on The Sopranos...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kM70EoHE84a9BAcih0u47InfEzH.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/47774"}}, {tmdbId:"37934", properties:{bornIn:"Atlanta, Georgia, USA", imdbId:"0071275", born:date('1975-05-27'), name:"André Benjamin", bio:"Better known by his stage name André 3000 (formerly known as Dre, no association with Dr.  Dre) is an American rapper, singer-songwriter, multi-instrumentalist, record producer and actor, best known for being part of American hip-hop duo OutKast alongside fellow rapper Big Boi.   As an actor, his role as Jimi Hendrix in Jimi: All is by my Side (2013) got him an Independent Spirit Awards nomination for Best Lead Actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uk5l9JajYAlCJomZWFHnz7XZ5bP.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/37934"}}, {tmdbId:"2959", properties:{bornIn:"Cricklewood, North London, England, UK", imdbId:"1315378", born:date('1978-11-23'), name:"Kayvan Novak", bio:"Kayvan Novak (born 23 November 1978, Cricklewood, North London) is an award winning British Iranian television actor and voice artist. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kayvan Novak, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/y5HFz3JRGTjXTNaaB8eYolZVVeF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2959"}}, {tmdbId:"2960", properties:{bornIn:"Cairo Egypt", imdbId:"0906756", born:date('1973-04-12'), name:"Amr Waked", bio:"Amr Waked was born in Cairo, Egypt in 1972.  He studied economics and theatre in the American University in Cairo.  In his early experience as an actor Amr joined the Temple Theatre Troop in 1994, and Yaaru Theatre Troop in 1999, where he trained and developed his tools as a stage performer.  With his experience onstage, Waked managed to film his first role on the big screen in 1998 when he joined Ossama Fawzy's of \"Gannet El Shayateen\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5rMQibz1vTvs8nfNQOvd4gpQvCX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2960"}}, {tmdbId:"11108", properties:{bornIn:"Brockworth, Gloucestershire, England, UK", imdbId:"0670408", born:date('1970-02-14'), name:"Simon Pegg", bio:"Simon Pegg (born Simon John Beckingham) is an English comedic actor, writer, producer and director. \n\nHe is best known for his TV show Spaced, about two roommates, as well as his film Shaun of the Dead, which he described as a 'Romantic Zombie Comedy'.   In 2009 he played Montgomery \"Scotty\" Scott in the Star Trek Reboot, taking over the iconic role previously played by James Doohan, In 2005 he married Maureen McCann in Glasgow, Scotland.   In 2009 the pair had their first child...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6ftW0kUeYno1kYfuwSTBILOtxjj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11108"}}, {tmdbId:"11110", properties:{bornIn:"Oldham, Lancashire, England", imdbId:"0038918", born:date('1972-05-28'), name:"Kate Ashfield", bio:"Kate Ashfield (born 28 May 1972) is a British actress, best known for her award-winning roles as Jody in the Anglo-German film Late Night Shopping, as Sadie MacGregor in the British film This Little Life and as Liz in the 2004 film Shaun of the Dead. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kate Ashfield, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vqYDC94BXLsSPcLifZ3ax0gFS4z.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11110"}}, {tmdbId:"11109", properties:{bornIn:"Essex, England, UK", imdbId:"0296545", born:date('1972-03-28'), name:"Nick Frost", bio:"Nicholas John \"Nick\" Frost (born 28 March 1972) is an English actor, comedian and screenwriter.  He is best known for his work with Edgar Wright and Simon Pegg in the role of Mike Watt in the television comedy Spaced, as well as the film characters Ed in Shaun of the Dead, PC/Sgt.  Danny Butterman in Hot Fuzz and Clive Gollings in Paul. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Nick Frost, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2CHS4t6miNGLgMQAjhFqb4fFuKS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11109"}}, {tmdbId:"11111", properties:{bornIn:"Solihull, West Midlands, England, UK", imdbId:"0205063", born:date('1973-01-02'), name:"Lucy Davis", bio:"Lucy Clare Davis (born 17 February 1973) is an English actress.  She played the role of Dawn Tinsley in the BBC comedy The Office, as well as Dianne in the horror-comedy movie Shaun of the Dead, Hayley in The Archers, and Etta Candy in Wonder Woman (2017). \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Lucy Davis, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/A1ymILbxQA5w5TduCNaU0xD9C5a.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11111"}}, {tmdbId:"22297", properties:{bornIn:"Walnut Creek, California, USA", imdbId:"0309307", born:date('1960-07-14'), name:"Kyle Gass", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jt6JBoxhMxjYrX97Sh4VjcBFCla.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/22297"}}, {tmdbId:"938432", properties:{bornIn:"Corvallis - Oregon - USA", imdbId:"0715469", born:date('1967-12-13'), name:"JR Reed", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/938432"}}, {tmdbId:"22304", properties:{bornIn:"Portsmouth, New Hampshire, USA", imdbId:"0227875", born:date('1942-07-10'), name:"Ronnie James Dio", bio:"Ronnie James Dio (born Ronald James Padavona, July 10, 1942 – May 16, 2010), was an American rock and heavy metal vocalist and songwriter.  He performed with, among others, Elf, Rainbow, Black Sabbath, Heaven &amp; Hell, and his own band Dio.  Other musical projects include the collective fundraiser Hear 'n Aid.  He was widely hailed as one of the most powerful singers in heavy metal, renowned for his consistently powerful voice...", died:date('2010-05-16'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7Evbpxnzqxv0qY7tYGxhknJP5Mj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/22304"}}, {tmdbId:"41292", properties:{bornIn:"Fountain Valley, California, USA", imdbId:"0005392", born:date('1976-03-23'), name:"Keri Russell", bio:"Keri Lynn Russell (born March 23, 1976) is an American actress and dancer.  After appearing in a number of made-for-television films and series during the mid-1990s, she came to fame for portraying the title role of Felicity Porter on the series Felicity, which ran from 1998 to 2002, and for which she won a Golden Globe Award...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/u81mC6vZwliDRfnX1DpdGmmex61.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/41292"}}, {tmdbId:"31132", properties:{bornIn:"Kansas City, Missouri, USA", imdbId:"1551922", born:date('1982-09-19'), name:"Columbus Short", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nColumbus Keith Short, Jr.  (born September 19, 1982 in Kansas City, Missouri) is an American choreographer, actor, and singer.  He choreographed Britney Spears's Onyx Hotel Tour and worked with Brian Friedman (of So You Think You Can Dance fame).  He has two brothers, John Rancipher and Chris Staples.  Short relocated to Los Angeles when he was five years old and immediately began working in a youth theater...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rUHCNAvu9xOmBP7i9jAABR7j5cg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/31132"}}, {tmdbId:"584336", properties:{imdbId:"0014940", name:"Adriana Aizemberg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/584336"}}, {tmdbId:"74911", properties:{bornIn:"La Plata, Buenos Aires, Argentina", imdbId:"0195639", born:date('1938-04-28'), name:"Jorge D'Elía", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/w7J0R0dMLLHSFWj7J70g65ajuwS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74911"}}, {tmdbId:"934904", properties:{imdbId:"0096815", name:"Sergio Boris", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kA3swDftUvCyCGRylCDpjxmtFis.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/934904"}}, {tmdbId:"21798", properties:{bornIn:"Syracuse, New York, USA", imdbId:"0582257", born:date('1970-04-11'), name:"Johnny Messner", bio:"​Johnny Messner is an American film and television actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4xCQ8AYsEFThxh5vL9a03TrwPoU.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/21798"}}, {tmdbId:"20388", properties:{bornIn:"Patterson - Georgia - USA", imdbId:"0834380", born:date('1975-12-14'), name:"KaDee Strickland", bio:"Katherine Dee \"KaDee\" Strickland (born December 14, 1975) is an American actress currently known for her role as Charlotte King on the ABC drama Private Practice.  Well-known in her hometown of Patterson, Georgia, when she was a child, she began acting during high school.  Strickland studied the profession in Philadelphia and New York City, where she obtained mostly small roles in film, television and theater projects, among them The Sixth Sense (1999)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/73xvqIpgGN4KqfFQJQR6q54I6FA.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20388"}}] AS row
