s of Anarchy.  He also provides the second voice of Cliffjumper in the animated series Transformers: Prime...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xE1AQdJeTwgrFq7hdSeSjaHNL9h.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/64805"}}, {tmdbId:"25849", properties:{bornIn:"Montclair - New Jersey - USA", imdbId:"0121404", born:date('1958-07-30'), name:"Richard Burgi", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nRichard William Burgi (born July 30, 1958) is an American film and television actor.  He's best known for the roles of Det.  Jim Ellinson on The Sentinel and as Karl Mayer on Desperate Housewives...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8hMuuX76Syy4ZUfC0sns02t76Oi.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25849"}}, {tmdbId:"56447", properties:{bornIn:"Minneapolis, Minnesota, USA", imdbId:"1023018", born:date('1976-02-17'), name:"Kelly Carlson", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nKelly Lee Carlson (born February 17, 1976) is an American actress and model.  She is best known for her role as Kimber Henry on Nip/Tuck.  In 2001 she was listed on Tear Sheet Magazine's 50 Most Beautiful list...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ixaaYmWOznjPO1hD2QGRQO6gDu6.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/56447"}}, {tmdbId:"64806", properties:{imdbId:"0141550", name:"Cy Carter", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/64806"}}, {tmdbId:"28414", properties:{bornIn:"Michigan, USA", imdbId:"0504762", born:date('1970-06-26'), name:"Matt Letscher", bio:"Actor / Performer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1XY921058aXNLCHRJO8AumhsCmI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/28414"}}, {tmdbId:"1437004", properties:{imdbId:"1377079", name:"Adam Greer", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1437004"}}, {tmdbId:"53256", properties:{bornIn:"Flint, Michigan, USA ", imdbId:"0187719", born:date('1968-07-30'), name:"Terry Crews", bio:"Terrence Alan Crews (born July 30, 1968) is an American actor, comedian, activist, artist, bodybuilder and former professional football player.  Crews played Julius Rock on the UPN/CW sitcom Everybody Hates Chris.  He hosted the U. S.  version of the game show Who Wants to Be a Millionaire and starred in the BET reality series The Family Crews.  He appeared in films such as Friday After Next (2002), White Chicks (2004), Idiocracy (2006), Blended (2014), and the Expendables series...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pxTY4SglLo5hFcMH00MxPeC5u55.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53256"}}, {tmdbId:"58441", properties:{imdbId:"0757015", born:date('1971-02-14'), name:"Noriko Sakai", bio:"Noriko Sakai is a Japanese singer and actress.  She was born in Japan, Fukuoka, debuting in 1986 as an idol singer identity, when her short hair style, sweet smile, youthful image became a talking point...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eKIjlHefxm4NnSds3KTrjCNuy85.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58441"}}, {tmdbId:"58442", properties:{imdbId:"0639122", name:"Chiharu Niiyama", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bOHqbQ5FQJ3ABPbTvTSZ0b9wySy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58442"}}, {tmdbId:"58443", properties:{imdbId:"0394676", born:date('1978-10-04'), name:"Kei Horie", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58443"}}, {tmdbId:"16789", properties:{imdbId:"2049833", name:"Aaran Thomas", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sSsQKswXWHZXrpnN3hkq1ptXZ7f.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/16789"}}, {tmdbId:"16791", properties:{imdbId:"2310130", name:"Helena-Lia Tachovská", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/16791"}}, {tmdbId:"223293", properties:{bornIn:"Rio de Janeiro, Rio de Janeiro, Brazil", imdbId:"0560412", born:date('1961-10-08'), name:"André Mattos", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zBJYqarI84E13DAyMSrFRFKqHIn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/223293"}}, {tmdbId:"123761", properties:{bornIn:"Brejo da Madre de Deus, Pernambuco, Braz