aq.  He became famous for his appearance in the documentary Control Room, which documented his conversation with Al Jazeera correspondent Hassan Ibrahim...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/556952"}}, {tmdbId:"556953", properties:{name:"Hassan Ibrahim", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/556953"}}, {tmdbId:"56457", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0305083", born:date('1978-11-28'), name:"Aimee Garcia", bio:"Aimee Garcia (born November 28, 1978, height 5' 2\" (1,57 m)) is an American actress, known for her roles as Veronica Palmero on the sitcom George Lopez and more recently, Marisa Benez in the NBC series, Trauma. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Aimee Garcia, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n0hKZHujbdzjkti2y4s7w48boTB.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/56457"}}, {tmdbId:"109419", properties:{imdbId:"0847543", name:"Ken Takemoto", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/109419"}}, {tmdbId:"34070", properties:{bornIn:"El Paso, Texas, USA", imdbId:"0954253", born:date('1981-02-05'), name:"Nora Zehetner", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nNora Angela Zehetner  (born February 5, 1981) is an American film and television actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/phkIjo1nXj9i8FMkZWWa1IXU5pI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/34070"}}, {tmdbId:"57286", properties:{bornIn:"White Plains - New York - USA", imdbId:"0281575", born:date('1984-04-16'), name:"Noah Fleiss", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nNoah Fleiss  (born April 16, 1984) is an American film and television actor.  He was born in White Plains, New York.  Fleiss made his screen debut as a young runaway (Sam Whitney) who drives cross-country with his brother in Josh and S. A. M.  (1993), perhaps his best-known film.  He also has appeared in films such as Joe the King (1999), The Laramie Project (2002) (very briefly), and Brick (2005), in which he portrayed the intimidating Tug...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57286"}}, {tmdbId:"52037", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, United States", imdbId:"0722647", born:date('1983-01-07'), name:"Robert Ri'chard", bio:"Robert Ri'chard (born January 7, 1983) is an American television and movie actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/36cxvHbHtvl476v8lrqY7Cv3Jm7.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52037"}}, {tmdbId:"53184", properties:{bornIn:"Brooklyn, New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"0327779", born:date('1979-06-30'), name:"Rick Gonzalez", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nRick Gonzalez (born June 30, 1979) is an American actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ghcqBGJwRIreUmeKBgqp1a0cvUy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53184"}}, {tmdbId:"1821650", properties:{name:"Xolani Mali", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/i6XvZ3MTguffOKuPzfRJliDiXDb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1821650"}}, {tmdbId:"2602", properties:{imdbId:"0239221", born:date('1969-11-27'), name:"Desmond Dube", bio:"Desmond Dube is a South African singer, actor, mime artist and entertainer.  He is known for his work in The No.  1 Ladies' Detective Agency, Hotel Rwanda, Friends Indeed, Suburban Bliss and Joburg Blues...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2602"}}, {tmdbId:"2603", properties:{bornIn:"Nigeria", imdbId:"0434444", born:date('1962-10-01'), name:"Hakeem Kae-Kazim", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sVNHRm51c9toG73FUQ5k1St0vju.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2603"}}, {tmdbId:"65727", properties:{bornIn:"Perrysburg, Ohio", imdbId:"0415382", born:date('1977-01-29'), name:"Sam Jaeger", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nSamuel Heath Jaeger (born January 29, 1977) is an American actor and screenwriter. \n\nJaeger graduated from Perrysburg High School in 1995 and in 1999, he received a Bachelor of Fine Arts Degree at Otterbein College.  He married Amber Marie Mellott on 25 August 2007. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Sam Jaeger, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65727"}}] AS row
