Haiti.  When he was 5 years old, moved with his  family to Am rica.  Dominican and Haitian descent, he was raised by his  mother.  He attended the New World School of Performing Arts in Miami and  later graduated from the Goodman School of Drama.  Allan participated in  numerous roles on television during the d each of the 90's.  In 1995 he  moved to Los Angeles where he eventually studied at The Actors'Lab...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/31139"}}, {tmdbId:"1182082", properties:{imdbId:"1577617", name:"Lance Lee Davis", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1182082"}}, {tmdbId:"58746", properties:{imdbId:"0110791", name:"Adam Larson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58746"}}, {tmdbId:"37046", properties:{bornIn:"Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic", imdbId:"1268158", born:date('1979-11-08'), name:"Dania Ramirez", bio:"Dania Jissel Ramirez is a Latin American actress on television and in film.  Born in Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic, from an early age she knew her calling to be an actress.  As a child, she enjoyed reenacting telenovelas for her relatives.  A modeling scout saw her working in a store at the age of 15, which led to her first acting job, in an ad for soda.  She later apprenticed in the Actor's Workshop in N. Y. C.  She then relocated to L. A.  to develop her acting ambition...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jfRcoVQLnLb90fnUr3waktfRUYE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/37046"}}, {tmdbId:"77799", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California", imdbId:"0026285", born:date('1977-02-04'), name:"Shedrack Anderson III", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nShedrack Anderson III (born February 4, 1977) is an American actor.  Shedrack Anderson III appeared in the hit teen series Just Deal as the lovable Jermaine Green.  He starred as Tommy in Lifetime's Gracie's Choice alongside Diane Ladd and Anne Heche.  He made his film debut as one of the Lost Boys in Steven Spielberg's Hook...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pzl64BAiUu6kyHh32dcIv9oip2r.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/77799"}}, {tmdbId:"27561", properties:{imdbId:"0829165", born:date('2018-05-01'), name:"Amy Stewart", bio:"Amy Stewart is an actress...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/27561"}}, {tmdbId:"1045630", properties:{imdbId:"1073961", name:"Steve Ross", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1045630"}}, {tmdbId:"85880", properties:{bornIn:"Nashville, Tennessee, USA", imdbId:"0021523", born:date('1947-12-08'), name:"Gregg Allman", bio:"Gregory LeNoir Allman (December 8, 1947 – May 27, 2017) was an American singer-songwriter and musician.  He was known for performing in the Allman Brothers Band.  Allman grew up with an interest in rhythm and blues music, and the Allman Brothers Band fused it with rock music, jazz, and country at times.  He wrote several of the band's biggest songs, including \"Whipping Post\", \"Melissa\", and \"Midnight Rider\".  Allman also had a successful solo career, releasing seven studio albums...", died:date('2017-05-27'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qnHDsmH5WZuL2pCpRcPgRAL8rrQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85880"}}, {tmdbId:"2719614", properties:{name:"James Blood Ulmer", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2719614"}}] AS row
