 who has appeared in films such as Wedding Crashers (2005) and The Texas Chainsaw Massacre: The Beginning (2006). \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Diora Baird, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8xNfIVNDumyxqGJw71DleJ5YugK.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/59263"}}, {tmdbId:"66743", properties:{bornIn:"Webster Groves, Missouri, USA", imdbId:"0093589", born:date('1977-10-11'), name:"Matt Bomer", bio:"Matthew Staton \"Matt\" Bomer (born October 11, 1977) is an American actor.  He made his television debut with Guiding Light in 2001, and gained recognition with his recurring role in the NBC television series Chuck.  He played the lead role of con-artist and thief Neal Caffrey in the USA Network series White Collar from 2009 to 2014...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oxL27Z3XtjoABaOynKazZeg7qKM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/66743"}}, {tmdbId:"185999", properties:{bornIn:"The Gambia", imdbId:"0537158", born:date('1938-09-08'), name:"Louis Mahoney", died:date('2020-06-30'), url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/185999"}}, {tmdbId:"25616", properties:{bornIn:"San Cristobal, Venezuela", imdbId:"1183149", born:date('1977-03-25'), name:"Edgar Ramirez", bio:"Edgar Ramirez Arellano is a venezuelan actor.  He played Carlos in the 2010 French-German biopic series Carlos, a role for which he won the César Award for Most Promising Actor at the César Awards 2011. \n\nHis first recognition as an actor was the successful soap opera Cosita Rica, for Venevisión which aired in September 2003 to August 2004 lasting 270 episodes.  In 2005, he made his major motion picture début playing Choco, Domino Harvey's love interest in the film Domino directed by Tony Scott...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7VZnIAI7Yye0rfs7fPM5wI2CI6N.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25616"}}, {tmdbId:"32987", properties:{bornIn:"Leeds, West Yorkshire, England, UK ", imdbId:"0727165", born:date('1980-01-08'), name:"Sam Riley", bio:"He is best known for playing the lead role of Ian Curtis in the movie Control, a biopic about the lead singer of the 1970s post-punk band Joy Division.  His performance in the role won him the British Independent Film Award for \"Most Promising Newcomer\". [1].  He also won a Kermode for Best Actor 2007 for the film.   Prior to his portrayal of Ian Curtis, Riley played The Fall frontman Mark E.  Smith in the Michael Winterbottom film 24 Hour Party People, which details the Factory Records era...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wLFM6CyVQgXx24ou244MYDa6ouh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/32987"}}, {tmdbId:"29234", properties:{bornIn:"England, U.K.", imdbId:"1725848", born:date('1982-03-26'), name:"Joe Anderson", bio:"An English film actor, probably best known for his performances in Across the Universe, Becoming Jane, Control, The Ruins and The Crazies...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/x0Fz2mIMU4Prk7I43pn87Fyno40.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/29234"}}, {tmdbId:"106514", properties:{imdbId:"1400940", name:"Dustin Seavey", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/106514"}}, {tmdbId:"2841", properties:{bornIn:" Boston, Massachusetts, United States", imdbId:"0284315", born:date('1978-08-10'), name:"Alison Folland", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nAlison Folland (born August 10, 1978) is an American actress. \n\nFolland was born in Boston, Massachusetts to a travel agent mother and a cardiologist father...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yLmmUn8Ylql4w17eHKz1bCUO93l.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2841"}}, {tmdbId:"232", properties:{bornIn:"Mississauga, Ontario, Canada", imdbId:"0772704", born:date('1984-08-03'), name:"Kyle Schmid", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nKyle Schmid (born August 3, 1984 in Mississauga, Ontario) is a Canadian actor who starred as Henry Fitzroy in Lifetime's series Blood Ties.  He has also guest starred in a number of television series including Degrassi: The Next Generation, Odyssey 5, The Zack Files and CSI: Miami. \n\nIn addition he has also appeared in a number of films like The Covenant, A History of Violence, The Sisterhood of the Traveling Pants, The Pacifier, and Zerophilia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bqT7iz2jzG32axBoQzMrAvLtppQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/232"}}, {tmdbId:"36669", properties:{bornIn:"Oxfordshire, England, UK", imdbId:"1670029", born:date('1981-10-01'), name:"Rupert Friend", bio:"Rupert Friend (born 1 October 1981) is an English film actor, who is best known for his roles as Mr.  Wickham in the 2005 film Pride and Prejudice, Lieutenant Kurt Kotler in the 2008 film The Boy in the Striped Pajamas, and Prince Albert in the 2009 film The Young Victoria...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mYgY8LrMkQ4OkGTIOf6MtkbMnnW.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/36669"}}, {tmdbId:"47733", properties:{bornIn:"Bromley, Greater London, England", imdbId:"1483730", born:date('1981-10-25'), name:"Zoë Tapper", bio:"Zoë Tapper (born 1981) is an English actress who first came to prominence playing Nell Gwynne in Richard Eyre's award-winning film Stage Beauty in 2004.  She is known for portraying Anya Raczynski in Survivors and Mina Harker in Demons...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qLJ4jYVTV0MMMiu3XRlmQrh5AxQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/47733"}}, {tmdbId:"135180", properties:{bornIn:"Bristol, England, UK", imdbId:"0485894", born:date('1934-09-24'), name:"Robert Lang", bio:"Robert Lang was a British an actor of stage and screen, best known for Four Weddings and a Funeral (1994), and the 1977-1978 BBC TV series 1990.  He was married to the actress Ann Bell...", died:date('2004-11-06'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5SrAyoTZ78f9eeW8xRAzTmjHsFu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/135180"}}, {tmdbId:"1297074", properties:{imdbId:"2334051", name:"Jeremy Madrona", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1297074"}}, {tmdbId:"1297075", properties:{imdbId:"2329281", name:"Jae Mamuyac", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1297075"}}, {tmdbId:"42186", properties:{bornIn:"Burbank, California, USA", imdbId:"0425610", born:date('1957-08-01'), name:"Laura Johnson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/42186"}}, {tmdbId:"6108", properties:{bornIn:"Raleigh, North Carolina, USA", imdbId:"0698346", born:date('1968-10-08'), name:"Emily Procter", bio:"Emily Procter is an American film and television actress, best known for her leading role as Calleigh Duquesne in \"CSI: Miami\", and her recurring role as Ainsley Hayes in \"The West Wing\".  She holds a degree in Journalism and Dance from East Carolina University, Greenville, North Carolina, USA...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vGE1IXBlLIKNjxpobtr4ynGFfeP.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6108"}}] AS row
