dysfunctional family whose best friend is a stuffed animal rabbit named Mr.  Floppy.  He is also known for his roles on the soap opera Ryan's Hope, and the series Dexter...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vIhxKBwqV19CwHdPuycmkchYOba.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25879"}}, {tmdbId:"155018", properties:{imdbId:"0294062", name:"Colby French", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nColby French is an American actor.  He is best known for playing Hank on the NBC drama, Heroes...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/155018"}}, {tmdbId:"206759", properties:{bornIn:"Winsted, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"0618873", born:date('1934-02-27'), name:"Ralph Nader", bio:"Ralph Nader is an American progressive political activist, and four-time candidate for President of the United States, having run as a Green Party candidate in 1996 and 2000, and as an independent candidate in 2004 and 2008.  He is also an author, lecturer, and attorney. \n\nAreas of particular concern to Nader include consumer protection, humanitarianism, environmentalism, and democratic government...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7XLmx5ABllodALPBx5V87HqdKbS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/206759"}}, {tmdbId:"1230027", properties:{imdbId:"0118059", name:"Pat Buchanan", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dd42aFTbrbsNj3QoRsKePk8mLWQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1230027"}}, {tmdbId:"116333", properties:{bornIn:"Crawfordsville, Indiana, USA", imdbId:"1927879", born:date('1952-08-26'), name:"Will Shortz", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nWill Shortz (born 26 August 1952 in Crawfordsville, Indiana) is an American puzzle creator and editor, and currently the crossword puzzle editor for The New York Times...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116333"}}, {tmdbId:"116334", properties:{bornIn:"Audubon, New Jersey", imdbId:"2213688", born:date('1950-01-05'), name:"Merl Reagle", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nMerl Reagle (b.  January 5, 1950, Audubon, New Jersey) is an American crossword constructor.  Since 1985, he has constructed a puzzle every Sunday for the San Francisco Chronicle (originally the San Francisco Examiner); it is now also published by the Washington Post, the Los Angeles Times, the Philadelphia Inquirer, the Seattle Times, The Plain Dealer (Cleveland, Ohio), the Hartford Courant, the New York Observer, and the Arizona Daily Star, among others...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116334"}}, {tmdbId:"116335", properties:{bornIn:"Hartford, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"2212124", born:date('1984-11-05'), name:"Tyler Hinman", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nTyler Hinman (born November 5, 1984) is a crossword solver and constructor and a five-time winner of the American Crossword Puzzle Tournament (ACPT).  He won the tournament for the first time as a 20-year-old in 2005 and by 2009 had won five consecutive titles, a feat unprecedented in the 32-year history of the tournament.  Hinman was also one of the featured players in the award-winning 2006 documentary film Wordplay...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116335"}}, {tmdbId:"116336", properties:{bornIn:"Rock Hill, South Carolina, USA", imdbId:"2216537", born:date('1968-08-07'), name:"Trip Payne", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nNorman \"Trip\" Payne (born August 7, 1968) is an American cruciverbalist living in Florida who has published over 4,000 crosswords and variety puzzles...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116336"}}, {tmdbId:"74929", properties:{bornIn:"Arlington, Texas, USA", imdbId:"2202521", born:date('1998-07-22'), name:"Madison Pettis", bio:"Madison Michelle Pettis  (born July 22, 1998) is an American child actress, best known for playing Sophie Martinez \"America's Angel\" on Disney Channel's Cory in the House and Peyton Kelly in The Game Plan...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tPl12ojEIeITLOddJTAAelGb3DX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74929"}}, {tmdbId:"554891", properties:{imdbId:"2167661", name:"Jon Lewis", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/554891"}}, {tmdbId:"554892", properties:{imdbId:"0030618", name:"David Ansen", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/554892"}}, {tmdbId:"554893", properties:{imdbId:"0305018", name:"Martin Garbus", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/554893"}}, {tmdbId:"55935", properties:{bornIn:"Nuova Zelanda", imdbId:"1045593", born:date('1977-01-01'), name:"Loren Taylor", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nLoren Taylor (previously Horsley) is a New Zealand born actress and writer.  She is best known for her role as Lily in the 2007 film Eagle vs Shark directed by Taika Waititi.  She is good friends with Jemaine Clement and his partner, Miranda. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Loren Horsley, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/b7Tu2hSU0rFmg5LHMrMlQOQ6lCW.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/55935"}}, {tmdbId:"41785", properties:{bornIn:"Auckland, New Zealand", imdbId:"0864835", born:date('1971-06-02'), name:"Joel Tobeck", bio:"Born in 1971 in Auckland, New Zealand, He is a well known actor in New Zealand with over 20 years acting experience Joel Tobeck played the main villain Creegan in the TV Series Cleopatra 2525. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Joel Tobeck, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8pzK6mGsSxZ4hGAx1KFhsVRepT4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/41785"}}, {tmdbId:"81878", properties:{imdbId:"0785082", name:"Brian Sergent", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/81878"}}] AS row
