Spanish film actress.  She received a Goya for her role as Queen Joanna of Castile in the 2001 film Juana la Loca, directed by Vicente Aranda (released in the United States as Mad Love). \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Pilar López de Ayala, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fQj0Ka2jlp5PYFtGQxJSVRiOVWZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/98357"}}, {tmdbId:"133091", properties:{bornIn:"Paris, France", imdbId:"1118726", born:date('1974-08-08'), name:"Xavier Lafitte", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/133091"}}, {tmdbId:"133093", properties:{imdbId:"1594891", name:"Laurence Cordier", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fwNjWqTZyBChSpVvPLBvCP6RLxY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/133093"}}, {tmdbId:"1350846", properties:{imdbId:"2749550", name:"Tanja Czichy", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1350846"}}, {tmdbId:"37632", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"1519666", born:date('1982-01-06'), name:"Eddie Redmayne", bio:"Edward John David \"Eddie\" Redmayne (born 6 January 1982) is an English actor and model.  Redmayne won the 2010 Tony Award as best featured actor in a play for his performance in Red...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lfmqgyvyPYXNc3zckQr0wCjoXPx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/37632"}}, {tmdbId:"70883", properties:{bornIn:" Stockholm,  Sweden", imdbId:"0797860", name:"Tusse Silberg", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sofDsjadyHeRiafPclN4i6TChir.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70883"}}, {tmdbId:"383624", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"0771621", born:date('1964-02-21'), name:"Adrian Schiller", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hzaZSk4J0C78bU3zlqLjCruNGBQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/383624"}}, {tmdbId:"935700", properties:{imdbId:"4713266", name:"Elodie Tougne", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/935700"}}, {tmdbId:"20374", properties:{bornIn:"Adelaide, South Australia, Australia", imdbId:"1954240", born:date('1986-02-26'), name:"Teresa Palmer", bio:"An Australian actress, writer, producer and model who made her film debut in the suicide drama 2:37.  She starred in the 2013 film Warm Bodies as a young woman who falls in love with a zombie, and as Rebecca in the 2016 horror film Lights Out...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hRHP2Tv8fYOEeOq1DodUuYM6QMa.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20374"}}, {tmdbId:"65202", properties:{imdbId:"1675002", born:date('1997-03-29'), name:"Nicholas Elia", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qWON5UDV8kBx4Fwcqmv4ownC0CM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65202"}}, {tmdbId:"2485013", properties:{name:"Melissa Holroyd", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2485013"}}, {tmdbId:"22023", properties:{bornIn:"Lubbock, Texas, US", imdbId:"0537732", born:date('1974-10-14'), name:"Natalie Maines", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nNatalie Louise Maines Pasdar (born October 14, 1974) is an American singer-songwriter who achieved success as the lead vocalist for the female alternative country band, the Dixie Chicks.  Born in Lubbock, Texas, Maines considers herself a rebel who \"loved not thinking in the way I knew the majority of people thought. \"\n\nIn 1995, after leaving Berklee College of Music, Maines was recruited by the Dixie Chicks to replace their lead singer, Laura Lynch...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9x0yVNymScI27oynPugHekm7PCS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/22023"}}, {tmdbId:"22025", properties:{bornIn:"York, Pennsylvania United States", imdbId:"0782367", born:date('1969-10-12'), name:"Martie Maguire", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nMartie Maguire (born Martha Elenor Erwin; October 12, 1969) is a Grammy Award-winning American songwriter, multi-instrumentalist, and a founding member of the female alternative country band, the Dixie Chicks.  She won awards in national fiddle championships while still a teenager.  Maguire is accomplished on several other instruments, including the mandolin, viola, acoustic bass, and guitar...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/laCSzn78xRDs8zYWKjrkP6D3Cdt.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/22025"}}] AS row
