Spain", imdbId:"0055432", born:date('1981-07-02'), name:"Jimmy Barnatán", bio:"Jimmy Barnatán was born in Madrid (July, 1981).  He is a spanish actor, known for Torrente, the Dumb Arm of the Law  (1998), The Valdemar Legacy (2010) and the TV Series Servir y proteger (2018-2019)...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/95607"}}, {tmdbId:"5374", properties:{bornIn:"Houston, Texas, USA", imdbId:"1433588", born:date('1973-03-24'), name:"Jim Parsons", bio:"Jim Parsons is an American television and film actor, best known for playing Sheldon Cooper in The Big Bang Theory...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4D5oAUeM2wlejSwJJ6TmKoM9Abn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/5374"}}, {tmdbId:"53863", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, U.S.", imdbId:"0374865", born:date('1980-12-09'), name:"Simon Helberg", bio:"Simon Helberg is an American actor and comedian, best known for his role as Howard Wolowitz in The Big Bang Theory...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9tLEc6N4lImJX4FohLWHRHFbFXD.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53863"}}, {tmdbId:"113505", properties:{bornIn:"Sydney, New South Wales, Australia", imdbId:"2240346", born:date('1996-06-13'), name:"Kodi Smit-McPhee", bio:"Kodi Smit-McPhee (born 13 June 1996) is an Australian actor.  He is best known for his roles as The Boy in The Road, Owen in Let Me In, Norman Babcock in ParaNorman, Alexander in Dawn of the Planet of the Apes, and Nightcrawler in the 2016 film X-Men: Apocalypse...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/69ggDmbcUWHuRXeg3LAgjroOPD3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/113505"}}] AS row
