url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/527097"}}, {tmdbId:"32907", properties:{bornIn:"Minneapolis, Minnesota, USA", imdbId:"0841910", born:date('1976-10-09'), name:"Nick Swardson", bio:"Nicholas \"Nick\" Swardson (born October 9, 1976) is an American actor, stand-up comedian, and writer.  He is best known for his recurring role as Terry Bernardino in the Comedy Central series Reno 911!, for his work in Happy Madison movies, and for his new Comedy Central television series Nick Swardson's Pretend Time. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Nick Swardson, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kA6ASJ9kK8mz1ejIXY8h5XgBwgc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/32907"}}, {tmdbId:"76428", properties:{bornIn:"Tunkhannock, Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"1654844", born:date('1981-06-09'), name:"Brent Gorski", bio:"Brent Robert Gorski is an American actor and screenwriter. \n\nHe studied Print Journalism at the University of Southern California and also studied at the University of Cincinnati...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wqckdGNNHTNsM4Tu11ydvDGDJw9.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76428"}}, {tmdbId:"76438", properties:{imdbId:"2575997", name:"Christopher Wyllie", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76438"}}, {tmdbId:"76429", properties:{imdbId:"2127638", name:"Melissa Searing", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76429"}}, {tmdbId:"19760", properties:{bornIn:"Texas, USA", imdbId:"2080761", born:date('1982-03-29'), name:"Jay Brannan", bio:"Jay Brannan is a US actor, singer and songwriter.  A Texas native turned New Yorker, Jay Brannan has been writing and performing his own sweet and sad folk songs, tempered with a healthy dose of humour, around the globe since 2006. \n\nHe appeared as an actor in John Cameron Mitchell’s indie film sensation \"Shortbus\", in which his song “Soda Shop” was the highest selling song on the film’s soundtrack album (released by Bright Eyes’ Team Love Records)...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19760"}}, {tmdbId:"73355", properties:{bornIn:"Nottingham, England, UK", imdbId:"2102872", born:date('1992-02-11'), name:"Georgia Groome", bio:"Georgia Isobel Groome (born 11 February 1992, Nottingham) is a British actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xYc484y7vjXfMbd2dkC4s53Txz4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/73355"}}, {tmdbId:"73359", properties:{bornIn:"Barrow-in-Furness, Cumbria, England, UK", imdbId:"1131627", born:date('1976-06-29'), name:"Karen Taylor", bio:"Karen Taylor is a British film and television actress, comedienne and writer, most famous for her own BBC3 sketch series \"Touch Me, I'm Karen Taylor\", and for the film \"Angus, Thongs and Perfect Snogging\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cm1hXlZTDOtRBC0scUEzSemObHd.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/73359"}}, {tmdbId:"47737", properties:{imdbId:"0203563", born:date('1966-03-06'), name:"Alan Davies", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5eiXSaR1vW6mDYSr2Jcyf5h1xvg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/47737"}}, {tmdbId:"11023", properties:{bornIn:"Richmond, British Columbia, Canada", imdbId:"0039162", born:date('1979-10-07'), name:"Shawn Ashmore", bio:"Shawn Ashmore (born October 7, 1979) is a Canadian film and television actor, most famously known for his role in the X-Men films...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7oAgn6E58WtaIeE8zbHiTsiQLG2.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/11023"}}, {tmdbId:"6832", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"0502425", born:date('1960-09-14'), name:"Melissa Leo", bio:"American actress Melissa Chessington Leo made her acting debut in 1985, for which she was nominated for a Daytime Emmy Award for Outstanding Ingenue/Woman in the Drama Series “All My Children”.  Her most notable role as was as Det.  Sgt.  Kay Howard on “Homicide: Life on the Street” for the show's first five seasons from 1993–1997. \n\nFollowing several films, Leo received critical acclaim and national attention in earning several nominations and awards, including an Oscar nomination for Best Actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tKNTvhmuO7FZMYYgRrZB6k8FT5K.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6832"}}, {tmdbId:"16501", properties:{bornIn:"Anaheim, California, USA", imdbId:"0893257", born:date('1977-07-08'), name:"Milo Ventimiglia", bio:"Milo Anthony Ventimiglia (born July 8, 1977) is an American television actor best known for his role of Peter Petrelli on the TV series Heroes.  Ventimiglia was first noticed by fans during his three year stint on the WB series Gilmore Girls, playing Rory Gilmore's boyfriend Jess Mariano from 2001 until his final guest appearance in 2006...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9yFPsQCYi9sbPQ0xJGtoAF4Ar6v.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/16501"}}, {tmdbId:"51381", properties:{bornIn:"New York, New York, USA", imdbId:"0922995", born:date('1973-10-25'), name:"Michael Weston", bio:"Michael Weston is an American television and film actor.  He is known for his role as Jake in the critically acclaimed HBO drama Six Feet Under and as the private detective Lucas Douglas on House...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/asS6TYplpuAdpuB0Evj65M42bWZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/51381"}}, {tmdbId:"52394", properties:{bornIn:"Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada", imdbId:"0809049", born:date('1980-06-19'), name:"Lauren Lee Smith", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nLauren Lee Smith (born June 19, 1980) is a Canadian actress and producer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9rpryFGqrUUafGRMhnd6fQAlzHc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52394"}}, {tmdbId:"27822", properties:{bornIn:"Shoreham-by-Sea, West Sussex, England, UK", imdbId:"0752379", born:date('1935-01-05'), name:"David Ryall", died:date('2014-12-25'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fOvqAAgVAc1QG1qxg3m8yypkZOJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/27822"}}] AS row
