, name:"Jacki Weaver", bio:"Jacki Weaver  (born May 25, 1947) is an Australian theatre, film and television actress.  She is best known for Animal Kingdom, for which she was nominated for the 2011 Academy Award for Best Supporting Actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qs92PYM6Xnge5JHUrIxdvx1MTPQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/67837"}}, {tmdbId:"65444", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"2686747", name:"Alexis Zegerman", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nAlexis Zegerman is a British actress and writer. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Alexis Zegerman, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65444"}}, {tmdbId:"127558", properties:{bornIn:"Whitley Bay, Northumberland, United Kingdom", imdbId:"2057859", born:date('1981-11-20'), name:"Andrea Riseborough", bio:"Andrea Louise Riseborough (born 20 November 1981) is an English stage and film actress.  Her film appearance include Birdman, Oblivion, Welcome to the Punch, Disconnect, Shadow Dancer, W. E. , Brighton Rock, Made in Dagenham, Never Let Me Go, Happy-Go-Lucky, and Venus...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9f975GWIWksWQrSgKaaBQlxBKoh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/127558"}}, {tmdbId:"1040850", properties:{bornIn:"Paris,France", imdbId:"0280081", born:date('1976-08-13'), name:"Grégory Fitoussi", bio:"Grégory Fitoussi (born 13 August 1976) is a French actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1emo8If8nRcRn6hVIMjXs1RVNXf.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1040850"}}, {tmdbId:"1042106", properties:{imdbId:"2973632", name:"Joe Benoit", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1042106"}}, {tmdbId:"1042107", properties:{imdbId:"2973596", name:"Helen Boston", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1042107"}}, {tmdbId:"1042108", properties:{imdbId:"2973590", name:"Louise Canady", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1042108"}}, {tmdbId:"1551282", properties:{imdbId:"2973594", name:"Elaine Fligman", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1551282"}}, {tmdbId:"143428", properties:{imdbId:"0745403", name:"Todd Rotondi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/143428"}}, {tmdbId:"143427", properties:{bornIn:"Mountain View, California, USA", imdbId:"2062720", born:date('1981-08-10'), name:"Jon Prescott", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rvv9gDT5MymrdHP7gNkDd4J6ewE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/143427"}}, {tmdbId:"143425", properties:{bornIn:"Middletown, New York, USA", imdbId:"3117836", born:date('1983-10-21'), name:"Aaron Tveit", bio:"Aaron Tveit is an American singer and actor for stage and screen...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jLr1piUdkrjForF5QHW8D4wAae0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/143425"}}, {tmdbId:"80676", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"2973712", born:date('2000-02-05'), name:"Jordan Nagai", bio:"Jordan Nagai (born February 5, 2000) is an American former child voice actor best known for his role as Russell in the 2009 Pixar movie Up.  He also voiced a character an episode of The Simpsons titled \"O Brother, Where Bart Thou?\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8UjtI2fYUTXFzqEGc7rDAgFiAm7.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/80676"}}] AS row
