267", properties:{imdbId:"2025993", name:"Christopher Soren Kelly", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nosNARTf1EF5yv8p7arLpfaELyk.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1350267"}}, {tmdbId:"92745", properties:{imdbId:"2727304", name:"Quinn Hunchar", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/92745"}}, {tmdbId:"92744", properties:{bornIn:"Denver, Colorado, USA", imdbId:"1871320", born:date('1976-09-08'), name:"Jessica Duffy", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/92744"}}, {tmdbId:"92747", properties:{imdbId:"2320334", name:"Jennifer Batter", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/92747"}}, {tmdbId:"44649", properties:{bornIn:"Roma, Italy", imdbId:"0686376", born:date('1976-05-01'), name:"Violante Placido", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nViolante Placido (born 1 May 1976) is an Italian actress and singer.  She is the daughter of actor-director Michele Placido and actress Simonetta Stefanelli...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qVs8LdHIU2E5RlSuSr4MK0zyf7B.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/44649"}}, {tmdbId:"52262", properties:{bornIn:"Ilford, Essex, England, UK", imdbId:"0536630", born:date('1976-04-18'), name:"Sean Maguire", bio:"Sean Maguire (born Sean Martin Michael Maguire, 18 April 1976, Ilford, Essex) is an English actor and singer, who rose to fame in 1988 when at the age of eleven he took on the role of \"Tegs\" Ratcliffe on the BBC children's drama Grange Hill, in which he remained until 1992.  For a short time after leaving Grange Hill, he played Aidan Brosnan in EastEnders. \n\nHe has appeared in several feature films and also had moderate success as a singer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hRBR1KN5K9TIzX579mWt7MhvjPx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52262"}}, {tmdbId:"82711", properties:{bornIn:"Oldham, Lancashire, England, UK", imdbId:"0278239", born:date('1966-04-27'), name:"Siobhan Finneran", bio:"Siobhan Margaret Finneran is an English television and film actress.  She is known for her regular roles in the BBC drama Clocking Off, ITV comedy Benidorm, ITV drama Downton Abbey and BBC drama Happy Valley.  Siobhan married actor Mark Jordon in 1997 and they have two children,Joseph and Poppy.  The couple divorced in 2014...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gS00sFRgPGGFetlRAVsmc665Cbm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/82711"}}, {tmdbId:"107128", properties:{imdbId:"2093866", name:"Alfie Owen", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/107128"}}, {tmdbId:"95039", properties:{bornIn:"Minneapolis, Minnesota, USA", imdbId:"1100839", born:date('1992-10-22'), name:"Sofia Vassilieva", bio:"Sofia Vassilieva (born October 22, 1992) is an American actress. \n\nShe is best known for playing Eloise in two TV movies, Ariel Dubois on Medium, and Kate Fitzgerald in My Sister's Keeper...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4ikgIeFKiMfYdtUrnGp7T1a8oUF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/95039"}}, {tmdbId:"62066", properties:{bornIn:"Santiago de Cuba, Cuba", imdbId:"0522324", born:date('1968-06-14'), name:"Faizon Love", bio:"Faizon Andre Love was born June 14, 1968.  An actor and comedian, he is best known for roles in the films Friday, Elf, and Couples Retreat.  Love got his start as a stand-up comedian and made his acting debut Off-Broadway at the age of nineteen.  His motion picture debut, Bebe's Kids had him providing the voice of late comedian Robin Harris.  He then had a role in The Meteor Man starring Robert Townsend.  Townsend then cast Love in a co-starring role on his sitcom The Parent 'Hood...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jsJZKirOMwv45ohX0dFDad7yRgq.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/62066"}}, {tmdbId:"1239793", properties:{imdbId:"1148186", name:"Eunice Cho", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1239793"}}, {tmdbId:"60734", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"1616586", born:date('1999-05-19'), name:"Harrison Fahn", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5RupZ2yUgLk9upiqaHmXJkt94ms.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/60734"}}, {tmdbId:"23211", properties:{bornIn:"Honolulu, Hawaii, USA", imdbId:"0281068", born:date('1965-05-19'), name:"Maile Flanagan", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4Zygi5elSWw1MhZxoBJa7s1AIEB.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23211"}}, {tmdbId:"15760", properties:{bornIn:"Hell's Kitchen, Manhattan, New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"0669681", born:date('1986-11-10'), name:"Josh Peck", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nJoshua Michael \"Josh\" Peck (born November 10, 1986) is an American actor, comedian, director, and voice actor best known for playing Josh Nichols in the Nickelodeon live-action sitcom Drake & Josh.  He began his career as a child actor in the late 1990s and early 2000s, and became known to young audiences after his role on The Amanda Show.  He has since acted in films such as Mean Creek, Drillbit Taylor, The Wackness, and Red Dawn...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/j2rQcmcpnSZzjluYer2dDZWpLUL.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/15760"}}] AS row
