UNWIND [{tmdbId:"52442", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, U.S.", imdbId:"1880888", born:date('1986-10-06'), name:"Olivia Thirlby", bio:"Olivia Thirlby is an American actress best known for her role as Leah, the best friend of Ellen Page's character in the 2007 film Juno. \n\nIn June 2008, Thirlby was described by Vanity Fair magazine as a member of \"Hollywood's New Wave\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/f6j1Y3C4Td3bmo8xQRGxC7zKgu0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52442"}}, {tmdbId:"60952", properties:{bornIn:"Murray, Kentucky, US", imdbId:"0801356", born:date('1973-05-25'), name:"Molly Sims", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nMolly Sims (born May 25, 1973) is an American model and actress.  Sims is best known for her appearances in the Sports Illustrated Swimsuit Issues and her role as Delinda Deline in the NBC drama Las Vegas.  She is also an ambassador for Operation Smile. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Molly Sims, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kZn5uyziBvYO0j8xaIsLEoaTwiw.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/60952"}}, {tmdbId:"946221", properties:{imdbId:"1603998", name:"Roslyn Ruff", bio:"Roslyn Ruff is an actress, known for Rachel Getting Married (2008), Salt (2010) and Marriage Story (2019)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9F4MD6VCvYhVBApVFATV3n3oOIf.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/946221"}}, {tmdbId:"58549", properties:{bornIn:"Santa Monica - California - USA", imdbId:"0410347", born:date('1950-04-11'), name:"Bill Irwin", bio:"William Mills Irwin (born April 11, 1950) is an American actor, clown, and comedian.  He began as a vaudeville-style stage performer and has been noted for his contribution to the renaissance of American circus during the 1970s.  He has also made a number of appearances on film and television, and he won a Tony Award for his role in Who's Afraid of Virginia Woolf on Broadway.  He is also known as Mr...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7FBGPliqZwpTrnjwA5wJiXXaUpu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58549"}}, {tmdbId:"42802", properties:{bornIn:"Indore, Madhya Pradesh, India", imdbId:"0006795", born:date('1965-12-27'), name:"Salman Khan", bio:"Salman Khan ( born Abdul Rashid Salim Salman Khan on 27 December 1965)  is an Indian film actor.  He has starred in more than eighty Hindi films. \n\nKhan, who made his acting debut with a minor role in the drama Biwi Ho To Aisi (1988), had his first commercial success with the blockbuster Maine Pyar Kiya (1989), for which he won a Filmfare Award for Best Male Debut...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sWmGnYPMMKK2xYfU6gpp13aajLY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/42802"}}, {tmdbId:"83591", properties:{bornIn:"Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", imdbId:"1779702", born:date('1986-04-10'), name:"Ayesha Takia", bio:"Ayesha Takia Azmi (born Ayesha Takia on 10 April 1986) is an Indian actress who mainly appears in Bollywood films. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Ayesha Takia Azmi, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nMwZp4tfg6W4BkkWpaXesUMUAxR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83591"}}, {tmdbId:"85458", properties:{bornIn:"Peshawar", imdbId:"0451396", born:date('1946-10-06'), name:"Vinod Khanna", bio:"Vinod Khanna (6 October 1946 – 27 April 2017) was an Indian actor and producer of Bollywood films.  He was the recipient of 2 Filmfare awards.  He was also an active politician.  He was the sitting MP from Gurdaspur (between 1998-2009 and 2014-2017).  He had advanced cancer of the bladder...", died:date('2017-04-27'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fjzs77tyOKtkTl8Vjrcn8XGzq4G.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85458"}}, {tmdbId:"85456", properties:{bornIn:"Mumbai, India", imdbId:"0542498", born:date('1953-05-13'), name:"Mahesh Manjrekar", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nMahesh Manjrekar (born 15 August, 1958 in Mumbai) is an Indian director, actor, writer and producer.  He is credited with directing the critically acclaimed films Vaastav: The Reality (1999), Astitva (2000) and Viruddh. . .  Family Comes First (2005).  He has won a National Film Award and two Star Screen Awards.  Besides direction, he has acted in several films including some of his own productions...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fmln2WimqzC6vLRF8jgmtFnHoPN.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85456"}}, {tmdbId:"132471", properties:{imdbId:"2413641", name:"Dustin Belt", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/132471"}}, {tmdbId:"1208677", properties:{imdbId:"0913004", name:"Richard Lewis Warren", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1208677"}}, {tmdbId:"52503", properties:{imdbId:"1616603", name:"Hank Fields", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/52503"}}, {tmdbId:"13280", properties:{bornIn:"Kumamoto, Japan", imdbId:"0622407", born:date('1968-06-01'), name:"Yui Natsukawa", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nYui Natsukawa is a Japanese entertainer.  She was born on June 1, 1968 in Yatsushiro, Kumamoto, Japan.  She is a left-hander (but she writes with her right hand).  She was given a Best New Talent award at the 1995 Yokohama Film Festival for her role in Yoru ga mata kuru. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Yui Natsukawa, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jAMhEDBBIqViuyxvts00ozRsjLY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/13280"}}, {tmdbId:"25653", properties:{bornIn:"Tokyo, Japan", imdbId:"1645591", born:date('1964-08-29'), name:"You", bio:"Yukiko Ehara (Japanese: 江原由希子 Hepburn: Ehara Yukiko, born August 29, 1964), known as You (ゆう Yū), is a Japanese television personality and actress, and former singer and model...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dTlCW7FOwVF1kbV1c7OLWXosL0Y.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25653"}}, {tmdbId:"129022", properties:{imdbId:"2838727", name:"Kelsey Ford", bio:"Actress / Talent...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ez94cd3CtoJzGLORnCJQ30q0tlD.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/129022"}}, {tmdbId:"80661", properties:{bornIn:"Ridgewood, New Jersey, Stati Uniti", imdbId:"1652433", born:date('1979-02-20'), name:"Michael Zegen", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8fq9xIPOyYgIY7Y5Pgk4RyC0L8l.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/80661"}}, {tmdbId:"136030", properties:{imdbId:"1586142", name:"Ryan McFarland", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/136030"}}, {tmdbId:"129713", properties:{bornIn:"Taos, New Mexico, USA", imdbId:"1904886", born:date('1996-04-18'), name:"Mia Stallard", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hIr18OOcnpFfaHX3Nccs1k2yMsP.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/129713"}}, {tmdbId:"19538", properties:{bornIn:"Launceston, Tasmania, Australia", imdbId:"1592225", born:date('1984-07-11'), name:"Rachael Taylor", bio:"Rachael May Taylor is an Australian actress and model.  Her first leading role was in the Australian series headLand.  She then made the transition to Hollywood, appearing in films including Man-Thing, See No Evil, Transformers, Bottle Shock, Cedar Boys, Splinterheads, Shutter, Red Dog and Any Questions for Ben?...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wpnZClDzLWOQKUUlTAylTQKIaK3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19538"}}, {tmdbId:"145601", properties:{imdbId:"0624369", name:"Louis Negin", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/145601"}}, {tmdbId:"117051", properties:{bornIn:"Winnipeg, Manitoba, Canada", imdbId:"0991671", born:date('1974-12-26'), name:"Darcy Fehr", bio:"Darcy Fehr has been acting professionally since 1997.  He's studied at both the University of Manitoba and Ryerson University in Toronto.  Among his most notable roles is the lead in Guy Maddin's, \"My Winnipeg\".  Darcy now shares his unique acting experiences in The Acting Studio Winnipeg...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pNFSuPYFL74PsBMzzVE1A3IHEx6.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/117051"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"78080", properties:{bornIn:"Bloomsburg, Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"1269983", born:date('1981-12-16'), name:"Krysten Ritter", bio:"Krysten Ritter is an American film and television actress, producer, writer, musician, and former model, best known for playing the title character in \"Marvel's Jessica Jones\" and other related shows in the Marvel Cinematic Universe.  Next to many roles in feature films, many of them indie movies, she also portrayed Jane Margolis, the junkie girlfriend of Aaron Paul's Jesse Pinkman, in AMC's \"Breaking Bad\", and starred as main character Chloe in the series \"Don't Trust the B---- in Apartment 23\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bII7CIrRAc7JdDSfG8oDIbRPQCx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/78080"}}, {tmdbId:"5301", properties:{bornIn:"Amritsar, India", imdbId:"1753302", born:date('1974-01-01'), name:"Waris Ahluwalia", bio:"Waris Ahluwalia is an Indian American designer and actor based in New York City.  His company, House of Waris, has collaborated with a number of other designers and artists throughout the years.  House of Waris came into being after the owners of Maxfield's in Los Angeles noticed Ahluwalia's elaborate diamond rings and placed an order, which sold out...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3vZYvthY4xqkr5MroOmZn0YwIdA.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/5301"}}, {tmdbId:"130324", properties:{imdbId:"3875873", name:"Michel Castejon", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/130324"}}, {tmdbId:"123296", properties:{imdbId:"2622060", name:"Hildur Arsaelsdottir", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/123296"}}, {tmdbId:"123286", properties:{bornIn:"Iceland", imdbId:"1743706", born:date('1975-04-23'), name:"Jon Thor Birgisson", bio:"Jón “Jónsi” Þór Birgisson is the guitarist and vocalist for the Icelandic post-rock band Sigur Rós.  He is known for his use of a cello bow on guitar and his falsetto voice.  Jónsi is blind in his right eye.  He is openly gay, and his boyfriend Alex Somers has done much of the graphic design for Sigur Rós.  They also perform together as an art collaboration called Jónsi &amp; Alex...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/123286"}}, {tmdbId:"123295", properties:{bornIn:"Iceland", imdbId:"1743714", born:date('1977-07-04'), name:"Orri P. Dyrason", bio:"Orri Páll Dýrason is the drummer for Sigur Rós.  He joined the band in 1999, shortly after the recording of the studio album Ágætis byrjun, when the previous drummer, Ágúst Ævar Gunnarsson, left the band...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/123295"}}, {tmdbId:"6751", properties:{bornIn:"Syracuse, New York, USA", imdbId:"0266441", born:date('1961-05-13'), name:"Siobhan Fallon Hogan", bio:"Siobhan Fallon Hogan (born May 13, 1961) is an American actress and comedian from Syracuse, New York.  She began her career in television roles from the early 1980s to 1990s, including roles on Saturday Night Live and Seinfeld.  In 1994, Fallon made her film debut in 'Only You'...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5OExagnRsUcOYLMPTSrv4x2G95R.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6751"}}, {tmdbId:"336", properties:{bornIn:"Detroit, Michigan, U.S.", imdbId:"0944702", born:date('1974-09-18'), name:"Xzibit", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nAlvin Nathaniel Joiner IV (born September 18, 1974), better known by his stage name Xzibit (pronounced as \"exhibit\"), is an American rapper, actor, and television host.  He is known as the host of the MTV show Pimp my Ride, which brought him mainstream success...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5WwvxSAU4qpusAGOGgB92of5y9O.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/336"}}, {tmdbId:"49002", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"0265668", born:date('1974-06-22'), name:"Donald Faison", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nDonald Adeosun Faison ( born June 22, 1974) is an American actor and voice actor best known for his role as Dr.  Chris Turk in the ABC (formerly NBC) comedy-drama Scrubs (2001–2010). \n\nFaison first emerged on the scene with parts in films such as Clueless (1995) and Remember the Titans (2000).  He has continued his career with the films Next Day Air and Skyline...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sM9DG77jUjmIsW09li5qGX80Pc2.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/49002"}}, {tmdbId:"41556", properties:{bornIn:"Atlanta, Georgia", imdbId:"1165044", born:date('1974-01-09'), name:"Omari Hardwick", bio:"Omari Hardwick (born January 9, 1974) is an American actor, known for his roles in the TV series Saved and Dark Blue as well in the movies Spike Lee's Miracle at St.  Anna, The A-Team, Kick-Ass, and Tyler Perry's For Colored Girls...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2kROckfySgXMBa2nsCIDoR9R6gg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/41556"}}, {tmdbId:"78324", properties:{bornIn:"San Francisco, California, USA", imdbId:"1512166", born:date('1983-04-10'), name:"Jamie Chung", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nJamie Jilynn Chung (born April 10, 1983) is an American actress known to reality television audiences as a cast member on the MTV reality television series, The Real World: San Diego and its spin-off show, Real World/Road Rules Challenge: The Inferno II, and for her appearances in TV and films, such as I Now Pronounce You Chuck and Larry, Sorority Row, and Sucker Punch...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bnZdPNCY1IErVoyjxLk33Nnje64.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/78324"}}, {tmdbId:"25836", properties:{bornIn:"St. Louis, Missouri, USA", imdbId:"1020124", born:date('1972-02-16'), name:"Sarah Clarke", bio:"Sarah Clarke (born February 16, 1972) is an American actress, best known for her role as Nina Myers on 24, and also for her roles as Renée Dwyer, Bella Swan's mother, in the 2008 film Twilight as well as Erin McGuire on the short-lived TV show, Trust Me. \n\nDescription above from the Wik