Tommy Dawkins on Big Wolf on Campus and recurring as Gabe Duncroft on Freeform's family drama series The Fosters...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/j3mvjDLe7Hvg3hBkEfpsLB0XBeE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/123148"}}, {tmdbId:"1758879", properties:{name:"Anne Joyce", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1758879"}}, {tmdbId:"83726", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"2126265", born:date('1980-06-06'), name:"Elliot Villar", bio:"Elliot Villar is an American theater, television and film actor born and raised in the Bronx.  He holds a BA in Drama from Vassar College, and an MFA in Acting from the Yale School of Drama.  He was a member of the original Broadway cast of War Horse...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xaTwPFT3qubECzxhltxfAPXLz2n.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83726"}}, {tmdbId:"163794", properties:{bornIn:"Hamden, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"0907648", born:date('1968-02-04'), name:"Craig Walker", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xLxKbfHbJwESM8yRMmpVBdr5WWt.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/163794"}}, {tmdbId:"74251", properties:{bornIn:"Sacramento, California, USA", imdbId:"2340248", born:date('1988-03-14'), name:"Sasha Grey", bio:"Sasha Grey (born March 14, 1988) is a former American pornographic actress who has since become a mainstream actress, model, author and musician.  After her feature film debut as the lead in Steven Soderbergh's \"The Girlfriend Experience\", she shifted her focus to mainstream acting.  She starred in the black comedy/horror film \"Smash Cut\", and played a semi-fictionalized version of herself in the seventh season of the HBO television series \"Entourage\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1RPD87SCf6x1VF6mPGUo6ammuD.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74251"}}] AS row
