UNWIND [{tmdbId:"83661", properties:{bornIn:"Shizuoka, Japan", imdbId:"1867502", born:date('1993-11-30'), name:"Yuri Chinen", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oamOB16zcCfAOkw7hz3QH2xtHpR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83661"}}, {tmdbId:"53397", properties:{bornIn:"Staten Island, New York, U.S.", imdbId:"0004694", born:date('1980-12-18'), name:"Christina Aguilera", bio:"Christina María Aguilera, born on 18th December 1980, is an American pop singer and songwriter.  Aguilera first appeared on national television in 1990 as a contestant on the Star Search program, and went on to star in Disney Channel's television series The Mickey Mouse Club from 1993–1994.  Aguilera signed to RCA Records after recording \"Reflection\" for the film Mulan...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hGWUtdEbSiSITYYStMgJc7Vfc93.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53397"}}, {tmdbId:"111945", properties:{bornIn:"Boston, Massachusetts, USA", imdbId:"0063800", born:date('1978-08-20'), name:"Noah Bean", bio:"Noah Bean (born 1978) is an American actor best known for his role as David Connor on the FX legal drama Damages and as Ryan Fletcher on the 2010 The CW series Nikita as David Connor on the FX legal drama Damages and his leading performance in the independent film The Pill. \n\nPersonal life\n\nBean was born in Boston, Massachusetts.  As a child, Bean attended Pine Point School and The Williams School in Connecticut...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tp5khe5mm2XddjDbRTSFhTzQMF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/111945"}}, {tmdbId:"1290557", properties:{name:"Jack Davidson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1290557"}}, {tmdbId:"143235", properties:{bornIn:"Miami Beach - Florida - USA", imdbId:"0039665", born:date('1972-09-16'), name:"Vanessa Aspillaga", bio:"Vanessa Aspillaga is an actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dXwuCr1nZPF2S0rrPdPFiZ8pWwc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/143235"}}, {tmdbId:"95696", properties:{bornIn:"Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"0712404", born:date('1943-10-09'), name:"Lorna Raver", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nLorna Raver (born October 9, 1943) is an American actress who has appeared in numerous plays, films, and television series.  She is sometimes credited as Lorna Raver Johnson. \n\nBorn in York County, Pennsylvania, Raver had early experience performing at the Hedgerow Theater in Pennsylvania.  She moved to New York City, appearing off-Broadway in the premieres of Last Days at the Dixie Girl Cafe and Between Daylight and Boonville...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n0AcmPoXR9y1ST9xLtK8wFieKqy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/95696"}}, {tmdbId:"95697", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"2438307", born:date('1973-07-29'), name:"Dileep Rao", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nDileep Rao is an American actor who has appeared in feature films and television series.  He starred in Sam Raimi's horror film Drag Me to Hell (2009), James Cameron's science fiction film Avatar (2009), and Christopher Nolan's thriller Inception (2010). \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Dileep Rao, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/k4OiYIhr886ollgOrvrBs2ZIZbc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/95697"}}, {tmdbId:"1277011", properties:{imdbId:"2588226", name:"Marco Antonio Aguirre", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1277011"}}, {tmdbId:"1311441", properties:{name:"Leonardo Alonso", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1311441"}}, {tmdbId:"19851", properties:{bornIn:"Rochester - New York - USA", imdbId:"0776193", born:date('1959-05-17'), name:"Armand Schultz", bio:"Armand Schultz is an actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jppTkGkLEGGIaLO830zqGiuQG4q.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19851"}}, {tmdbId:"105668", properties:{bornIn:"Smolensk, USSR (Russia)", imdbId:"0466861", born:date('1971-04-13'), name:"Dina Korzun", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nDianna Alexandrovna \"Dina\" Korzun (born 13 April 1971) is a Russian actress. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Dina Korzun, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/105668"}}, {tmdbId:"7030", properties:{bornIn:"Whitechapel, Londra", imdbId:"0329094", born:date('1950-04-23'), name:"Henry Goodman", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5GTCMmzXa68PmitzuEyEpvjUUxO.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/7030"}}, {tmdbId:"84075", properties:{bornIn:"New York, New York, U.S.A.", imdbId:"1336595", born:date('1973-05-25'), name:"Demetri Martin", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dBB3L3EiEKJG2Ww3k0ecsUHgu2T.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84075"}}, {tmdbId:"525139", properties:{imdbId:"2848533", name:"Ken Bevel", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ie9O6VL9DFPrCG2vyemrGzxq9MZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/525139"}}, {tmdbId:"970275", properties:{imdbId:"2848787", name:"Stephen Dervan", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/970275"}}, {tmdbId:"75036", properties:{bornIn:"St. Petersburg, Russia", imdbId:"3130063", born:date('1985-02-14'), name:"Natalya Rudakova", bio:"​She was born in Leningrad, former Soviet Union.  Her parents moved with her from Russia to New York when she was 17 years old, and she continues to reside in New York.  \n\n  While working as a hairdresser at a salon, she was discovered by Luc Besson, the co-writer of Transporter 3, in New York, when she crossed a street.  He gave her acting lessons and cast her as the female lead in Transporter 3...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7439tb7LAfZGRtZq2GyMts8RKDn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/75036"}}, {tmdbId:"1487546", properties:{imdbId:"3488879", name:"Lucas McHugh Carroll", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1487546"}}, {tmdbId:"1898", properties:{imdbId:"0420646", born:date('1963-01-01'), name:"Eddie Jemison", bio:"Actor / Performer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tHj0nZbzewuK0D748luDf1ZI9In.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1898"}}, {tmdbId:"1370854", properties:{imdbId:"0352905", name:"Michael Hadley", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1370854"}}, {tmdbId:"142389", properties:{bornIn:"Islington, London, England", imdbId:"2185462", born:date('1996-04-23'), name:"Charlie Rowe", bio:"Charlie Rowe was born on April 23, 1996 in Islington, London, England as Charlie John Rowe.  He is an actor, known for Rocketman (2019), Vanity Fair (2018) and Red Band Society (2014)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uj6FPTxlcjPGyQlCLEjFogvU8ny.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/142389"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"1231664", properties:{bornIn:"Nettlebed Oxfordshire", imdbId:"0281727", born:date('1947-05-15'), name:"Lucy Fleming", bio:"Lucy Fleming was born on May 15, 1947 in Nettlebed, Oxfordshire, England as Eve Lucinda Fleming.  She is known for her work on Survivors (1975), Pirate Radio (2009) and The Avengers (1961).  She has been married to Simon Williams since April 1986...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lL2ghxnIQjVcn8uqjeHpu3pcjF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1231664"}}, {tmdbId:"3972", properties:{bornIn:"Chipping Norton, Oxfordshire, England, UK", imdbId:"0589505", born:date('1972-06-02'), name:"Wentworth Miller", bio:"Wentworth Earl Miller III (born June 2, 1972) is an English-born American actor, model, and screenwriter who rose to stardom following his role as Michael Scofield in the Fox Network television series Prison Break...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1apvr7onOG9OuGjQqlBytBEEY1n.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/3972"}}, {tmdbId:"87722", properties:{bornIn:"Hudiksvall, Gävleborgs län, Sweden", imdbId:"0636426", born:date('1979-12-28'), name:"Noomi Rapace", bio:"Noomi Rapace is a Swedish actress.  She achieved international fame with her portrayal of Lisbeth Salander in the Swedish film adaptations of the Millennium series: The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo, The Girl Who Played with Fire, and The Girl Who Kicked the Hornets' Nest...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/XNXSChf6c6wuG4G3KcpcVjDaNK.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/87722"}}, {tmdbId:"79196", properties:{bornIn:"Härnösand, Västernorrlands län, Sweden", imdbId:"0256890", born:date('1955-07-08'), name:"Lena Endre", bio:"Lena Endre (born 8 July 1955) is a Swedish actress.  She was born in Lidingö, Stockholm County, and grew up in Härnösand, Ångermanland and Trollbäcken, Tyresö.  She had her breakthrough in the Swedish TV-series Varuhuset and Lorry in the 1980s.  Since then she has acted in a number of TV-series and movies, both in Sweden and Norway...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hWrqTNGRnXNhAIuVkOyxIhyCW1I.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/79196"}}, {tmdbId:"87723", properties:{bornIn:" Stockholm,  Sweden", imdbId:"0851422", born:date('1934-11-24'), name:"Sven-Bertil Taube", bio:"Sven-Bertil G.  E.  Taube (born 24 November 1934) is a Swedish singer and actor.  Born in Stockholm, he is the son of songwriter Evert Taube and sculptor Astri Bergman Taube. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Sven-Bertil G.  E.  Taube , licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lSRHpbj6B1ctuovgrXwnje7gcYm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/87723"}}, {tmdbId:"77013", properties:{imdbId:"0640055", born:date('1951-01-01'), name:"Deirdre O'Connell", bio:"Deirdre O'Connell is an American character actress who has worked extensively on stage, screen, and television.  O'Connell began her career at Stage One, an experimental theatre at the Boston Center for the Arts.  She made herBroadway debut in the 1986 revival of The Front Page, and was nominated for the 1991 Drama Desk Award for Outstanding Featured Actress in a Play for her performance in the off-Broadway production Love and Anger...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3goNJcGr7enhyBalWeWZYy4jJrm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/77013"}}, {tmdbId:"59129", properties:{bornIn:"Esplugues de Llobregat, Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain", imdbId:"1049982", born:date('1975-05-04'), name:"Óscar Jaenada", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aOv6MLlApilNn21kyJhs66Lx3Ac.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/59129"}}, {tmdbId:"56448", properties:{bornIn:"Paterson, New Jersey, USA", imdbId:"0153779", born:date('1968-01-17'), name:"Jeff Chase", bio:"Jeff Chase (born January 17, 1968) is an American film and television actor. \n\nChase was born Jeffrey L.  Sniffen in Paterson, New Jersey.  He married Kimberly Chase on January 5, 1991, and now lives in Clermont, Florida.  Chase has one son, Cory Chase, born in 1998.  Chase, who stands 6 feet, 7 inches and weighs 285 pounds, attended West Virginia University and, as Jeff Sniffen, played offensive tackle on the American football team from 1986 to 1991...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wq2fN9eMTMBfb83kmmCcl0KhRUS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/56448"}}, {tmdbId:"54708", properties:{bornIn:"Brooklyn, New York, USA", imdbId:"0303013", born:date('1975-06-24'), name:"Carla Gallo", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nCarla Gallo (born June 24, 1975, height 5' 4\" (1,63 m)) is an American actress best known for roles in the television series Undeclared, Carnivàle, and Bones, and in the indie film Spanking the Monkey...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fCB2Fn3yECtpxHuvQG4eR5D2pU3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/54708"}}, {tmdbId:"62816", properties:{bornIn:"Stanford, California, USA", imdbId:"0958430", born:date('1985-04-01'), name:"Josh Zuckerman", bio:"Josh Zuckerma is an American actor.  Known for playing Mark Hughgrant in the science fiction TV series Kyle XY, Eddie Orlofsky in Desperate Housewives and Max Miller in 90210...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kb0oEHc1a3lZUoPXaSyccfinFOP.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/62816"}}, {tmdbId:"58370", properties:{bornIn:"Langley, British Columbia, Canada", imdbId:"1468739", born:date('1986-06-05'), name:"Amanda Crew", bio:"Amanda Crew (born June 5, 1986) is a Canadian television and film actress.  She is best known for her work on the television series Silicon Valley, 15/Love and Whistler, and in the feature-length films Final Destination 3, Sex Drive, The Haunting in Connecticut, and Charlie St.  Cloud...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/diGTfFDOAjtfpClK3pJHkQIYhNc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58370"}}, {tmdbId:"54729", properties:{bornIn:"Glenwood, Arkansas, USA", imdbId:"0241173", born:date('1985-05-05'), name:"Clark Duke", bio:"Clark Duke  (born May 5, 1985) is an American actor known for his roles in the films Kick-Ass, Sex Drive and Hot Tub Time Machine, as well as playing Dale Kettlewell in the TV series Greek...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bwCVCNsXCf3V22JEMAppunjGiLn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/54729"}}, {tmdbId:"82191", properties:{bornIn:"Johannesburg, South Africa", imdbId:"1663205", born:date('1973-11-27'), name:"Sharlto Copley", bio:"Sharlto Copley (born November 27th, 1973) is a South African producer, actor, and director who has produced and co-directed short films which have appeared at the Cannes Film Festival, as well as commercials and music videos.  He is perhaps best known for playing the roles of Wikus van der Merwe in the Oscar-nominated science fiction film District 9 and H.  M.  Murdock in the 2010 adaptation of The A-Team...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5yTG0JGHAwcQMMZwD3k5N7nHKrT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/82191"}}, {tmdbId:"82193", properties:{bornIn:"Sud Africa", imdbId:"2271261", name:"Jason Cope", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nJason Cope is a South African actor best known for his work in Neill Blomkamp's District 9. In the film Cope plays a variety of different characters including the alien Christopher Johnson and the character Grey Bradnam, one of the narrators of the film.  Cope also performed the majority of the background voice work in the film; voicing most of the police, pilot and other background voices in addition to the voice of the cameraman Trent...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tyXqSYJbKLWcRh8MlluSk5WMO0U.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/82193"}}, {tmdbId:"97599", properties:{imdbId:"1410076", born:date('1973-07-19'), name:"Nathalie Boltt", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nNathalie Boltt (born 19 July 1973) is a South African actress, known in that country for her role as Joey Ortlepp in the SABC 3 soap opera Isidingo from 2001 to 2004. \n\nInternationally, she has been seen in the film District 9 and the 2005 television remake The Poseidon Adventure.  She also voices the character of DottyWot in the New Zealand children's series The WotWots...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bqWOq4s1XztOGWIxYwFjsIAt06t.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/97599"}}, {tmdbId:"230818", properties:{imdbId:"0834501", name:"Sylvaine Strike", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/A1O7oEwqy3vebOdnXhyRtKCBeg4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/230818"}}, {tmdbId:"84560", properties:{imdbId:"2671387", name:"Chris Carlisle", bio:"Chris Carlisle is known for his work on Unfriended (2014), Eleventh Hour (2008) and Tabloid Vivant (2016)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vpVpiTC3yU40kZKqORUm3aZXwWx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84560"}}, {tmdbId:"84561", properties:{imdbId:"2300533", name:"Joel Harrison", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84561"}}, {tmdbId:"84562", properties:{bornIn:"Gary, Indiana, USA", imdbId:"1699100", born:date('1972-10-27'), name:"Gaetano Jones", bio:"Gaetano Jones was born on October 27, 1972 in Gary, Indiana, USA as Gaetano Rocco Marcus Schiralli.  He is an actor, known for 3-Day Weekend (2008), The Far Flung Star (2013) and Big Gay Love (2013)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dZt9MBbWKtkEgq00sn4JL1EcYEE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84562"}}, {tmdbId:"84563", properties:{imdbId:"2106627", name:"Derek Long", bio:"Derek is a Los Angeles-based actor/instructor/director, who’s accomplishments span stage, film, and voiceover. \n\nGrowing up in farmland Wisconsin, Derek was interested in theatre at an early age, and has explored it’s various forms of expression ever since.  He majored in theatre at UW-Whitewater, a small college, which gave him a chance to play many lead roles in productions on the stage, including CABARET, OEDIPUS, and JESUS CHRIST SUPERSTAR...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/77Aynf9KdIuV4wbn41u3vUrBGBo.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84563"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"19498", properties:{bornIn:"Washington, District of Columbia, USA", imdbId:"1256532", born:date('1977-09-20'), name:"Jon Bernthal", bio:"Jonathan E.  \"Jon\" Bernthal (born September 20, 1976) is an American actor, best known for his role on the AMC television series The Walking Dead.  He has performed in over 30 plays regionally and off-Broadway, including many with his own award-winning theatre company Fovea Floods.  He also appeared in several TV shows such as Law & Order: Criminal Intent in 2002, The Class from 2006 to 2007 and The Pacific in early 2010...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/y3itD3TXiHoDyK2DQ87jyBnkhwX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19498"}}, {tmdbId:"113360", properties:{bornIn:"Shrewsbury, Shropshire, England, UK", imdbId:"0695784", born:date('1938-08-05'), name:"Tim Preece", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/113360"}}, {tmdbId:"74382", properties:{bornIn:"Stockholm, Sweden", imdbId:"2968765", born:date('1995-06-28'), name:"Kåre Hedebrant", bio:"Kåre Hedebrant (born 28 June 1995) is a Swedish actor.  He played the main character in the 2008 Swedish romantic horror film Let the Right One In. \n\nIn 2007, after an open casting involving 4000 kids, Hedebrant was chosen to play the role of Oskar in Let the Right One In.  Oskar, the protagonist of the film, is a 12-year old bullied boy who strikes up a friendship with the mysterious Eli (Lina Leandersson), who later turns out to be a vampire...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/jbxR75d7iKI8c7uFZwPdJYYfKRJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74382"}}, {tmdbId:"74383", properties:{bornIn:"Falun, Sweden", imdbId:"2968351", born:date('1995-09-27'), name:"Lina Leandersson", bio:"Lina Leandersson (born 27 September 1995) is a Swedish child actress.  She played a lead role in the 2008 Swedish romantic vampire film Let the Right One In, based on the novel by the same name.  Born in Falun, Leandersson started performing at an early age.  She acted in local amateur theatre performances, and had a few brief television appearances in 2006...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/w6u6oBqCh37v4MgXHUosZAzuSKB.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74383"}}, {tmdbId:"74384", properties:{bornIn:"Kalmar, Kalmar län, Sweden", imdbId:"0706537", born:date('1941-05-29'), name:"Per Ragnar", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia  Per Ragnar, Per-Erik Ragnar (born 29 May 1941 in Kalmar), is a\n\nSwedish actor, director and author.   Description above from the Wikipedia article Per Ragnar,\n\nlicensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hj9WITIP1S64017rZQtnvWmZ40C.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74384"}}, {tmdbId:"74385", properties:{bornIn:"Stockholm, Sweden", imdbId:"0196928", born:date('1964-11-18'), name:"Henrik Dahl", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   Henrik Dahl is a Swedish born actor.   Dahl is best known for his role as Erik in the 2008 horror film Let the Right One In. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Henrik Dahl, licensed under CC-BY-SA,full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74385"}}, {tmdbId:"70303", properties:{bornIn:"Evanston, Illinois, United States", imdbId:"1472917", born:date('1982-01-14'), name:"Zach Gilford", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nZach Gilford (born January 14, 1982) is an American actor best known for his role as Matt Saracen on the NBC television drama series Friday Night Lights.  Gilford starred alongside Terrell Owens in the 2008 NBA Celebrity All-Star game.  Gilford graduated from Northwestern University and Evanston Township High School.  He serves as a Trip Leader for Adventures Cross-Country...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iyf9zCjvR8m2QklFMVO1UcNxvvZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/70303"}}, {tmdbId:"84206", properties:{bornIn:"Newark, New Jersey, USA ", imdbId:"0700443", born:date('1979-04-09'), name:"Keshia Knight Pulliam", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nKeshia Knight Pulliam (born April 9, 1979) is an American actress.  She is most recognized for her childhood role as Rudy Huxtable on the long-running NBC sitcom The Cosby Show.  Currently, she appears as reformed con artist Miranda Lucas-Payne on the TBS comedy-drama Tyler Perry's House of Payne. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Keshia Knight Pulliam, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9cRrMPr1lQT4OPtl72SHQNA5jCX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84206"}}, {tmdbId:"78739", properties:{bornIn:"Fort Worth, Texas, USA", imdbId:"2052942", born:date('1966-08-07'), name:"David Mann", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/78739"}}, {tmdbId:"74409", properties:{bornIn:"La Mirada - California - USA", imdbId:"0935721", born:date('1976-07-17'), name:"Eric Winter", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nEric Barrett Winter (born July 17, 1976) is an American actor and former fashion model.  He is also ambassador for Operation Smile. \n\nAt a young age, Winter began painting imitations.  After expressing his emotions through the medium of paint, he looked into another output for his talents and began acting.  Before his acting roles, Winter was a male model and had some high-profile campaigns, such as one print campaign for Tommy Hilfiger...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tDQSZv5rHm4s2hwwVWpp5EMQ0w9.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74409"}}, {tmdbId:"94421", properties:{bornIn:"Wheeling, West Virginia, USA", imdbId:"2092545", born:date('1983-03-09'), name:"Bobby Campo", bio:"Robert Joseph Camposecco (born March 9, 1983), better known as Bobby Campo is an American actor.  He was most successful for playing the role of Nick O'Bannon in the 2009 horror film The Final Destination. \n\nCampo was born in Wheeling, West Virginia, and raised in St.  Petersburg, Florida.  His mother, Donna Camposecco, is a make-up artist who has worked for celebrities, and his paternal grandfather, Bob Campo, was a radio personality in Wheeling...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/94421"}}, {tmdbId:"94423", properties:{bornIn:"Luverne, Minnesota, USA", imdbId:"1416900", born:date('1985-07-25'), name:"Shantel VanSanten", bio:"Shantel VanSanten was born on July 25, 1985.  She is an actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yezBUNQjBsBqSFapMiV6gmTruTt.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/94423"}}, {tmdbId:"84076", properties:{bornIn:"Nutley - New Jersey - USA", imdbId:"1214657", born:date('1978-03-08'), name:"Nick Zano", bio:"Nick Zano (born March 8, 1978) is an American actor and producer.  He is best known for playing Vince in The WB's sitcom What I Like About You.  He got his big break on MTV, where he hosted that network's former infotainment program about the film industry, Movie House, and briefly worked as an MTV News correspondent before he began an acting career...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/t47PZJOUehQV4RFOEXoszMiOEjx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84076"}}, {tmdbId:"94424", properties:{bornIn:"Fairfax, Virginia, U.S.", imdbId:"2251716", born:date('1985-11-25'), name:"Haley Webb", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tKMPyfje7LEQDFaNNMW1vQQ0fvE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/94424"}}, {tmdbId:"34408", properties:{bornIn:"Hamilton - Ontario - Canada", imdbId:"1065664", born:date('1978-04-26'), name:"Stana Katic", bio:"Stana Katic (born 26 April 1978) is a Canadian-American actress and producer.  She is best known for her portrayal of Detective Kate Beckett in ABC's Castle. \n\nEarly life\n\nKatic was born in Hamilton, Ontario, Canada, to Serb parents Petar and Rada Katić, who emigrated from Croatia, Yugoslavia.  In describing her ethnicity, she has stated \"My parents are Serbs from Croatia.  I call us Dalmatian. . . \"Her father is from Vrlika, and her mother is from the surrounding area of Sinj...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tqyqLe8EC3ieGPZhYrJqPXOfDMg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/34408"}}, {tmdbId:"77517", properties:{bornIn:"Washington, USA", imdbId:"2265157", born:date('1997-02-25'), name:"Isabelle Fuhrman", bio:"Actress / Performer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7AaZYQzEXRtwEGdZqr5RUKa8pkO.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/77517"}}, {tmdbId:"2415", properties:{bornIn:"Brussels, Belgium", imdbId:"0603446", born:date('1953-02-27'), name:"Yolande Moreau", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nYolande Moreau (born 27 February 1953) is a Belgian comedienne, actress and film director. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Yolande Moreau, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/grcjmPnR9SBkPP4Sh5PE3qjCHpX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2415"}}, {tmdbId:"71374", properties:{bornIn:"Magdeburg, Germany", imdbId:"3041056", born:date('1979-03-09'), name:"Christian Friedel", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xrPcJ3XjNatT07gsP84EsH6IgEM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/71374"}}, {tmdbId:"26498", properties:{bornIn:"Berlin - Germany", imdbId:"0414272", born:date('1933-07-11'), name:"Ernst Jacobi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/26498"}}, {tmdbId:"119065", properties:{bornIn:"Hamburg, Germany", imdbId:"2914059", born:date('1991-04-22'), name:"Leonie Benesch", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/l4fvpY2pFO2qruOtKWseXIhao4q.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/119065"}}] AS row
