rson/80989"}}, {tmdbId:"61363", properties:{bornIn:"Stevenage, Hertfordshire, England, UK", imdbId:"1641117", born:date('1990-04-10'), name:"Alex Pettyfer", bio:"Alexander Richard \"Alex\" Pettyfer (born 10 April 1990) is an English actor and model.  He appeared in school plays and on television before being cast as Alex Rider, the main character in the 2006 film version of Stormbreaker.  Pettyfer was nominated for a Young Artist Award and an Empire Award for his role. He has been seen as a model in several advertising campaigns for Burberry...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/x7YhNkf7mMq2tUGpzhPJuuq4b0i.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/61363"}}, {tmdbId:"112463", properties:{imdbId:"0103299", name:"Justin Bradley", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/112463"}}, {tmdbId:"118545", properties:{bornIn:"Austin, Texas, USA", imdbId:"0424848", born:date('1989-10-04'), name:"Dakota Johnson", bio:"Dakota Mayi Johnson (born October 4, 1989) is an American actress and model.  She is the daughter of actors Melanie Griffith and Don Johnson.  She had her screen debut alongside her mother in the comedy-drama Crazy in Alabama (1999) and was named Miss Golden Globe in 2006.  Following high school graduation, she returned to acting with roles in The Social Network (2010), Beastly (2011), 21 Jump Street (2012), Need for Speed (2014) and the short-lived comedy Ben and Kate (2012–2013)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dKMg1vpCGqIz6QP4ZsK70TdRURR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/118545"}}, {tmdbId:"556504", properties:{imdbId:"2878997", name:"Andrew Bagby", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/556504"}}, {tmdbId:"556505", properties:{imdbId:"2879187", name:"David Bagby", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/556505"}}, {tmdbId:"1051827", properties:{imdbId:"2879706", name:"Kathleen Bagby", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1051827"}}, {tmdbId:"92087", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0088144", born:date('1973-08-01'), name:"Tempestt Bledsoe", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/92087"}}, {tmdbId:"135650", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0887708", born:date('1932-08-21'), name:"Melvin Van Peebles", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nMelvin \"Block\" Van Peebles (born August 21, 1932) is an American actor, director, screenwriter, playwright, novelist and composer. \n\nHe is most famous for creating the acclaimed film, Sweet Sweetback's Baadasssss Song, which heralded a new era of African American focused films.  He is the father of actor and director Mario Van Peebles...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oiOxqF64Ik6u9gWWA8WQrA5cW4I.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/135650"}}, {tmdbId:"36091", properties:{bornIn:"St. Louis - Missouri - USA", imdbId:"0831601", born:date('1962-10-16'), name:"Christian Stolte", bio:"Christian Stolte was born on October 16, 1962.  He is an actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xpjZXfLG5FFVQiiUFtHleLXCmFi.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/36091"}}, {tmdbId:"76512", properties:{bornIn:"Winton, Queensland, Australia", imdbId:"0164809", born:date('1969-07-17'), name:"Jason Clarke", bio:"An Australian film and television actor.  Clarke has appeared in many TV series.  He is best known as a TV actor for his role as Tommy Caffee on the television series Brotherhood.  He has also appeared in many films, often as an antagonist...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/quH4y2dto3UAgZOfaM0QriyRLPN.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76512"}}, {tmdbId:"83220", properties:{bornIn:"Seoul, South Korea", imdbId:"0351710", born:date('1978-06-28'), name:"Ji-won Ha", bio:"Ha Ji-won (하지원), born Jun Hae-lim (전해림), is a South Korean actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rlhGbX6rbjUUnQFsKDZMv3GLb9N.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83220"}}, {tmdbId:"147898", properties:{imdbId:"1000737", born:date('1979-05-26'), name:"Nicole Dionne", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/147898"}}, {tmdbId:"85008", properties:{bornIn:"Seocheon, South Chungcheong, South Korea", imdbId:"0812555", born:date('1968-05-01'), name:"Kyung-gu Sol", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nSol Kyung-gu (born May 1, 1968) is a Grand Bell Award, Golden Space Needle Award, and Bratislava International Film Festival Best Actor winning South Korean actor.  He studied film and theater at Hanyang University and upon graduation took part in mostly theatrical productions.  After transitioning into film, Sol is best known for his roles in the popular Public Enemy and Silmido...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/obwQgYQQRZ9K0l50JdI6HOWdLSj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85008"}}, {tmdbId:"1299351", properties:{bornIn:"Gimhae, North Gyeongsang Province, South Korea", imdbId:"2523105", born:date('1985-01-16'), name:"Min-ki Lee", bio:"Lee Min-ki (이민기) is a South Korean actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ajz6Ps9DyxgrmUmOqxel8q7Lk4P.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1299351"}}] AS row
