0-16'), name:"Kelly Adams", bio:"Kelly Adams (born 16 October 1979 in Lincoln, Lincolnshire) is an English actress. \n\nA pupil of North Kesteven School in North Hykeham, Adams trained at the Mountview Academy of Theatre Arts in Wood Green, London.  Initially playing Tara Palmer-Tomkinson in a docu-soap about Prince William, she later appeared in Doctors before playing Mickie Hendrie in Holby City from 2004 to 2006.  Her ambitious character left for Newcastle Medical school to study to be a doctor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aVRV5X7ybuukICtuixfw1XI4h7O.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/125718"}}, {tmdbId:"1117430", properties:{imdbId:"1568589", name:"Luing Andrews", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cnSjPWy3S5xMq0sRsK4WRGq311M.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1117430"}}, {tmdbId:"1117431", properties:{imdbId:"3032715", name:"Katy Barker", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1117431"}}, {tmdbId:"1237614", properties:{imdbId:"0725648", name:"Suzanne Rico", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/j0p0FkLuN6ZkfnR20a5WHUsf0o2.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1237614"}}, {tmdbId:"78804", properties:{bornIn:"Bristol, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"2439994", born:date('1981-11-08'), name:"Jocelin Donahue", bio:"An American film and television actress and model, best known for her leading role in the feature indie horror movie \"The House of the Devil\".  She holds a degree in Sociology from New York University, USA...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eQXBzPjo9K8MG9TVOoQDNoHEFwv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/78804"}}, {tmdbId:"45400", properties:{bornIn:"Sacramento, California, USA", imdbId:"1950086", born:date('1983-08-04'), name:"Greta Gerwig", bio:"Greta Celeste Gerwig (born August 4, 1983) is an American actress, writer and director.  Gerwig first came to prominence through her association with the mumblecore film movement.  She has collaborated with director Joe Swanberg on several projects, including the film Nights and Weekends, which the two co-wrote, co-directed and in which they co-starred.  Gerwig made her mainstream debut in 2010, co-starring alongside Ben Stiller in Greenberg, directed by Noah Baumbach...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3H0xzU12GTNJyQTpGysEuI9KyiQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/45400"}}, {tmdbId:"558930", properties:{bornIn:"Michigan, USA", imdbId:"3248880", name:"Claire Sloma", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/558930"}}, {tmdbId:"558931", properties:{imdbId:"3237441", name:"Marlon Morton", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/558931"}}, {tmdbId:"558932", properties:{bornIn:"Lansing, Michigan, USA", imdbId:"2982211", born:date('1991-02-14'), name:"Amanda Bauer", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/558932"}}, {tmdbId:"558933", properties:{imdbId:"1090094", name:"Brett Jacobsen", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1BU0nesSGSKzPL8KnjMVXFDXl4W.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/558933"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"2617", properties:{bornIn:"Essex, England, UK", imdbId:"0786806", born:date('1964-01-06'), name:"Cara Seymour", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nCara Seymour is an English actress of stage and screen.  She has appeared in many ensemble casts for acclaimed films such as American Psycho, Adaptation. , Gangs of New York, Hotel Rwanda, and The Savages. \n\nShe appeared on stage in the NYSF production of Caryl Churchill's The Skriker with Jayne Atkinson, Angie Phillips, and Savages co-star Philip Seymour Hoffman...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/z2olJsyh4U6WBJ5kNM1zV4gkrxx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2617"}}, {tmdbId:"13014", properties:{bornIn:"Hammersmith, London, England, UK", imdbId:"0429363", born:date('1966-09-07'), name:"Toby Jones", bio:"Toby Edward H.  Jones  (born 7 September 1966) is an English actor and voice artist...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4XvTIzPlJL4Oi6OvzVimlYwgbXw.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/13014"}}, {tmdbId:"118937", properties:{bornIn:"Newark, New Jersey, USA ", imdbId:"0100381", born:date('1952-12-21'), name:"Dennis Boutsikaris", bio:"Dennis Boutsikaris (born December 21, 1952) is an American actor known for his work on stage and on screen, as well as audiobook narration.  He has had recurring roles in acclaimed television shows such as Shameless and Better Call Saul...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eholEaSnVKzse1l7ph6hDsfTTi7.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/118937"}}, {tmdbId:"4888", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"1143816", born:date('1982-06-29'), name:"Lily Rabe", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nLily Rabe (born June 29, 1982) is an American actress.  She is well known for playing Portia in the Shakespeare in the Park production of William Shakespeare's The Merchant of Venice, for which she received a nomination for the Tony Award for Best Actress in a Play.  Rabe is also known for her multiple roles on the FX anthology series American Horror Story, and her lead role as Claire Bennigan on the ABC science fiction series The Whispers...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kS9ty5yFQi3E2rnglCA5CTL2tV8.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4888"}}, {tmdbId:"1308770", properties:{imdbId:"2671200", name:"Nelson Andreu", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1308770"}}, {tmdbId:"84421", properties:{bornIn:"Fort Worth, Texas, USA", imdbId:"0437852", born:date('1952-07-12'), name:"Lyle Kanouse", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84421"}}, {tmdbId:"1118347", properties:{imdbId:"4996428", name:"Ken Holmes", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aatG62gZw0bgNxxjsJYqyS4zurI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1118347"}}, {tmdbId:"67580", properties:{bornIn:"USA", imdbId:"0198804", born:date('1960-01-01'), name:"Nick Damici", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cyuulFTdzMSegCsJqopVDlfgKtv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/67580"}}, {tmdbId:"120832", properties:{bornIn:"Pila, Wielkopolskie, Poland", imdbId:"0810738", born:date('1979-08-13'), name:"Kasia Smutniak", bio:"Kasia Smutniak (born Katarzyna Anna Smutniak on 13 August 1979) is a Polish born actress.  She starred in the movie From Paris with Love.  She was born in Piła, Wielkopolskie, Poland.  She speaks fluent Polish, Russian, English and Italian. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kasia Smutniak, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yRMDXVkGgMcE6wfpfzyZ1lKKpmy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/120832"}}, {tmdbId:"59219", properties:{bornIn:"West Chester, Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"0973177", born:date('1986-10-22'), name:"Kyle Gallner", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nKyle Gallner (born October 22, 1986) is an American actor.  He is possibly best known for his portrayal of Cassidy \"Beaver\" Casablancas in the Teen neo-noir television series Veronica Mars, and for guest-starring in teen sci-fi drama Smallville as superhero Bart Allen, an adaptation of the character of The Flash and Impulse comic book...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xY40mgzeGCJrV6P5Vlh2TgIOmkR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/59219"}}, {tmdbId:"108916", properties:{bornIn:"Bedford, New York, USA", imdbId:"1913734", born:date('1985-04-17'), name:"Rooney Mara", bio:"Patricia Rooney Mara (born April 17, 1985) is an American film and television actress.  Mara made her acting début in 2005 and has gone on to star in films including A Nightmare on Elm Street, the remake of the 1984 horror film, and The Social Network.  Mara will portray Lisbeth Salander, the title character in The Girl with the Dragon Tattoo, the first of three Sony Pictures films based on Stieg Larsson’s Millennium book series. \n\nMara is also known for her charity work...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/caN5U7RiV92gLw8AxOGQyZyGPLX.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/108916"}}, {tmdbId:"43464", properties:{bornIn:"Baltimore, Maryland, USA", imdbId:"0024511", born:date('1987-04-20'), name:"John Patrick Amedori", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nJohn Patrick Amedori (born April 20, 1987) is an American actor and musician. \n\nHis most notable role has been as the 13 year old Evan Treborn in The Butterfly Effect.  He has also appeared in a number of TV shows, including Law &amp; Order, Nip/Tuck, Joan of Arcadia and Ghost Whisperer.  He also appeared in the movie Stick It...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xRQ07ZPwd2nn3ki6DGiTgJmpVWm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/43464"}}, {tmdbId:"1212239", properties:{imdbId:"0973652", name:"Scott Holroyd", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5jYDUZdyOm5nZeZjGZzReQwguy0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1212239"}}, {tmdbId:"49624", properties:{bornIn:"Dallas, Texas, USA", imdbId:"0010075", born:date('1978-03-01'), name:"Jensen Ackles", bio:"Jensen Ross Ackles (born March 1, 1978) is an American actor.  He is notable for his television roles as Eric Brady in Days of our Lives which earned him several Daytime Emmy Award nominations, as Alec/X5-494 in Dark Angel, and as Jason Teague in Smallville.  Ackles now appears as Dean Winchester on the CW television series Supernatural. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jensen Ackles, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xNnXTeRG3JyoiYQznwPm8Y3pZfl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/49624"}}, {tmdbId:"76886", properties:{bornIn:"USA", imdbId:"2175732", born:date('1979-05-07'), name:"Betsy Rue", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nBetsy Rue is an American actress best known for her roles in My Bloody Valentine 3D and Halloween II.  She has also appeared in many TV series like Unfabulous, How I Met Your Mother, According to Jim, True Blood, Eastwick and iCarly. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Betsy Rue, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wSRDoq5JIsKo4RkYaOwXu2Tla0h.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76886"}}, {tmdbId:"90596", properties:{bornIn:"Texas, USA", imdbId:"2209370", born:date('1982-10-20'), name:"Katie Featherston", bio:"Katie Featherston, a native Texan, was born on October 20, 1982.  She has a younger brother and a younger sister back home along with a family to whom she is very close.  Katie attended Southern Methodist University where she majored in acting.  After graduating with a BFA in 2005, she moved to Los Angeles...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rPnUjG4knXzlLwPiMZDwaPOoUVm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/90596"}}, {tmdbId:"90597", properties:{bornIn:"Westport, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"2913790", born:date('1981-05-08'), name:"Micah Sloat", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia  Micah Sloat ( born May 8, 1981) is an American actor and musician, largely unknown before his leading role as Micah in the 2009 hit horror film, Paranormal Activity.  He appeared in the sequel in 2010, Paranormal Activity 2.   Description above from the Wikipedia article Micah Sloat, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gF7ndGTcfBo7FMCaycY4ZTxAwxJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/90597"}}, {tmdbId:"90598", properties:{imdbId:"2104166", name:"Mark Fredrichs", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dvNrTOC79mPEKY7XkxN8xOOIn3a.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/90598"}}, {tmdbId:"967678", properties:{imdbId:"2910808", name:"Amber Armstrong", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uZKP5k8V4x1omPOWYTReqJyAFOT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/967678"}}, {tmdbId:"17487", properties:{bornIn:"Wilmington, Delaware, USA", imdbId:"0302330", born:date('1984-06-17'), name:"John Gallagher Jr.", bio:"John Gallagher Jr.  (born June 17, 1984) is a Tony award-winning American actor and musician known for originating the role of Moritz Stiefel in Duncan Sheik and Steven Sater's rock musical Spring Awakening.  He also played Johnny aka \"Jesus of Suburbia\" in Green Day's Broadway musical, American Idiot and Lee in the 2011 Broadway production of Jerusalem...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/e4eEg5lH6Yk0OkpieUoUYdzl2Ui.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17487"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"60881", properties:{bornIn:" New Orleans, Louisiana, USA", imdbId:"0341174", born:date('1966-11-17'), name:"Douglas M. Griffin", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nCq4E6erWLPxC5woxQJu46mqyr.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/60881"}}, {tmdbId:"2080972", properties:{name:"Dwight Slade", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2080972"}}, {tmdbId:"106590", properties:{bornIn:"Okinawa, Japan", imdbId:"1374680", born:date('1973-07-04'), name:"Gackt", bio:"Gackt Camui, was born in Okinawa, Japan.  His father was a music teacher, and his mother also a teacher.  He is the second of three children, with an older sister and younger brother. \n\nHis musical education began early, and he started learning classical music theory and piano from the age of three.  After exposure to rock music during his teenage years he practiced electric guitar and drums intensely...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/106590"}}, {tmdbId:"115146", properties:{bornIn:"Dublin - Ireland", imdbId:"1069800", born:date('1986-03-05'), name:"Dominique McElligott", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nDominique McElligott (born 5 March 1986, height 5' 8\" (1,73 m)) is an Irish television and film actress, appearing primarily in independent films.  She starred in Moon alongside Sam Rockwell as well as the RTÉ series Raw before leaving to film Leap Year.  She also played the female lead role in the AMC Western series Hell on Wheels...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/67WjmwIlPkt6Q6DANkMN1HjWha5.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/115146"}}, {tmdbId:"115147", properties:{imdbId:"3675884", name:"Rosie Shaw", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hINlMbbDstQcqglO1tckl95f8M3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/115147"}}, {tmdbId:"62231", properties:{imdbId:"0292538", born:date('1947-03-12'), name:"Rupert Frazer", bio:"Rupert Peter Frazer is a British actor, known for Empire of the Sun (1987), The Bank Job (2008) and John Carter (2012)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/u5Gns0q6jv2Jv9z1VWUG3A91Dze.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/62231"}}, {tmdbId:"78110", properties:{bornIn:"Sutton Coldfield, West Midlands, England, UK", imdbId:"0012078", born:date('1976-06-17'), name:"Scott Adkins", bio:"An English actor and martial artist who is perhaps best known for playing Boyka in Undisputed II: Last Man Standing and Undisputed III: Redemption and Bradley Hume in Holby City and Ed Russell in Mile High.  Adkins has also appeared in Dangerfield, Hollyoaks, The Tournament and many other TV series as well as many films...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n1L8652hJAKi5l2sdrZ07oZJmos.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/78110"}}, {tmdbId:"227615", properties:{bornIn:"Tokyo, Japan", imdbId:"1856057", born:date('1982-10-13'), name:"Mika Hijii", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/m0Rq3NGbsjJwId36r7SMxeNA1YY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/227615"}}, {tmdbId:"58794", properties:{bornIn:"USA", imdbId:"0421709", name:"Todd Jensen", bio:"Todd Jensen has enjoyed a 30+ year acting career.  Todd began his acting studies at prestigious acting institutes located on both east and west coasts of the United States, including the William Esper Studio in New York, the Joanne Baron Studio in Los Angeles, before studying improvisation at The Groundlings.  Todd Jensen began his screen career in 1988...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5XBi7E42xq9aXelqpMpmnCpDehW.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/58794"}}, {tmdbId:"135347", properties:{bornIn:"Bangkok, Thailand", imdbId:"2925876", born:date('1984-03-31'), name:"JeeJa Yanin", bio:"Yanin \"Jeeja\" Vismitananda  (born March 31, 1984), is a Thai actress and martial artist.  She specialises in Muay Thai.  She is credited as Yanin Mitananda in Chocolate. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article  JeeJa Yanin, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/73xhAKFbeNSlJTwUCsQCAtryLYS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/135347"}}, {tmdbId:"127841", properties:{imdbId:"1033529", born:date('1961-09-02'), name:"Pongpat Wachirabunjong", bio:"Pongpat Wachirabunjong is a Thai singer, actor and film director. \n\nHe is well known in Thailand for his role in the action films Heaven's  Seven and Seven Street Fighters, as the red-shorts-clad Sergeant Dab  Jampoh...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/127841"}}, {tmdbId:"1044537", properties:{imdbId:"3063920", name:"Taphon Phopwandee", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1044537"}}, {tmdbId:"123073", properties:{bornIn:"Nine Miles, St. Ann, Jamaica", born:date('1945-02-06'), name:"Bob Marley", bio:"Bob Marley was born Robert Nesta Marley on February 6, 1945.  Bob was born to Cedella Marley when she was 18.  Bob's early life was spent in rural community of Nine Miles, nestled in the mountainous terrain of the parish of St.  Ann...", died:date('1981-05-11'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/v2GrUpvYAuRqf0Mxm8W91WqDH1Y.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/123073"}}, {tmdbId:"154857", properties:{bornIn:"Kingston, Jamaica", imdbId:"0005187", born:date('1968-10-17'), name:"Ziggy Marley", bio:"David Nesta \"Ziggy\" Marley is a Jamaican musician and leader of the band Ziggy Marley and the Melody Makers, and the son of reggae icon Bob Marley and Rita Marley.  He also performed the theme song for the children's cartoon series Arthur...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/154857"}}, {tmdbId:"237537", properties:{bornIn:"Santiago, Cuba", imdbId:"0549138", born:date('1946-07-25'), name:"Rita Marley", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gkkBcigbHGbIUmggb78jYr8F4KR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/237537"}}, {tmdbId:"34489", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0050156", born:date('1977-04-24'), name:"Eric Balfour", bio:"Eric Salter Balfour (born April 24, 1977) is an American singer and actor of film and television.  He is the lead singer of Born As Ghosts, formerly known as Fredalba.  His best known roles include Milo Pressman on the action-thriller TV series 24 and Duke Crocker in the supernatural series Haven. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Eric Balfour , licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cdJF0WLFUwl9unbPjnpFZ7dUNP2.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/34489"}}, {tmdbId:"23185", properties:{bornIn:"Inglewood, California, USA", imdbId:"0933092", born:date('1942-06-20'), name:"Brian Wilson", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nBrian Douglas Wilson (born June 20, 1942) is an American musician, singer, songwriter, and record producer who co-founded the Beach Boys.  After signing with Capitol Records in 1962, Wilson wrote or co-wrote more than two dozen Top 40 hits for the group.  He originally functioned as the band's songwriter, producer, co-lead vocalist, bassist, keyboardist, and de facto leader...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6UUmmlfjjG7ayq5uUHcsYk7ssP1.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23185"}}, {tmdbId:"557821", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0004704", born:date('1935-03-31'), name:"Herb Alpert", bio:"Herb Alpert (born March 31, 1935) is an American jazz musician most associated with the group variously known as Herb Alpert & the Tijuana Brass, Herb Alpert's Tijuana Brass, or TJB. \n\nAlpert is also a recording industry executive, the \"A\" of A&M Records, a recording label he and business partner Jerry Moss founded and eventually sold to PolyGram.  Alpert also has created abstract expressionist paintings and sculpture over two decades, which are publicly displayed on occasion...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/557821"}}, {tmdbId:"585502", properties:{bornIn:"San Francisco, California, USA", imdbId:"0803348", born:date('1963-07-30'), name:"Ori Sivan", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wpp0ZBd3oWz3pBT8kSRgdDsuUh9.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/585502"}}, {tmdbId:"72569", properties:{imdbId:"2923235", name:"Ronny Dayag", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/72569"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"2646508", properties:{name:"Shmuel Frenkel", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2646508"}}, {tmdbId:"34202", properties:{bornIn:"Ohio, USA ", imdbId:"1782667", born:date('1983-04-01'), name:"Matt Lanter", bio:"Matthew Mackendree \"Matt\" Lanter (born April 1, 1983) is an American actor, voice actor, and model.  He gained fame by playing Liam Court in the CW hit teen drama series 90210, a spin-off of the 1990s Fox series Beverly Hills, 90210.  He also appeared in some major released films, such as Star Wars: The Clone Wars, Disaster Movie, Sorority Row, Vampires Suck and The Roommate.  He is the voice of Anakin Skywalker in Star Wars: The Clone Wars and Star Wars Rebels...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2ms8DR9n4wh9ZU6lIuqsE58LPT9.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/34202"}}, {tmdbId:"41345", properties:{bornIn:"Louisville, Kentucky, USA", imdbId:"0237065", born:date('1981-09-22'), name:"Ashley Eckstein", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fIjLS6RAafEUOeReG5W51cA7dWY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/41345"}}, {tmdbId:"19506", properties:{imdbId:"0852517", born:date('1969-07-22'), name:"James Arnold Taylor", bio:"Talent / Actor / Artist...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sSthBDGT8HBd2hXRNPymA6D0ov8.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19506"}}, {tmdbId:"23680", properties:{bornIn:"Bloomington, Indiana, USA", imdbId:"0048389", born:date('1962-08-31'), name:"Dee Bradley Baker", bio:"Dee Bradley Baker (born August 31, 1962) is an American voice actor.  Noted as his long-running-role as Squilliam Fancyson and other various characters in the hit TV series SpongeBob SquarePants.  He is best known for his voice-work on Avatar: The Last Airbender, Codename: Kids Next Door, Phineas and Ferb, Adventure Time with Finn and Jake, American Dad!, Ben 10, Star Wars: The Clone Wars, Halo, Gears of War, Portal 2, and Left 4 Dead...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fpGmSNSkwTaixEGAwC14A88JYAH.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/23680"}}, {tmdbId:"112013", properties:{bornIn:"Seosan, South Chungcheong, South Korea", imdbId:"1955294", born:date('1982-06-25'), name:"Rain", bio:"Jung Ji-hoon (정지훈), better known by his stage name Rain (비), is a South Korean singer-songwriter, actor, and music producer.   His acting career began in 2003, when he won the KBS Best New Actor award for his role in the drama \"Sang Doo! Let's Go To School\".  In 2004, Rain won the KBS Excellence in Acting award for his role in the drama \"Full House\"...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aXOjIBUxu7fmBOxTJcgYmtTKD1D.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/112013"}}, {tmdbId:"1086861", properties:{imdbId:"0151187", name:"Jonathan Chan-Pensley", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1086861"}}, {tmdbId:"46021", properties:{bornIn:"Cologne, Germany", imdbId:"0453489", born:date('1973-05-13'), name:"Ill-Young Kim", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/s2FuGOIBNVPrzdQtUJUZvw9bSqU.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/46021"}}, {tmdbId:"73328", properties:{bornIn:"Prishtina, Kosovo, Yugoslavia", imdbId:"1671184", born:date('1979-10-02'), name:"Arta Dobroshi", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   Arta Dobroshi is a Kosovar Albanian actress, often cited for her striking presence and ability to breath authentic life into the roles she plays. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Arta Dobroshi, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gNnNu7eUvFPpWLBSmzG8mBqyBnF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/73328"}}, {tmdbId:"73331", properties:{bornIn:"Albania", imdbId:"1456114", born:date('1980-07-25'), name:"Alban Ukaj", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/73331"}}, {tmdbId:"766", properties:{imdbId:"1678557", born:date('1979-01-01'), name:"Ashraf Barhom", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nLEExmNJZsFCT29AyUSAFSSZ5gb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/766"}}, {tmdbId:"53674", properties:{bornIn:"Bombay, Maharashtra, India", imdbId:"0430817", born:date('1979-04-28'), name:"Sharman Joshi", bio:"Sharman Joshi is an Indian stage and film actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vFTNmigsoDYoqpNdt8qhhJOLkOF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53674"}}, {tmdbId:"993846", properties:{imdbId:"3620280", name:"Joshua McIvor", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/70EFKXOx00PwTnBa9PQH26E43Gc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/993846"}}, {tmdbId:"1485203", properties:{imdbId:"3815288", name:"Jack Taylor", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5zqEHBp8GJLRDcBVFI6kPXNVgp.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1485203"}}, {tmdbId:"76068", properties:{bornIn:"Auckland, New Zealand", imdbId:"1168915", born:date('1981-04-26'), name:"Michael Dorman", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/624CKam4fVBcHATuOfsOEvPzCCh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76068"}}, {tmdbId:"43202", properties:{bornIn:"Mittweida, Germany", imdbId:"1662644", born:date('1981-01-18'), name:"Antje Traue", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nAntje Traue (born January 18, 1981) is a German actress.  She speaks both German and English fluently, and appeared in her first English-language role in the film Pandorum. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Antje Traue, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/enfmTZlaXBoaVL1T5XVNe55WbOp.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/43202"}}, {tmdbId:"55061", properties:{bornIn:"Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", imdbId:"0004418", born:date('1974-08-05'), name:"Kajol", bio:"Kajol (born Kajol Mukherjee), also known by her married name Kajol Devgan, is an Indian film actress, who predominantly works in Hindi cinema.  Born in Mumbai to the Mukherjee-Samarth family, she is the daughter of actress Tanuja Samarth and late filmmaker Shomu Mukherjee.  Regarded as one of India's most successful and highest-paid actresses, Kajol is the recipient of numerous accolades, including six Filmfare Awards, among twelve nominations...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cwum24EsxNwpcEsboKkudiGySLY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/55061"}}, {tmdbId:"1490432", properties:{imdbId:"1995953", name:"Katie A. Keane", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oODkMHuBgQItFfX88n4V9HJ6a5w.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1490432"}}, {tmdbId:"98286", properties:{bornIn:"Plano, Texas, USA", imdbId:"2778261", born:date('1995-05-12'), name:"Kenton Duty", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nKenton Duty (born May 12, 1995) is an American actor.  He stars as the flamboyant European exchange student Günther Hessenheffer on the Disney Channel original series Shake It Up!. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kenton Duty, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7D5BEqzdaKvIWZTueNb7h99dvxH.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/98286"}}, {tmdbId:"440879", properties:{imdbId:"1693432", name:"Jan Cornet", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/440879"}}] AS row
