UNWIND [{tmdbId:"115134", properties:{imdbId:"3224367", name:"Daniel Robinson", bio:"Daniel Robinson is a multi-talented actor, singer, dancer, director, choreographer, cinematographer, video editor, photographer, web designer and graphic designer. \n\nDaniel made his Broadway debut in HAIRSPRAY (2006-2009).   Closing its run,  playing the role of Fender while understudying both Link Larkin &amp; Corny Collins for Ashley Parker Angel &amp; Lance Bass.  On film, Daniel starred in THE BIG GAY MUSICAL as the lead Paul/Adam...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/115134"}}, {tmdbId:"115135", properties:{bornIn:"Lynchburg, Virginia, USA", imdbId:"2870627", name:"Joey Dudding", bio:"Joey Dudding is an American stage and screen actor who is best known for his film roles in \"The Big Gay Musical\" (2009), \"Enchanted\" (2007) and \"Half-Share\" (2011) and stage roles in  \"Chorus Line\" (2006), \"La Cage aux Folles\" (2004) and \"Gypsy\" (2003) on Broadway...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/115135"}}, {tmdbId:"115136", properties:{imdbId:"3224632", name:"Jeff Metzler", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/115136"}}, {tmdbId:"4238", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago - Illinois - USA", imdbId:"0996669", born:date('1972-03-13'), name:"Common", bio:"Lonnie Rashid Lynn, Jr.  (born March 13, 1972), better known by his stage name Common (formerly Common Sense), is an American hip hop recording artist, actor, film producer and poet from Chicago, Illinois...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2h2SjbsAQ1lsZXSDVNd5qn6ALVe.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4238"}}, {tmdbId:"95356", properties:{bornIn:"Philadelphia, Pennsylvania, USA", imdbId:"1470683", name:"Charlie Saxton", bio:"​Charlie Saxton is an American film, television and video game actor. \n\nHe had a supporting role as Bug, one of the band members, in Bandslam.  He currently is co-starring in Hung, an HBO comedy-drama series, playing the son of Thomas Jane's main character.  He also provided a voice in the video game Bully. \n\nHe graduated from Bristol Senior High School in 2008...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/95356"}}, {tmdbId:"2061284", properties:{name:"Ko Muang", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2061284"}}, {tmdbId:"1622904", properties:{bornIn:"Rangoon, Burma", imdbId:"1238989", born:date('1945-06-19'), name:"Aung San Suu Kyi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1622904"}}, {tmdbId:"142388", properties:{bornIn:"Hove, East Sussex, England, UK", imdbId:"3505032", born:date('1996-01-01'), name:"Izzy Meikle-Small", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zQZyOJXQF8XApPRBoDJaasI3RHA.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/142388"}}, {tmdbId:"59671", properties:{bornIn:"Clay, Alabama", imdbId:"0186728", born:date('1978-04-20'), name:"Clayne Crawford", bio:"Clayne Crawford (born April 20, 1978) is an American film actor with a few episodic television appearances.  Crawford has appeared in such films as A Walk to Remember (2002), Swimfan (2002), A Love Song for Bobby Long (2004) and The Great Raid (2005).  He had a recurring role in the first season of Jericho as Mitchell \"Mitch\" Cafferty.  In 2008 he appeared in Life in the episode \"Evil. . . and His Brother Ziggy...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/59671"}}, {tmdbId:"154229", properties:{imdbId:"0021132", name:"Tyrees Allen", bio:"From Wikipedia: http://en. wikipedia. org/wiki/Tyrees_Allen\n\nTyrees Allen is an American actor.  His Television work includes series regular roles on \"Women's Murder Club\" and \"Dark Blue\" recurring roles on \"The Practice\" \"Alias\" \"Coming Home\" guest star appearances on such shows as \"Cold Case\" \"Without A Trace\" \"Castle\" \"Scandal\" \"CSI:Miami\" \"Brothers&amp;Sister\"...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/154229"}}, {tmdbId:"1319440", properties:{imdbId:"1640173", name:"Cooper Barnes", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5qVg19l32TqY8JvBYG0ZxKDCPmt.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1319440"}}, {tmdbId:"138073", properties:{imdbId:"3224868", name:"Tessa Swigart", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/138073"}}, {tmdbId:"40632", properties:{bornIn:"Grants Pass, Oregon, U.S.", imdbId:"1044403", born:date('1981-03-11'), name:"David Anders", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nDavid Anders (born David Anders Holt on March 11, 1981) is an American television and stage actor.  He is best known for his roles as Julian Sark on Alias, and as Adam Monroe on Heroes.  Although Anders is American, both of these noted roles required him to use an English accent. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article David Anders, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tP8kJo7hEiClHTbgFDdpPFx37Md.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/40632"}}, {tmdbId:"588231", properties:{bornIn:"Hackettstown, New Jersey, USA", imdbId:"0943699", born:date('1976-08-22'), name:"Chris Wylde", bio:"Chris Wylde is an American actor born and raised in New Jersey.   Chris is the son of preacher parents.  He attended Northern Highlands Regional High School in Allendale, New Jersey, and was selected for the NJ Governor's School of the Arts for acting.  Chris graduated from the American University in Washington, DC, with a bachelor's degree in Theater-Performance...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eS2Gv7lBrwNYeifgV23Jwm5HSZL.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/588231"}}, {tmdbId:"92651", properties:{imdbId:"1445493", name:"Louise Griffiths", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/92651"}}, {tmdbId:"588232", properties:{imdbId:"0241539", name:"Jacy King", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/588232"}}, {tmdbId:"1559224", properties:{name:"Matthew Rush Sullivan", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1559224"}}, {tmdbId:"935201", properties:{bornIn:"Mexico City, Distrito Federal, Mexico", imdbId:"1546300", born:date('1990-11-29'), name:"Diego Boneta", bio:"Diego Andrés González Boneta is a Mexican singer and actor.  He is best known for playing Rocco in the Mexican soap opera Rebelde and Javier on CW's 90210.  He recorded his self-titled debut album with his first single, Responde in 2005 and a Brazilian version for the album, with songs in Portuguese was recorded in 2006.  He appeared as Alex Santiago in the ABC Family series of Pretty Little Liars, Drew Boley in Rock of Ages, and Pete Martinez in the 2015 series Scream Queens...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yklpeuynWTgcSaC7alN5jlha6jT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/935201"}}, {tmdbId:"1223786", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"3592338", born:date('1986-10-23'), name:"Emilia Clarke", bio:"Emilia Isabelle Euphemia Rose Clarke (born 23 October 1986) is an English actress. \n\nClarke rose to prominence in 2011 for her breakthrough role as Daenerys Targaryen in the HBO series Game of Thrones, a performance that has gained her both critical and popular acclaim.  In 2017, Clarke became one of the highest paid actors on television for earnings of £2 million per episode of Game of Thrones...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/86jeYFV40KctQMDQIWhJ5oviNGj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1223786"}}, {tmdbId:"224181", properties:{bornIn:"Cherrybrook, Sydney, Australia", imdbId:"2541974", born:date('1986-03-15'), name:"Jai Courtney", bio:"Born March 15, 1986 in Sydney, Australia, Courtney and his sister were raised in Sydney's leafy northwest suburbs, attending Galston Public School where their mother, Karen, was a teacher.  His father, Chris, was a civil servant with the state electricity company, implying that there were no show business influences in the family when Jai caught the acting bug as a 10-year-old.  He went on to develop his dramatic skills at Cherrybrook Technology High School...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9kMUy38pj7oTCuQUhfkbgXOedCq.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/224181"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"144146", properties:{imdbId:"0652212", name:"Ermahn Ospina", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/144146"}}, {tmdbId:"89645", properties:{imdbId:"0477577", name:"Péter Kálloy Molnár", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gH0LB7a7Q4svjdEv107mk87ZuYg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/89645"}}, {tmdbId:"814200", properties:{bornIn:"Nottingham, England, UK", imdbId:"2468782", born:date('1984-04-09'), name:"Arsher Ali", bio:"Arsher Ali was born on April 9, 1984 in Nottingham, England.  He is an actor, known for The Ritual (2017), Line of Duty (2012) and Complicit (2013).  He has been married to Roxy Shahidi since 2010...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aJuC920mFXOsyt5hKdcOS8H4UXQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/814200"}}, {tmdbId:"6971", properties:{imdbId:"0512283", name:"Nigel Lindsay", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nNigel Lindsay is an English actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bvkX9ju5Irpw0m1qnW1UuW0F24q.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/6971"}}, {tmdbId:"2654901", properties:{name:"Lisa Adam", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2654901"}}, {tmdbId:"79270", properties:{imdbId:"0356625", born:date('1968-02-16'), name:"Annika Hallin", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/w0xkKmLS2AeXKB6HqrUqeq5LzRC.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/79270"}}, {tmdbId:"2564572", properties:{name:"Rachel Wood", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2564572"}}, {tmdbId:"1138165", properties:{imdbId:"3920164", name:"Andile Mngadi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1138165"}}, {tmdbId:"230822", properties:{imdbId:"2944959", name:"Porteus Xandau", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/230822"}}, {tmdbId:"73357", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"1870434", born:date('1992-05-19'), name:"Eleanor Tomlinson", bio:"Eleanor May Tomlinson (born 19 May 1992) is an English actress.  She was born in London, but at a young age, she moved with her family to Beverley, East Riding of Yorkshire, England...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sMiNkO6djSs2C1227biyfFgfjM1.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/73357"}}, {tmdbId:"223879", properties:{bornIn:"Stuttgart, Baden-Württemberg, Germany", imdbId:"2551886", born:date('1972-03-23'), name:"Reggie Watts", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4498ocedmBNnMIKtnMUGO8yIesx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/223879"}}, {tmdbId:"136486", properties:{bornIn:"Leeds, West Yorkshire, England, UK ", imdbId:"0486018", born:date('1968-05-14'), name:"Antony Langdon", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/136486"}}, {tmdbId:"229933", properties:{bornIn:"Tehran, Iran", imdbId:"1486911", born:date('1974-02-04'), name:"Shahab Hosseini", bio:"Shahab Hosseini (شهاب حسینی) is a director and actor of theater, television, and cinema who was born in 1974 in Tehran, Iran.  He started his professional career by playing Amir Ghavidel's \"Rokhsareh\".  He Nominated for Best Supporting Actor in Fajr Festival for two consecutive years in \"A Candle in The Wind\" by Pouran Derakhshandeh and \"Salvation in Twenty minutes after Eight\" by Sirous Alvand.  He then won the Best Actor Award for the Fajr Festival for \"The Superstar\" by Tahmineh Milani...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iMDMsfjK00B9ZsswRFWfKPyXR9R.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/229933"}}, {tmdbId:"240243", properties:{bornIn:"Tehran, Iran", imdbId:"0953423", born:date('1974-04-14'), name:"Merila Zare'i", bio:"Merila Zarei (مریلا زارعی) was born on 14 April 1974.  She is an Iranian actress famous for A Separation, About Elly, Hush! Girls Don't Scream, Two Women, Track 143, the Fifth Reaction, Keifar, The Unwanted Woman and The Outcast.  She graduated from Azad University of Tehran.  During her studies Merila Zarei became interested in acting through Ezatollah Entezami's acting courses.  Her first movie was in Ali Asghar Shadravan's Patak...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cdQ7pLnZw3OpnorL9muH5m1RQ9k.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/240243"}}, {tmdbId:"1421427", properties:{imdbId:"6781688", name:"Abraham Attah", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8r5GdE98NDuj8hMJktXtFWVtxxl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1421427"}}, {tmdbId:"1533161", properties:{imdbId:"7636995", name:"Emmanuel Affadzi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1533161"}}, {tmdbId:"1695389", properties:{name:"Ricky Adelayitor", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1695389"}}, {tmdbId:"1695396", properties:{name:"Andrew Adote", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1695396"}}, {tmdbId:"65920", properties:{bornIn:"Plymouth, North Carolina, USA", imdbId:"1356578", born:date('1964-12-16'), name:"J.B. Smoove", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nJerry Brooks (born December 16, 1964), better known by his stage name J. B.  Smoove, is an American actor, writer and stand-up comedian best known for his recurring role as Leon on Curb Your Enthusiasm...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/691r7OL0R9TaR7SaqR6AnKVLUUu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65920"}}, {tmdbId:"1023139", properties:{bornIn:"San Diego, California, USA", imdbId:"3485845", born:date('1983-11-19'), name:"Adam Driver", bio:"Adam Douglas Driver (born November 19, 1983) is an American actor.  He rose to prominence in the supporting role of Adam Sackler in the HBO comedy-drama series Girls (2012–2017), for which he received three consecutive nominations for the Primetime Emmy Award for Outstanding Supporting Actor in a Comedy Series.  He made his Broadway debut in Mrs.  Warren's Profession (2010).  In 2011, he returned to Broadway in Man and Boy and made his feature film debut in J.  Edgar...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fsbGQ1eZFgdsG1XnKlhNSvHsiGo.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1023139"}}] AS row
