s a production company called Straight Shooters in partnership with her mother, director Gail Harvey...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9sT9105hOd8D0Oqn2Wo9EvRmXgj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/128150"}}, {tmdbId:"1196458", properties:{imdbId:"0442594", name:"Yardly Kavanagh", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3713UXYp3ldF3DE2Cr9V59gtEfm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1196458"}}, {tmdbId:"37153", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"2368789", born:date('1988-12-01'), name:"Zoë Kravitz", bio:"Zoë Isabella Kravitz (born December 1, 1988) is an American actress, singer and model.  She is the daughter of musician Lenny Kravitz and actress Lisa Bonet.  Kravitz is best known for her roles as Catwoman in The Batman (2021), the HBO series Big Little Lies, Mad Max: Fury Road (2015), the Fantastic Beasts films, and the Divergent films...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zx74kkI931iiQATJybvRKWYnOe9.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/37153"}}, {tmdbId:"1183824", properties:{imdbId:"3995471", name:"Craig Van Hook", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1183824"}}, {tmdbId:"53937", properties:{bornIn:"Guantanamo Bay, Cuba", imdbId:"0580646", born:date('1956-02-15'), name:"Olga Merediz", bio:"Olga Merediz is an American film, TV, Broadway, and voice over actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mcCWyyaYLvroZ0O3jfYuejyWySc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/53937"}}, {tmdbId:"1021524", properties:{bornIn:"Kolkata, West Bengal, India", imdbId:"1913625", born:date('1981-06-27'), name:"Parambrata Chatterjee", bio:"Parambrata Chattopadhyay was born on June 27, 1980 in Calcutta, West Bengal, India.  He is an actor and director, known for Kahaani (2012), Feluda (2017) and Bony (2020)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2A9qQos0y7ALw6rLLaI1QBR3uxZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1021524"}}, {tmdbId:"85593", properties:{bornIn:"Calcutta, Bengal Presidency, British India [now India]", imdbId:"0154122", born:date('1945-05-30'), name:"Dhritiman Chatterjee", bio:"Dhritiman Chatterjee (Bengali: ধৃতিমান চট্টোপাধ্যায়) is an Indian actor.  He began his acting career in 1970 as the protagonist of Satyajit Ray's Pratidwandi (The Adversary).  Most of his acting work has been in India's \"parallel\", or independent, cinema with filmmakers such as Satyajit Ray, Mrinal Sen and Aparna Sen, among others.  He has also worked in English films with well-known filmmakers such as Deepa Mehta and Jane Campion...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7a1O5afOzUFqmDYGtHLT4SQdQa.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85593"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"1093644", properties:{imdbId:"1384413", born:date('1970-12-19'), name:"Saswata Chatterjee", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qUvH3P9RupODK5a3yQJZk9Oa6v8.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1093644"}}, {tmdbId:"62831", properties:{bornIn:"Alameda County, California, USA", imdbId:"0287182", born:date('1970-06-17'), name:"Will Forte", bio:"Orville Willis Forte IV, better known as Will Forte (born June 17, 1970), is an American actor, comedian and writer best known as a cast member on Saturday Night Live from 2002–2010 and for starring in the SNL spin-off film MacGruber...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kphnirb7YggSVEhGI47kACxaIJQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/62831"}}, {tmdbId:"2064", properties:{imdbId:"0235968", born:date('1933-12-09'), name:"Morton Downey Jr.", died:date('2001-03-12'), url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2064"}}, {tmdbId:"1217738", properties:{imdbId:"2253512", born:date('1964-02-10'), name:"Glenn Beck", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1217738"}}, {tmdbId:"1645858", properties:{name:"Bob Pittman", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1645858"}}, {tmdbId:"985041", properties:{bornIn:"Sudafrica", imdbId:"4375135", born:date('1974-09-26'), name:"Ninja", bio:"Watkin Tudor Jones (born 26 September 1974), currently known by his stage name Ninja, is a South African rapper, record producer, performance artist and satirist.  Previously, he has recorded under a guise of different names, Max Normal and MC Totally Rad being some of the most prominent. \n\nWatkin Tudor Jones was a part of South African hip-hop scene for many years, fronting such acts as The Original Evergreens, MaxNormal. TV and The Constructus Corporation...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9x7wvoru7ICwoxZC657PgVndclY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/985041"}}, {tmdbId:"985040", properties:{bornIn:"Port Alfred, Eastern Cape, South Africa", imdbId:"4375497", born:date('1984-03-03'), name:"Yo-Landi Visser", bio:"Yolandi Visser (styled as Yo-Landi Vi$$er, born Anri du Toit) is a South African singer/rapper who co-fronts the rap group Die Antwoord. She was also part of notable music and art groups MaxNormal. TV and The Constructus Corporation. \n\nShe has a child named Sixteen Jones with frequent collaborator and fellow Die Antwoord frontman Watkin Tudor Jones...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lTVLpBWuSzHkUHOiBfGS4T6ggeb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/985040"}}, {tmdbId:"238044", properties:{imdbId:"4461361", born:date('1996-12-10'), name:"Thomas Doret", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fHU7RFB5hMQdt9Vx5V9nFLmfyfw.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/238044"}}, {tmdbId:"17067", properties:{bornIn:"Prenzlauer Berg, East Berlin, East Germany", imdbId:"0378932", born:date('1984-05-22'), name:"Karoline Herfurth", bio:"Karoline Herfurth was born on May 22, 1984 in Berlin, Germany.  She is an actress and director, known for Perfume: The Story of a Murderer (2006), SMS für Dich (2016) and The Reader (2008)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dKc2SX0j70AekHjI02iyEYsTPGF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17067"}}, {tmdbId:"220448", properties:{bornIn:"London, England", imdbId:"2167957", born:date('1978-02-12'), name:"Paul Anderson", bio:"Paul Anderson is an English actor who started his acting career in the late 2000s.  He was previously a ticket scalper who decided to attend Webber Douglas drama school, subsequently landing roles in theatre and in films such as The Firm, Sherlock Holmes: A Game of Shadows and Passion.  Anderson is known for his breakout role as Arthur Shelby in British television series Peaky Blinders...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nds5rTBZvJ4rEsP4N6OaoEgQDkW.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/220448"}}, {tmdbId:"592313", properties:{bornIn:"Schwedt, Brandenburg, Germany", imdbId:"2903245", born:date('1989-04-13'), name:"Rick Okon", bio:"Rick Okon is a German film and television actor. \n\nHe took professional drama lessons at the New Talent Schauspielschule in Hamburg and layer studied at the Filmuniversität Babelsberg Konrad Wolf in Potsdam.  His first leading role was in the film \"Romeos\" (2011) in which he played the role of Luke...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kBM6bJeDs3KUXpaAqYf8cv8etBR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/592313"}}, {tmdbId:"299506", properties:{bornIn:"Berlin, Germany", imdbId:"0066654", born:date('1989-05-15'), name:"Maximilian Befort", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sb6XwTn70bgmRpcwjyYYq4pvhpO.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/299506"}}, {tmdbId:"583333", properties:{bornIn:"Berlin, Germany", imdbId:"2939186", born:date('1990-10-31'), name:"Liv Lisa Fries", bio:"Liv Lisa Fries (born 31 October 1990) is a German actress.  In 2017, she gained an international following as the female lead Charlotte Ritter in the German TV series Babylon Berlin. \n\nShe was raised in the Berlin borough of Pankow.  Fries studied abroad as an exchange student in Beijing.  After receiving her Abitur in 2010, she enrolled in university to study philosophy and literary science, but dropped out as her career as an actress progressed...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xkoleCmeMr1GBfCry0GEvkXV9XN.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/583333"}}, {tmdbId:"592314", properties:{imdbId:"4294727", born:date('1988-05-02'), name:"Felix Brocke", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/592314"}}, {tmdbId:"240240", properties:{bornIn:"Tehran, Iran", imdbId:"0368689", born:date('1972-10-02'), name:"Leila Hatami", bio:"Award-winning actress, Leila Hatami, was born on October 1, 1972 in Tehran, Iran, to legendary Iranian Director, Ali Hatami, and actress mother, Zari Khoshkam (Zahra Hatami).  During her childhood, she appeared in several of her father's films including the historical TV series, Hezar dastan (1978), and biopic Kamalolmolk (1984), as well as a role as Leila, the blind Turkish princess in the film The Love-stricken (1992)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3aetR78ePBsokK4vbNGzemutJrn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/240240"}}, {tmdbId:"559567", properties:{bornIn:"Tehran, Iran", imdbId:"4299147", born:date('1979-10-06'), name:"Sareh Bayat", bio:"Sare Bayat is an Iranian actress, television host, and model.  She is best known for her role as Razie in the Academy Award-winning A Separation, for which she won the Silver Bear for Best Actress at the Berlin International Film Festival...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/el6WyRhfKq5HztB0HZwQWjV6ITn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/559567"}}, {tmdbId:"205257", properties:{bornIn:"Brighton, East Sussex, England, UK", imdbId:"2189625", born:date('1986-10-10'), name:"Lucy Griffiths", bio:"Attended Windlesham School and Dorothy Stringer School.  She graduated from Varndean College...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/205257"}}, {tmdbId:"1240648", properties:{imdbId:"1510059", name:"Michael Crane", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/41Pri6UlFT0IU3mKvXTBVMcUaci.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1240648"}}, {tmdbId:"2957", properties:{bornIn:"Omdurman, Sudan", imdbId:"0796502", born:date('1965-11-21'), name:"Alexander Siddig", bio:"Siddig El Tahir El Fadil El Siddig Abderrahman Mohammed Ahmed Abdel Karim El Mahdi ( born 21 November 1965) is a Sudanese-born English actor, also known as Siddig El Fadil and his stage name Alexander Siddig.  He is known for playing Dr.  Julian Bashir in the television series Star Trek: Deep Space Nine, and for his performances as Prince Nasir Al-Subaai in Syriana (2005) and as Imad ad-Din al-Isfahani in Kingdom of Heaven (2005).  He has also guest starred on 24 as Hamri Al-Assad...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fpriiMtXCqG74iALsr9uK8iyDbp.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2957"}}, {tmdbId:"1081077", properties:{bornIn:"Beijing, China", born:date('1957-08-28'), name:"Weiwei Ai", bio:"Ai Weiwei is a Chinese contemporary artist and activist.  Ai grew up in the far north-west of China, where he lived under harsh conditions due to his father's exile.  As an activist, he has been openly critical of the Chinese Government's stance on democracy and human rights.  He investigated government corruption and cover-ups, in particular the Sichuan schools corruption scandal following the collapse of schools in the 2008 Sichuan earthquake...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/hD3ot74TFao8xDaeUaxuRK0RKsS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1081077"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"2687087", properties:{name:"Lao Ai", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2687087"}}, {tmdbId:"2686999", properties:{name:"Lee Ambrozy", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2686999"}}, {tmdbId:"78962", properties:{bornIn:"Adelaide, South Australia, Australia", imdbId:"0574173", name:"Andy McPhee", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uC0QWuaaOoIcLl6f5ebkFgTyF1r.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/78962"}}, {tmdbId:"126579", properties:{imdbId:"0669853", born:date('1973-11-24'), name:"Aaron Pedersen", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3SoOwjIPULquiuo0yBWAwVamJFj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/126579"}}, {tmdbId:"156962", properties:{bornIn:"Kansas City, Kansas, USA", imdbId:"0832314", born:date('1971-09-09'), name:"Eric Stonestreet", bio:"Eric Stonestreet (born September 9, 1971) is an American actor best known for his starring role on Modern Family...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mZNmY4o9Q8oLvM0T04eLq3MGzoQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/156962"}}, {tmdbId:"198150", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago - Illinois - USA", imdbId:"0054697", born:date('1977-02-18'), name:"Ike Barinholtz", bio:"Isaac \"Ike\" Barinholtz, born February 18, 1977, is an American actor, comedian, voice actor and writer, known as a cast member on MADtv (1995), from 2002-2007, and for his roles on The Mindy Project (2012) and Eastbound & Down (2009).  He spent two years in Amsterdam with the famed comedy troupe, \"Boom Chicago\", along with Jordan Peele, Josh Meyers and Nicole Parker...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mB6pvurTeQIf55UiOQrkaB1Pynu.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/198150"}}, {tmdbId:"928134", properties:{bornIn:"Tampa, Florida, USA", imdbId:"3827211", born:date('2003-08-26'), name:"Emma Rayne Lyle", bio:"Emma has often been described as \"an old soul. \" As an actor she expresses a maturity and wisdom of someone far older.  Emma is known in the industry for her professional attitude on set and her incredible awareness.  As an actor, she has been described as \"a natural. \"  Emma is the youngest of three children.  She lives in the country and has two chocolate labs Lou and Lola.  Emma is home schooled and loves to go fishing with her dad...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/c0WZRcU8DGlEuPe85KHojqeWVJc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/928134"}}, {tmdbId:"138010", properties:{bornIn:"Sydney, New South Wales, Australia", imdbId:"1801800", born:date('1983-07-22'), name:"Sharni Vinson", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nSharni Vinson (born July 22, 1983) is an Australian model, actress and dancer known for her work in the soap opera Home and Away and the film Step Up 3D. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Sharni Vinson, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qEuypNXzBNO1dMszDoiR20nHli2.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/138010"}}, {tmdbId:"149966", properties:{bornIn:"Middletown, Connecticut, USA", imdbId:"2431167", born:date('1981-04-03'), name:"Nicholas Tucci", died:date('2020-03-03'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3gnc1wwSmtrbushD7xcvtzDUaUy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/149966"}}, {tmdbId:"168529", properties:{imdbId:"0322674", name:"Wendy Glenn", bio:"Wendy Glenn is an English actress in film and television...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lFygnkgowUuifFG1hURZUtPNCrJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/168529"}}, {tmdbId:"74133", properties:{bornIn:"Marietta, Georgia, USA", imdbId:"1410105", born:date('1977-12-21'), name:"AJ Bowen", bio:"An American stage and film actor who appeared as Lewis Denton in the film The Signal. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article A.  J.  Bowen, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rdvwEF5VVOuRFjRTFmOIVJ81QWg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/74133"}}, {tmdbId:"24987", properties:{bornIn:"Bilbao, Vizcaya, País Vasco, España", imdbId:"0054381", born:date('1949-07-13'), name:"Ramón Barea", bio:"Talented and prolific theater and movie actor from Bilbao, Ramón Barea came to the fore of Spanish cinema in En la puta calle (1997) with his memorable role of Juan, a jobless electrician who becomes homeless.  It took a great actor to make this xenophobic moaner a likable fellow...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7KJMpbljybgVMhHuNosECDrzact.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/24987"}}, {tmdbId:"224728", properties:{bornIn:"Jaén, Spain", imdbId:"2285844", born:date('1980-06-25'), name:"Inma Cuesta", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zyoic1HQnyDElVvTuTN8PgjaTAv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/224728"}}, {tmdbId:"60077", properties:{bornIn:"Toronto, Ontario,  Canada", imdbId:"0808022", born:date('1985-06-22'), name:"Douglas Smith", bio:"Douglas Alexander Smith (born June 22, 1985) is a Canadian-American actor most notable for his work on the HBO series, Big Love as Ben Henrickson, the eldest son of polygamist Bill Henrickson. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Douglas Smith (actor), licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rHZPWNxjIrpiHQnEOttscjTVvnm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/60077"}}, {tmdbId:"207401", properties:{bornIn:"Houston, Texas, USA", imdbId:"1628079", born:date('1990-05-17'), name:"Leven Rambin", bio:"Leven Rambin was born on May 17, 1990 in Houston, Texas, USA as Leven Alice Rambin.  She is an actress and director, known for The Hunger Games (2012), Percy Jackson: Sea of Monsters (2013) and Chasing Mavericks (2012).  She has been married to Jim Parrack since October 10, 2015...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sO3P6LX42339crEYyR9FPSUYwqC.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/207401"}}, {tmdbId:"76511", properties:{bornIn:"Miami, Florida, USA", imdbId:"2358540", born:date('1984-07-12'), name:"Natalie Martinez", bio:"Natalie Martinez is an American actress and model, known as the spokesmodel for JLO by Jennifer Lopez, and for her supporting role in Death Race.  She has appeared in several music videos and telenovelas...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oKdNzaYEzq1xgTI4on4DfWnP4YV.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76511"}}, {tmdbId:"90455", properties:{bornIn:"Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada", imdbId:"2954597", born:date('2001-03-06'), name:"Aryana Engineer", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/b5LzX9Oo7EL5auRMpPFTLWmxFiS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/90455"}}, {tmdbId:"125488", properties:{bornIn:"Paris, France", imdbId:"2918889", born:date('1979-05-19'), name:"Flavio Parenti", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lyRtBH9nBoPKHPUaaZDVamHgKP.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/125488"}}, {tmdbId:"928281", properties:{imdbId:"4709205", name:"Montrail 'Money' Brown", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/928281"}}, {tmdbId:"928278", properties:{imdbId:"4709068", name:"O.C. Brown", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/928278"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"928279", properties:{imdbId:"4708927", name:"Bill Courtney", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/928279"}}, {tmdbId:"928280", properties:{imdbId:"4709342", name:"Chavis Daniels", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/928280"}}, {tmdbId:"176048", properties:{imdbId:"1317797", name:"Basil Harris", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/176048"}}, {tmdbId:"25884", properties:{bornIn:"Detroit, Michigan, USA", imdbId:"0707476", born:date('1971-06-22'), name:"Mary Lynn Rajskub", bio:"Mary Lynn Rajskub (born June 22, 1971) is an American actress and comedian, best known for her leading role as Chloe O'Brian on the Fox action-thriller 24...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rJxAkgYX3RfY9x2aYo2InbEp1HL.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/25884"}}, {tmdbId:"1326568", properties:{imdbId:"5146515", name:"David Rawle", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1326568"}}, {tmdbId:"1326574", properties:{imdbId:"1907066", name:"Lisa Hannigan", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6kDVH4bpUqC6N6LOhdR6NLivAAx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1326574"}}, {tmdbId:"224842", properties:{bornIn:"Phoenix - Arizona - USA", imdbId:"2554052", born:date('1989-12-22'), name:"Jordin Sparks", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nJordin Brianna Sparks (born December 22, 1989) is an American singer-songwriter and actress.  In 2007, she came to prominence after winning the sixth season of American Idol; at age 17, she became the youngest winner in the series' history.  Her self-titled debut album was released later that year; it was certified platinum by the RIAA and has sold over two million copies worldwide...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dwTzkn7gAo6J5bfmnmbCp5TVmEn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/224842"}}, {tmdbId:"76242", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"0164929", born:date('1975-12-06'), name:"Noel Clarke", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nNoel Anthony Clarke (born 6 December 1975) is an English actor, director and screenwriter from London.  He is best known for playing Wyman Norris in Auf Wiedersehen, Pet and Mickey Smith in Doctor Who.  Clarke appeared in and wrote the screenplay for Kidulthood and wrote, directed and starred in the sequel, Adulthood, which gained £1,209,319 from the opening weekend of its release...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oxZZYUJNQnFHpZ61CytkeIfptAx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76242"}}, {tmdbId:"86133", properties:{bornIn:"Manchester, England", imdbId:"2439913", born:date('1982-12-14'), name:"Matthew McNulty", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nMatthew McNulty (born Michael Anthony McNulty 14 December 1982 in Manchester) is an English actor of film and television. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Matthew McNulty, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ogOv3CHt3EWn1K2vc0Ou1ycnlqZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/86133"}}, {tmdbId:"89885", properties:{bornIn:"Canada", imdbId:"2051265", born:date('1999-02-19'), name:"Quinn Lord", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nQuinn Edmond Julian Lord (born February 19, 1999) is a Canadian child actor probably best known for playing Sam in Trick 'r Treat.  His career started in 2004. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Quinn Lord,  licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bDPoGWxTx4THBjNYoJCnRtTK2RJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/89885"}}, {tmdbId:"17039", properties:{bornIn:"Joliet, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0644406", born:date('1970-06-26'), name:"Nick Offerman", bio:"Nicholas Offerman (born June 26, 1970) is an American actor, writer, comedian, producer, and woodworker.  He is best known for his role as Ron Swanson in the NBC sitcom Parks and Recreation, for which he received the Television Critics Association Award for Individual Achievement in Comedy and was twice nominated for the Critics' Choice Television Award for Best Supporting Actor in a Comedy Series...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7gnfjpIKhBCjfnZJEieIvjwzXLD.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17039"}}, {tmdbId:"2089049", properties:{name:"Betty Phelps", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2089049"}}, {tmdbId:"132398", properties:{bornIn:"Houston, Texas, USA", imdbId:"2510013", born:date('1986-10-07'), name:"Bree Olson", bio:"Rachel Marie Oberlin (born October 7, 1986), also known by her stage name Bree Olson, is an American actress, model, and former pornographic actress.  She performed in over 300 pornographic films from 2006 to 2013 before changing to mainstream acting. \n\nDescended from Ukrainian immigrants fleeing the Second World War, Bree Olson had humble beginnings.  She was born to a single mother in Houston, Texas.  Her first job was detailing corn in Indiana.  After that it was a meteoric rise to adult fame...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rnkLCR1zsmEbtYnpQdI1jUuJFBp.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/132398"}}, {tmdbId:"65831", properties:{bornIn:" Brooklyn, New York, USA", imdbId:"0489436", born:date('1963-09-20'), name:"Robert LaSardo", bio:"Robert LaSardo is an American actor. \n\nLaSardo was born in Brooklyn, New York.  He began his career studying at the High School of Performing Arts in New York City where he became an honors student, before going on to the Stella Adler Studio of Acting.  He spent four years in the U. S.  Navy.  For two of those years, he handled Navy attack dogs in the Aleutian Islands.  Due to his work in the Navy, he supports USA Cares, an organization that supports families of soldiers...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3oYYDOxSvtZ1OEXA7TAPrX4mcCI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65831"}}, {tmdbId:"212154", properties:{bornIn:"Brooklyn, New York, USA", imdbId:"2832695", born:date('1985-02-07'), name:"Deborah Ann Woll", bio:"Deborah Ann Woll (born February 7, 1985) is an American actress best known for her role as Jessica Hamby on HBO's True Blood. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Deborah Ann Woll, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yKhny4ZkLmAGlrp37mWzzkvGApb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/212154"}}, {tmdbId:"113732", properties:{bornIn:"Jakarta, Indonesia", imdbId:"3299397", born:date('1983-02-12'), name:"Iko Uwais", bio:"Iko Uwais born Uwais Qorny is an Indonesian actor, stuntman, fight choreographer, and martial artist. \n\nHe is best known for starring in the action films Merantau (2009), The Raid (2011), The Raid 2 (2014) and Headshot (2016)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/65stz9dZ39PYffX7eeoAf7INKUk.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/113732"}}, {tmdbId:"592496", properties:{bornIn:"Palembang, South Sumatra, Indonesia", born:date('1981-06-23'), name:"Joe Taslim", bio:"Johannes \"Joe\" Taslim is an Indonesian actor and martial artist of Chinese descent.  A member of the Indonesia Judo national team from 1997 to 2009, Taslim is best known for his breakthrough role as \"Jaka\" in the critically acclaimed The Raid (2011).  Later going on to play \"Jah\" in Fast & Furious 6 (2013), which marked his first role in a film outside Indonesia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kERsD7ISWEVqlq8twBbKZKxCQMQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/592496"}}, {tmdbId:"1202416", properties:{bornIn:"Giacarta, Indonesia", imdbId:"1902766", born:date('1978-12-07'), name:"Donny Alamsyah", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8nR5lqGOlzNgJ5sDL2tDNuprwyc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1202416"}}, {tmdbId:"142019", properties:{bornIn:"Tasikmalaya, West Java, Indonesia", imdbId:"3345670", born:date('1968-10-19'), name:"Yayan Ruhian", bio:"Yayan Ruhian was born in Tasikmalaya (West Java) on October 19, 1968.  He found his passion in Pencak Silat and other martial arts, becoming a professional martial arts instructor.  Ruhian is also known as an instructor of an inner breathing technique designed to condition of the body to withstand any impact.  In 1988, he began teaching at Perguruan Silat Tenaga Dasar Indonesia (Inner Breathing Technique Silat School in Indonesia)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fFTHNHUcur2a13WxQ9RUiT1rW0k.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/142019"}}, {tmdbId:"48514", properties:{bornIn:"Meaux, France", imdbId:"0431956", born:date('1969-07-25'), name:"Eric Judor", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iWVPgew1yPFawRTRBz7DcYI3aKt.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/48514"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"141433", properties:{imdbId:"1776820", name:"Steve Little", bio:"Steve Little is an American comic actor who currently acts on the shows Eastbound & Down and Adventure Time. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Steve Little (actor), licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6Hvu3pGKc0YtTgTwfku1EJvYSzY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/141433"}}, {tmdbId:"65196", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago - Illinois - USA", imdbId:"1229204", born:date('1978-11-20'), name:"Nadine Velazquez", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nNadine E.  Velázquez (born November 20, 1978, height 5' 5\" (1,65 m)) is an American actress and model known for her roles as Catalina Aruca on My Name Is Earl and Sofia Ruxin on The League. \n\nShe has also appeared in films such as War and Flight, and is a cast member on the TV series Major Crimes. Velazquez was born in Chicago, Illinois and is of Puerto Rican descent...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uARYneOeME6qChGb029BAUQuHuM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65196"}}, {tmdbId:"1201512", properties:{imdbId:"4131435", name:"Carter Cabassa", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1201512"}}, {tmdbId:"1263260", properties:{imdbId:"1424572", name:"Adam C. Edwards", bio:"Actor / Performance...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1263260"}}, {tmdbId:"67979", properties:{bornIn:"Saskatoon, Saskatchewan, Canada", imdbId:"1002664", born:date('1962-07-31'), name:"Michael Eklund", bio:"Michael Eklund is a Canadian film and television actor.  He's a graduate from the Alberta College of Art and Design, Calgary, Canada...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nS5KythBX5J8Blk1sXz4YsoWNbZ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/67979"}}, {tmdbId:"12097", properties:{imdbId:"0971017", name:"Christopher Knights", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nChristopher Knights is an English voice actor, film editor and camera operator best known for providing the voice of Private the Penguin in Madagascar.  He worked on several DreamWorks films Shrek, Shrek 2, Shrek the Third, and Shrek 4-D.  He started his filming career at Amblimation studios and worked on We're Back! A Dinosaur's Story and Balto.  When he joined DreamWorks he did not only start his editing career but his acting career...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lY4SomC77NUlqPWSmhzvqLfIn8R.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/12097"}}, {tmdbId:"183926", properties:{imdbId:"1827469", born:date('1993-10-02'), name:"Tara Lynne Barr", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/183926"}}, {tmdbId:"107777", properties:{bornIn:"Florida, USA", imdbId:"2624176", born:date('2001-02-06'), name:"Mackenzie Brooke Smith", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/107777"}}, {tmdbId:"81364", properties:{bornIn:"Oklahoma City, Oklahoma, USA", imdbId:"1601397", born:date('1980-07-03'), name:"Olivia Munn", bio:"Lisa Olivia Munn is an American actress and model.  She began her professional career in television journalism before becoming an actress.  In 2006, Munn starred as Mily Acuna on the series Beyond the Break.  She co-hosted Attack of the Show! from 2006 to 2010 and was a correspondent on The Daily Show from 2010 to 2011...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yGhwbYTkA5ktCQ8XLL8FWuG4XtW.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/81364"}}, {tmdbId:"86019", properties:{bornIn:"Jaipur, Rajasthan, India", imdbId:"2147526", born:date('1941-01-01'), name:"Asrani", bio:"Govardhan Asrani (born 1 January 1941 in Jaipur, India), popularly known simply as Asrani, is an actor in Indian films whose Bollywood career has spanned over 35 years. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Govardhan Asrani, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/aIhEIEVknm6feIlgkUwh2QILOjm.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/86019"}}, {tmdbId:"77240", properties:{imdbId:"1836657", name:"Gurpreet Ghuggi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/77240"}}, {tmdbId:"42752", properties:{imdbId:"1171457", name:"Greg Heffernan", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/42752"}}, {tmdbId:"928906", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"1628115", born:date('1979-07-26'), name:"Juliet Rylance", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bN0cZI8DTETIBlYn0bPG3og8u7f.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/928906"}}, {tmdbId:"17874", properties:{bornIn:"Sheffield, Alabama, U.S.", imdbId:"0000669", born:date('1942-08-19'), name:"Fred Dalton Thompson", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nFred Dalton Thompson (born Freddie Dalton Thompson; August 19, 1942), is an American politician, actor, attorney, lobbyist, columnist, and radio host.  He served as a Republican U. S.  Senator from Tennessee from 1994 through 2003.  Thompson served as chairman of the International Security Advisory Board at the United States Department of State, was a member of the U. S...", died:date('2015-11-01'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gbLMnIYGEJabcCAOmlZYPF4eWKQ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17874"}}, {tmdbId:"104632", properties:{bornIn:"Maarheeze, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands", imdbId:"1679778", born:date('1983-06-01'), name:"Sylvia Hoeks", bio:"Sylvia Hoeks was born in Maarheeze, a southern town of the Netherlands.  At age 14 she was scouted by Elite Models and traveled to many European countries to model.  \n\nAfter graduation, she made her national breakthrough with the Jos Stelling film Duska (2007), for which she won a Golden Calf (the Dutch equivalent of the Oscars) at the annual Dutch Film Festival.  Hoeks is more know for her roles on The Best Offer (2013), Renegades (2017), and Blade Runner 2049 (2017)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wKC9LgqgJRCXuzs1kUKaK7Uicv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/104632"}}, {tmdbId:"165424", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"0764527", born:date('1970-11-15'), name:"Danny Sapani", bio:"Danny Sapani is a British-Ghanaian actor.  He is best known for appearing in Misfits, Doctor Who, Penny Dreadful, The Crown, Star Wars: The Last Jedi and Black Panther...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/h6goTpKA74Z6ePB2BAEEyQnGtCF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/165424"}}, {tmdbId:"543505", properties:{bornIn:"Evanston, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"2159926", born:date('1978-05-28'), name:"Jake Johnson", bio:"Jake Johnson (born May 28, 1978) is an American actor and comedian.  He is best known for his role as Nick Miller on the Fox television sitcom New Girl (2011-2018)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nUfiDAafxbxIqmjbZf0oEcmh3kn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/543505"}}, {tmdbId:"19961", properties:{bornIn:"Sofia, Bulgaria", imdbId:"2400045", born:date('1989-01-09'), name:"Nina Dobrev", bio:"Nikolina Konstantinova Dobreva (born January 9, 1989), better known as Nina Dobrev, is a Canadian actress.  Her first acting role was of Mia Jones in the drama series Degrassi: The Next Generation.  She later became known for portraying Elena Gilbert on The CW's supernatural drama series The Vampire Diaries. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Nina Dobrev, licensed under CC-BY-SA,full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rB4JxURDsU7OUNQ3UjVR45A0iM4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/19961"}}, {tmdbId:"1191080", properties:{imdbId:"4472634", name:"Bob Adcock", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1191080"}}, {tmdbId:"1191081", properties:{imdbId:"2480113", name:"Tony Allen", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1191081"}}] AS row
