 1996) is an American actor.  Sheridan made his feature film debut in Terrence Malick's experimental drama film The Tree of Life (2011) and had his first leading role in the coming-of-age film Mud (2012).  He co-starred in the drama Joe (2013).  In 2015, he starred in the drama The Stanford Prison Experiment.  Sheridan will play the role of the young Cyclops in the 2016 film X-Men: Apocalypse...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/d5ZS2fjqC98cIGkhEGX0fRYhku4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1034681"}}, {tmdbId:"1171570", properties:{bornIn:"Briggsville, Arkansas, USA", imdbId:"5015107", born:date('1996-07-30'), name:"Jacob Lofland", bio:"Jacob Seth Lofland (born July 30, 1996) is an American actor best known for his role as Neckbone in the film Mud and for his role as Aris in Maze Runner: The Scorch Trials...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ySPC4kcpxGxuV3HVcAXSmvh6Czn.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1171570"}}, {tmdbId:"141034", properties:{bornIn:"Woodhaven, New York, USA", imdbId:"2915105", born:date('1985-04-20'), name:"Billy Magnussen", bio:"William Gregory Magnussen (born April 20, 1985) is an American actor and comedian of stage, television, and film.  He is best known for roles in Into the Woods (2014), Birth of the Dragon (2016), Game Night (2018), and Aladdin (2019)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tJGGtQxth8JJuKxmhyFNwWxktx3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/141034"}}, {tmdbId:"1137823", properties:{bornIn:"Paris, France", imdbId:"5237479", born:date('1991-01-01'), name:"Stacy Martin", bio:"Stacy Martin is known for her work on Nymphomaniac: Vol.  I(2013), Nymphomaniac: Vol.  II (2013) and Winter (2013)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2eRIvurxaDFKqC9BzAAiYhJp90Z.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1137823"}}, {tmdbId:"1014932", properties:{bornIn:"Basingstoke - Hampshire - England", imdbId:"3538539", born:date('1989-04-08'), name:"Gabriella Wilde", bio:"Gabriella Zanna Vanessa Anstruther-Gough-Calthorpe, better known by her stage name Gabriella Wilde or Gabriella Calthorpe, is an English model and actress best known for her roles in The Three Musketeers (2011) and Carrie (2013). \n\nWilde was born in Basingstoke, Hampshire, U. K.  She is descended from the aristocratic Gough-Calthorpe family...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4ElIAtrcM1kY1ieWgH9T3dUUBA6.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1014932"}}, {tmdbId:"1052102", properties:{imdbId:"2084774", name:"Jonathan Blow", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1052102"}}, {tmdbId:"1052103", properties:{imdbId:"4623544", name:"Phil Fish", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1052103"}}, {tmdbId:"1052104", properties:{bornIn:"Santa Cruz, California, USA", imdbId:"4227158", born:date('1980-03-02'), name:"Edmund McMillen", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/tVaPzwHtRlHOelOIyiKewH2yzMy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1052104"}}, {tmdbId:"1052105", properties:{imdbId:"4226452", name:"Tommy Refenes", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1052105"}}, {tmdbId:"72255", properties:{bornIn:"Bordeaux, France", imdbId:"2072818", born:date('1980-04-25'), name:"Céline Sallette", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/owCiadHTGrXilOb1GEWgFnJ8jZ3.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/72255"}}, {tmdbId:"1030513", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"4425051", born:date('1992-04-24'), name:"Jack Quaid", bio:"Jack Henry Quaid (born April 24, 1992) is an American actor.  The son of actors Dennis Quaid and Meg Ryan, he is best known for playing Marvel in the science fiction film The Hunger Games and for his leading role as a vigilante in the Prime Video superhero series The Boys...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/1BRiWg8oMkxqxH4YfEqpZCbWfFC.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1030513"}}, {tmdbId:"1382356", properties:{imdbId:"1193262", name:"Taylor St. Clair", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1382356"}}, {tmdbId:"1106964", properties:{bornIn:"Antwerpen, Flanders, Belgium", imdbId:"0082052", born:date('1966-12-28'), name:"Jan Bijvoet", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/AikC5XnHsjNza1BuxVclTQKMIzd.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1106964"}}] AS row
