eekend Update and the Late Show with David Letterman.  He has portrayed characters in two NBC shows, Undercovers and Parks and Recreation, made guest appearances in comedy sketches for CollegeHumor, and starred in the 2011 film Peep World.  He has also been hired to write a remake of the 1991 comedy Soapdish...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5vV52TSEIhe4ZZLWwv3i7nfv8we.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/222121"}}, {tmdbId:"20644", properties:{bornIn:"Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", imdbId:"0541902", born:date('1966-03-05'), name:"Aasif Mandvi", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.  Aasif Hakim Mandviwala  (born March 5, 1966), known professionally as Aasif Mandvi  , is an Indian-American actor and comedian.  He began appearing as an occasional contributing correspondent on The Daily Show on August 9, 2006.  On March 12, 2007, he was promoted to a regular correspondent.  Description above from the Wikipedia article Aasif Mandvi, licensed under CC-BY-SA,full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sMxD5GKEfVgEhqav2mcgtO8g3M.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20644"}}] AS row
