for candidates for a martial arts-themed Nickelodeon series, Supah Ninjas (2011).  He was cast as Mike Fukanaga on the show, which ran from 2011 to 2013...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3Hdip1zNYrea3V7uzJQYxTps5Ne.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/515510"}}, {tmdbId:"82093", properties:{bornIn:"Carson City, Michigan, USA", imdbId:"2024644", born:date('1979-11-28'), name:"Daniel Henney", bio:"Daniel Henney was born in Carson City, Michigan, to a Korean adoptee mother and Philip Henney, his American father of Irish descent.  Daniel Henney started modeling in the U. S.  in 2001 and worked in France, Italy, Hong Kong and Taiwan while attending college...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wwLWCVSP9la3dG6xQBqUd1YzwMh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/82093"}}, {tmdbId:"159386", properties:{bornIn:" Reno, Nevada, USA", imdbId:"1119340", born:date('1977-02-18'), name:"Kristoffer Polaha", bio:"Kristoffer Polaha is an actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/u7SIxQzDwzU1av7tJoHG62NzN1Y.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/159386"}}, {tmdbId:"80289", properties:{imdbId:"0272474", born:date('1974-07-25'), name:"Jay R. Ferguson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/80289"}}, {tmdbId:"228372", properties:{imdbId:"2883828", name:"Conrad Kemp", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/228372"}}, {tmdbId:"1353810", properties:{imdbId:"4125416", name:"Inge Beckmann", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4r8dWbb1UGaJA2XpqoOcWM4rDIB.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1353810"}}, {tmdbId:"584818", properties:{bornIn:"Kolkata, India", imdbId:"3194282", born:date('1985-05-03'), name:"Pooja Chopra", bio:"Pooja Chopra is an Indian model and film actress.  In 2009, she was  crowned as the Femina Miss India.  She was also a semifinalist at Miss  World and won the Beauty With A Purpose award at Miss World 2009 in  Johannesburg, South Africa...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/584818"}}, {tmdbId:"1731619", properties:{imdbId:"5065249", name:"Marc Robinson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1731619"}}, {tmdbId:"1298853", properties:{imdbId:"4664662", name:"Ankita Shorey", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1298853"}}, {tmdbId:"1298854", properties:{bornIn:"Jaipur, Rajasthan, India", imdbId:"5065283", name:"Ruhi Singh", bio:"Ruhi Dilip Singh is an Indian actress, model and former Miss India.  Ruhi made her Bollywood debut with Madhur Bhandarkar's drama film Calendar Girls. ...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1298854"}}, {tmdbId:"1153105", properties:{bornIn:"Riyad, Arabia Saudita", imdbId:"5179673", born:date('1987-02-20'), name:"Reem Abdullah", bio:"Reem Abdullah (born February 20, 1987) is the most well known actresses in Saudi Arabia.  Coming from a traditional background, and having lived her entire life in Saudi Arabia, she is praised as one of the few Saudi actresses to challenge the strictly private role of women and go on to become the Kingdom's foremost star...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1153105"}}] AS row
