C series Turn: Washington's Spies...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/213202"}}, {tmdbId:"1254583", properties:{bornIn:"Belfast - Northern Ireland - UK", imdbId:"1946193", born:date('1982-05-01'), name:"Jamie Dornan", bio:"James Dornan (born 1 May 1982) is an Irish actor, model, and musician.  He played Axel von Fersen in Sofia Coppola's film Marie Antoinette (2006), Sheriff Graham Humbert in the ABC series Once Upon a Time, serial killer Paul Spector in the BBC Two and RTÉ One crime drama series The Fall, and Christian Grey in the Fifty Shades franchise (2015-). \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jamie Dornan licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n4vK7CuElT0YIQi93nTgk3LsYW0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1254583"}}, {tmdbId:"222130", properties:{bornIn:"Olympia, Washington, United States", imdbId:"3037833", born:date('1986-09-24'), name:"Eloise Mumford", bio:"Eloise Mumford is an American actress known for her roles on the television series Lone Star, The River and the Fifty Shades of Grey films...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ssWFOwKNTHSnejpFsk5K0ZTlFVV.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/222130"}}, {tmdbId:"220573", properties:{bornIn:"\tLos Angeles, California, United States", imdbId:"2611074", born:date('1985-04-27'), name:"Sheila Vand", bio:"An actress, known for A Girl Walks Home Alone at Night (2014), Argo (2012) and We the Animals (2018).  Grew up in Palo Alto, and is a second generation Iranian-American of Persian descent...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/zJ527qgVYG8pJ7JEUmTPq57ueYD.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/220573"}}, {tmdbId:"1289605", properties:{bornIn:"Tehrān, Irān", imdbId:"4256281", born:date('1984-07-28'), name:"Arash Marandi", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2t0oSf4RHIiG2XlLqaSKBvMiRwx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1289605"}}, {tmdbI