, 1992) is an American teen actor, who made his major debut as the role of Chowder in the 2006 Oscar-nominated computer-animated film, Monster House.  Lerner also played a lead role in the feature film Envy as the son of Ben Stiller and Rachel Weisz.  Lerner was a series regular on the Brett Ratner-directed \"Untitled Diamond-Weissman pilot\" for CBS-TV, playing the son of John Leguizamo and Claire Forlani...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57191"}}, {tmdbId:"76412", properties:{imdbId:"1570766", born:date('1982-01-05'), name:"Allen Evangelista", bio:"With numerous commercials under his belt, including spots for American Online, MTV, Time Warner Cable and Domino's, Allen Evangelista is a promising up-and-comer.  Evangelista was offered a holding agreement to possibly star in a Fox series.  Since then he has co-starred on ABC's \"Once and Again\" and \"Alias\", shot a lead role in \"Mozart and the Whale\" with Josh Hartnett \"...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/76412"}}, {tmdbId:"1026947", properties:{bornIn:"Dominican Republic", imdbId:"4745601", born:date('1982-01-01'), name:"Dascha Polanco", bio:"Dascha Polanco is a Dominican American actress best known for playing the character Dayanara Diaz on Orange Is the New Black...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bIIjxz1EKZEtHeGjju82FkObyl2.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1026947"}}, {tmdbId:"2016486", properties:{bornIn:"New Orleans, Louisiana, USA", imdbId:"1661252", born:date('1986-01-02'), name:"Trombone Shorty", bio:"Troy Michael Andrews was a 4-year-old boy when he first-handed a trombone.  That young player emulated the musicians he heard playing in the “second line” parades, most notably his older brother James, a skilled performer in his own right.  Young Troy was so small, and his instrument was twice his size, that he earned the nickname “Trombone Shorty”.  Over the years, he listened attentively to his elders who educated him on the New Orlean’s deeply-rooted musical traditions...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iVf6HqwpxF6uOsIB82MVJv4Z55Z.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2016486"}}, {tmdbId:"1393185", properties:{imdbId:"6843974", name:"Rebecca Bloom", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1393185"}}, {tmdbId:"1393186", properties:{imdbId:"5975858", name:"Anastasia Bredikhina", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1393186"}}, {tmdbId:"1256036", properties:{bornIn:"La Jolla, California, USA", imdbId:"4941145", born:date('2004-06-08'), name:"Francesca Capaldi", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2zmXWPD3F7zHYSwDq4z71NPV3V1.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1256036"}}, {tmdbId:"1883806", properties:{name:"Brendan Kerkvliet", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9dc33FNvRvIlsh5ddK6NzbsZxPG.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1883806"}}, {tmdbId:"973054", properties:{imdbId:"0638445", born:date('1949-08-22'), name:"Diana Nyad", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/973054"}}, {tmdbId:"1186840", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA ", imdbId:"3606106", born:date('2004-06-15'), name:"Sterling Jerins", bio:"Actress / Performer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/10kkqqbO8Ct58DqsBPSQIsG9ve4.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1186840"}}, {tmdbId:"81697", properties:{bornIn:"Harvey, Illinois, U.S.", imdbId:"1734700", born:date('1977-11-30'), name:"Nelsan Ellis", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nNelsan Ellis (born c.  1978) was an award-winning American film and television actor and playwright, perhaps best known as Lafayette Reynolds on HBO's True Blood. \n\nHe died on July 8, 2017, in Los Angeles, California, from complications with heart failure at the age of 39. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Nelsan Ellis, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", died:date('2017-07-08'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3Gj3yu4DVxml3tHt1SfWx2ck3Yi.jpg", url:"https: