” as the lead in STARRY EYES -- a Cronenberg-esque psychological thriller that has made a lot of waves since it’s debut at SXSW.  Alex has also appeared in various independent features, and television shows including HOUSE OF LIES, CALIFORNICATION, and CRASH...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/8J7iwekeItLdUWvePkZe3gu9Qrp.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/210454"}}, {tmdbId:"133401", properties:{bornIn:"Sacramento, California, USA", imdbId:"0298168", born:date('1984-08-27'), name:"Amanda Fuller", bio:"Amanda Fuller is an actress and producer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qcHUjvcQJ1DhFBzuOEcWbSP1iN5.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/133401"}}, {tmdbId:"576223", properties:{bornIn:"Kansas City, Missouri, USA", imdbId:"4211652", born:date('1988-08-20'), name:"Fabianne Therese", bio:"Fabianne Therese (born Fabianne Therese Gstottenmayr) is a Sri-Lankan and Austrian-American actress known for starring in several successful independent films including Netflix's \"Teenage Cocktail, John Dies at the End (2012)[2] opposite Paul Giamatti, Anchor Bay's The Aggression Scale (2012),[3] A Glimpse Inside the Mind of Charles Swan III (2013)[4] opposite Charlie Sheen, and the AMC series The Trivial Pursuits of Arthur Banks (2011)[5] opposite Adam Goldberg...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/576223"}}, {tmdbId:"1504792", properties:{imdbId:"6244464", name:"Adrian Quinton", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1504792"}}, {tmdbId:"1499833", properties:{imdbId:"5956650", name:"Jonno Davies", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1499833"}}, {tmdbId:"212604", properties:{bornIn:"Waterloo, Iowa, USA", imdbId:"2796745", born:date('1983-11-07'), name:"Adam DeVine", bio:"Adam Devine was born on November 6, 1983 in Waterloo, Iowa, USA as Adam Patrick DeVine.  He is an actor and writer, known for Pitch Perfect 2 (2015), The Intern (2015) and Pitch Perfect (2012)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/i1C5lo0nUoXFbADAUidvL8BPmlM.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/212604"}}, {tmdbId:"224167", properties:{bornIn:"New York, New York City, USA", imdbId:"3115493", born:date('1990-02-08'), name:"Ben Schnetzer", bio:"Ben Schnetzer is an American actor.  He is the son of actors Stephen Schnetzer and Nancy Snyder.   Schnetzer was born and raised in New York City.  He is a graduate of the Guildhall School of Music and Drama in London.  In 2010, Schnetzer appeared in an episode of Law &amp; Order and co-starred on the series Happy Town.  He played Max Vandenburg in the film adaptation of The Book Thief (2013)...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/drpFFDyWj2jeoX5I1D1WhUfcCCx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/224167"}}, {tmdbId:"59261", properties:{bornIn:"Santa Monica, California, USA", imdbId:"2000954", born:date('1993-04-13'), name:"Hannah Marks", bio:"Hannah Gayle Marks (born April 13, 1993) is an American television and film actress.  She currently stars on Dirk Gently's Holistic Detective Agency...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/dl0u5tAu5aT1iwEd5wX5NoGq6BJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/59261"}}, {tmdbId:"1316322", properties:{imdbId:"5625871", name:"Zsófia Psotta", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1316322"}}, {tmdbId:"1093080", properties:{bornIn:"Budapest, Hungary", imdbId:"0958192", born:date('1961-06-20'), name:"Sándor Zsótér", bio:"Sándor Zsótér was born on June 20, 1961 in Budapest, Hungary.  He is an actor and writer, known for White God (2014), El hijo de Saúl (2015) and Isteni müszak (2013)...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1093080"}}, {tmdbId:"1316323", properties:{imdbId:"2520336", name:"Lili Horváth", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1316323"}}, {tmdbId:"209200", properties:{bornIn:"Uppsala, Uppsala län, Sweden", imdbId:"2032150", born:date('1984-08-03'), name:"Emily Baldoni", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sD9hNQyHictfBhUncmsu8m1Qqov.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/209200"}}, {tmdbId:"65726", properties:{bornIn:"Mill Valley, California, USA", imdbId:"0827561", born:date('1971-09-01'), name:"Maury Sterling", bio:"Maury Sterling  is an actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eROVUEyH5IrnIzotiHiGtvploox.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/65726"}}, {tmdbId:"71675", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0107183", born:date('1971-04-12'), name:"Nicholas Brendon", bio:"Nicholas Brendon (born April 12, 197), is an actor best known for his character Xander Harris on  Buffy the Vampire Slayer...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2mxlAhmnBrkwGJ3A1ty2iQhmnYj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/71675"}}] AS row
