dWilliam Zappa, and in short films such as Akiva (2010) and Great Adventures (2012).  He played General Philbrick as a Child, in one episode of Terra Nova TV series...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n7yuMduWZpBuKHjW25X9G2miTKl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1313583"}}, {tmdbId:"2441528", properties:{name:"Freddie Crowder", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ecpg5RyxYMl0xHXZiqPrNS2CmC5.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2441528"}}, {tmdbId:"2441531", properties:{name:"Jon-Jon Lockwood", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2441531"}}, {tmdbId:"1216876", properties:{bornIn:"Chicago, Illinois, USA", imdbId:"0057363", born:date('1931-05-23'), name:"Barbara Barrie", bio:"Barbara Barrie (born Barbara Ann Berman, May 23, 1931) is an American actress of film, stage and television.  She is also an accomplished author. \n\nHer film breakthrough came in 1964 with her performance as Julie in the landmark film One Potato, Two Potato, for which she won the Best Actress Award at the Cannes Film Festival...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yctf2hcVhhc7gqP8fIfjviUEgSk.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1216876"}}, {tmdbId:"1473015", properties:{imdbId:"0105493", name:"Charles Braswell", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1473015"}}, {tmdbId:"1211979", properties:{bornIn:"Baldwin, Long Island, New York, USA", imdbId:"0115215", born:date('1941-02-25'), name:"Susan Browning", died:date('2006-04-23'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6Pb9j26ftbrwSBCjn5cGxgFufRS.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1211979"}}, {tmdbId:"1121169", properties:{bornIn:"Paris, France", imdbId:"3840725", born:date('1990-09-24'), name:"Izïa Higelin", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/bHt0lK9qNQLXhwRSYfp8Yt6i0kb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1121169"}}, {tmdbId:"129467", properties:{imdbId:"0254681", name:"Dock Ellis", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/129467"}}, {tmdbId:"586951", properties:{bornIn:"Wellington, New Zealand", imdbId:"1591353", born:date('1970-04-25'), name:"Jonny Brugh", bio:"Jonny Brugh is a film and television actor from New Zealand...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5iKh2jMEsx83z4Gz4pDA8deRRux.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/586951"}}, {tmdbId:"1286794", properties:{bornIn:"Santiago, Chile", imdbId:"1129962", name:"Cori Gonzalez-Macuer", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/Am1iRgnClQ51bH3BCZ8TXKUYdCT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1286794"}}, {tmdbId:"1170462", properties:{imdbId:"0212423", name:"Tom Dewispelaere", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1170462"}}, {tmdbId:"147296", properties:{bornIn:"Soest - Utrecht - Netherlands", imdbId:"0469083", born:date('1975-08-05'), name:"Maria Kraakman", bio:"Maria Kraakman (Soest, 5 augustus 1975) is een Nederlands actrice, in 1998 afgestudeerd aan de Arnhemse Toneelschool en nu werkend als vaste actrice bij Toneelgroep Oostpool.   In 2005 won zij een Gouden Kalf voor haar verstilde rol in de film Guernseyvan Nanouk Leopold.  Eerder was zij te zien in Leopolds Îles flottantes (2001) en in enkele korte televisiefilms en toneelstukken, zoals Eline Vere, waarbij ze was genomineerd voor beste vrouwelijke toneelactrice...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sj2sAUPUXemReqTwtAw9XbQ2dNv.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/147296"}}, {tmdbId:"1891694", properties:{name:"Jim Swanson", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1891694"}}, {tmdbId:"59296", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"0022161", born:date('1978-09-22'), name:"Daniella Alonso", bio:"Daniella Alonso is an American actress known for her guest appearances as Anna Taggaro on One Tree Hill and her lead roles in The Hills Have Eyes 2 and Wrong Turn 2: Dead End...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wdmd0dtK7pnEZXOcSstrVHDeJHd.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/59296"}}, {tmdbId:"1203436", properties:{imdbId:"0009008", name:"Jacqueline Abrahams", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1203436"}}, {tmdbId:"20243", properties:{bornIn:"Hertfordshire, England, United Kingdom", imdbId:"0004355", born:date('1957-01-19'), name:"Roger Ashton-Griffiths", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nRoger Ashton-Griffiths (born January 19, 1957) is a British character actor, screenwriter and film director. \n\nHe graduated from Lancaster University (BMus) and the University of East London (MA Fine Art), and began his career as a singer with English National Opera at the London Coliseum...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/fwVK6FD82EANGLXlAu8ulXZB86q.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20243"}}] AS row
