an American actor and comedian best known for starring in the Comedy Central sketch series Key & Peele and for his six seasons as a cast member on MADtv. \n\nEarly life Key was born in Southfield, Michigan and raised in Detroit.  His father is African-American and his mother is European-American.  He was adopted as a child.  In 1989 he graduated from Shrine Catholic High School in Royal Oak, Michigan...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vAR5gVXRG2Cl6WskXT99wgkAoH8.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/298410"}}, {tmdbId:"1452969", properties:{imdbId:"2788786", name:"Michael Borne", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1452969"}}, {tmdbId:"1117034", properties:{imdbId:"3517154", name:"Julia Pott", bio:"Julia Pott is a British Animation Director living in Brooklyn, NY...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/mYDVD3kze9CzvfCubcBh09z2TYY.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1117034"}}, {tmdbId:"1386409", properties:{imdbId:"6888393", name:"Winona Mae", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1386409"}}, {tmdbId:"1331652", properties:{bornIn:"Houston, Texas, USA", imdbId:"2798112", born:date('1981-11-18'), name:"Allison Tolman", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iVe6jpSOYLn4NVb8jt2K4TXPDjy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1331652"}}, {tmdbId:"1419822", properties:{bornIn:"Ankara, Türkiye", imdbId:"5561251", born:date('1985-11-22'), name:"Hande Dogandemir", bio:"Turkish actress, TV host and sociologist.  She is best known for her role as Zeynep Yılmaz Sayer on Kanal D series Güneşi Beklerken.  Doğandemir, also known as \"Şans\" in the surreal comedy show Leyla ile Mecnun and Elem in Şubat.  She graduated from Ankara University, Depertment of Sociology.  In her senior year in university, she went Lille, France withERASMUS programme.  She speaks French and English fluently...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sDjBgmGxtS17aZnYLeQYWLVxKlk.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1419822"}}, {tmdbId:"1254540", properties:{bornIn:"Ankara, Turkey", imdbId:"4245240", born:date('1988-01-01'), name:"Fatih Artman", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pTDZvCBIHp8nZZxSxbsNJsZe4rE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1254540"}}, {tmdbId:"1258397", properties:{imdbId:"4873935", name:"Sadi Celil Cengiz", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/spOESN6rFzW3jSso430Y002dIGz.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1258397"}}, {tmdbId:"1425019", properties:{bornIn:"Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain", imdbId:"4663937", born:date('1985-02-18'), name:"Laia Costa", bio:"Laia Costa is a Catalan film and television actress, best known for playing the title role in the one-take feature film Victoria, for which she became the first foreign actress to win a Lola, the biggest award by German Academy of Cinema.  She also won Best Actress at the Gaudí Awards by the Catalan Academy of Cinema, and was nominated for Best European Actress in the European Film Awards...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/i1L1tb5a8bdea4Zx0mAj260Fpde.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1425019"}}, {tmdbId:"1285450", properties:{bornIn:"Freiburg im Breisgau, Germany", imdbId:"4453291", born:date('1986-02-02'), name:"Franz Rogowski", bio:"Franz Rogowski (born 2 February 1986) is a German actor and dancer...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1285450"}}, {tmdbId:"520561", properties:{bornIn:"Berlin, Germany", imdbId:"2916919", born:date('1986-01-01'), name:"Burak Yigit", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/s1RMy26sdIC7OuNq8BTqFXYxfkT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/520561"}}, {tmdbId:"1186713", properties:{imdbId:"0580290", name:"Matt Mercer", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/neiq6E2HdSKFdnqsIjsckZEbz0d.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1186713"}}, {tmdbId:"77775", properties:{bornIn:"Glasgow, Scotland", imdbId:"0657734", born:date('1981-09-07'), name:"Marianna Palka", bio:"Marianna Palka is the Scottish-born screenwriter, director and co-star of the film Good Dick. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Marianna Palka, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/eKoaLx0P81SuQu8toLIO3O0IwDr.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/77775"}}, {tmdbId:"583456", properties:{imdbId:"2284726", name:"Morgan Peter Brown", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/583456"}}, {tmdbId:"1441215", properties:{imdbId:"4741273", born:date('1993-03-15'), name:"Anna Lore", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1441215"}}] AS row
