ision with much success.  In 1982, she became the first recipient of the Hong Kong Film Award for Best Actress...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6OV9kM62Y7M7EswtkpCThs0QAxg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84205"}}, {tmdbId:"4532", properties:{bornIn:"Paris,France", imdbId:"0479608", born:date('1971-10-18'), name:"Emmanuelle Laborit", bio:"Emmanuelle Laborit est une comédienne française, née le18 octobre 1971 dans le 14e arrondissement de Paris.   Récompensée du Molière de la révélation théâtrale dans Les Enfants du silence en 1993, elle passe plus de temps en tant que directrice de l'International Visual Théâtre...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/68yh10vEmhO9Bh0wxVqWgyxxquF.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/4532"}}, {tmdbId:"20042", properties:{imdbId:"1197279", name:"Jérôme Horry", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/20042"}}, {tmdbId:"86128", properties:{bornIn:"Long Beach, California, USA", imdbId:"0250743", born:date('1970-02-18'), name:"Susan Egan", bio:"Susan Egan (born February 18, 1970) is an American actress and singer known for her work on the Broadway stage. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Susan Egan, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/kJnBjeUAQqc9LbPaoqs1khGedUi.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/86128"}}, {tmdbId:"85240", properties:{imdbId:"0961737", born:date('1980-07-20'), name:"Gracy Singh", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/w9bTU3WM0MkZgylVNBCulx3PNat.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85240"}}, {tmdbId:"80385", properties:{bornIn:"Swindon, England", imdbId:"0791226", born:date('1969-08-25'), name:"Rachel Shelley", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   Rachel Shelley (born on 25 August 1969) is an English actress and model.  She was born in Swindon and graduated from Sheffield University with a B. A.  Hons in English and Drama. \n\nShe played Elizabeth Russell in the Indian Hindi film Lagaan and Helena Peabody on the television show The L Word. \n\nShelley lives in Notting Hill, grew up in London and moved from Swindon at age one...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/80385"}}, {tmdbId:"43231", properties:{bornIn:"Wellington, Shropshire, England", imdbId:"0085860", born:date('1969-03-05'), name:"Paul Blackthorne", bio:"Accomplished British actor Paul Blackthorne returned to primetime TV fall 2012 as determined Detective Quentin Lance on the CW’s hit series ‘Arrow’.   This role follows that of manipulative reality show producer Clark Quietly in ABC’s paranormal thriller ‘The River’.  Recently he has also appeared opposite Ted Danson in ‘CSI’ and Callie Thorne in ‘Necessary Roughness’. \n\nBlackthorne was born in Shropshire, England, 1969...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3OC1M0rKJO8B3JpwAeavk5EAscl.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/43231"}}, {tmdbId:"38280", properties:{bornIn:"Hangzhou, Zhejiang, People's Republic of China", imdbId:"2325018", born:date('1979-10-07'), name:"Tang Wei", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nTang Wei (simplified Chinese: 汤唯; traditional Chinese: 湯唯; pinyin: Tāng Wéi) (born October 7, 1979) is a Chinese actress.  She rose to prominence for her appearance in Lust, Caution. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Tang Wei, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/pXBCiu7mVEnrnDpIRc5cyyg1wPK.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/38280"}}, {tmdbId:"120680", properties:{imdbId:"0947721", born:date('1976-03-26'), name:"Nurgül Yeşilçay", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/WWe468NhEKleVWliGjmqeQvFo0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/120680"}}, {tmdbId:"142527", properties:{bornIn:"Boston, Massachusetts, USA", imdbId:"0173160", born:date('1904-09-17'), name:"Jerry Colonna", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nGerardo Luigi \"Jerry\" Colonna (September 17, 1904 – November 22, 1986) was an American musician, actor, comedian, singer, songwriter and trombonist best remembered as the zaniest of Bob Hope's sidekicks in Hope's popular radio shows and films of the 1940s and 1950s...", died:date('1986-11-21'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/7nrcJUXrjgPcwMehAiLCgKdFN7Y.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/142527"}}, {tmdbId:"85519", properties:{bornIn:"Jamshedpur, Jharkhand, India", imdbId:"0534856", born:date('1970-06-01'), name:"R. Madhavan", bio:"Madhavan is an Indian actor, writer and film producer.  Madhavan has received two Filmfare Awards, an award from the Tamil Nadu State Film Awards alongside recognition and nominations from other organisations.  He has been described as one of the few actors in India who is able to achieve pan-Indian appeal, appearing in films from seven different languages...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/gaDrAdXxIrbBRCd9cX8YvJDEuLb.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85519"}}, {tmdbId:"17127", properties:{bornIn:"Naju, South Jeolla Province, South Korea", imdbId:"1040396", born:date('1970-12-31'), name:"Jeong Seok-yong", bio:"Jeong Seok-yong (정석용) is a South Korean actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xFmseNweZENv5VdbmcrlYb7R9r7.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/17127"}}, {tmdbId:"86330", properties:{bornIn:"Cheongju, North Chungcheong, South Korea", imdbId:"1045934", born:date('1970-01-03'), name:"Lee Beom-soo", bio:"Lee Beom-soo (이범수) is a South Korean actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3XTGzJTuAXDgkrr5qaMWBjRoEdO.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/86330"}}, {tmdbId:"86664", properties:{imdbId:"0503095", born:date('1926-09-02'), name:"Evgeni Leonov", bio:"Yevgeny P.  Leonov (2 September 1926 – 29 January 1994) was a famous Russian/Soviet actor who played main parts in several of the most famous Soviet films.  Called \"one of Russia's best-loved actors\", he also provided the voice for many Soviet cartoon characters, including Winnie-the-Pooh...", died:date('1994-01-29'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/9r1p4ZQoCSdkOmyclt6xj3E2kWo.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/86664"}}, {tmdbId:"1444473", properties:{imdbId:"0338616", name:"Joshua Greenblatt", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1444473"}}] AS row
