as one of the fathers of modern linguistics.  Since the 1960s, he has become known more widely as a political dissident and an anarchist...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/yjpzdiWTGWZMf5RgHYtiJFojwaz.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116488"}}, {tmdbId:"553220", properties:{imdbId:"0379122", name:"Edward S. Herman", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/553220"}}, {tmdbId:"230181", properties:{imdbId:"3752357", name:"Lancelot Perrin", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/230181"}}, {tmdbId:"1771086", properties:{name:"Yuna Shin", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1771086"}}, {tmdbId:"1076615", properties:{bornIn:"Gwangju, South Korea", imdbId:"0158804", born:date('1928-11-20'), name:"Eun-hie Choi", bio:"Choi Eun-hee (Hangul: 최은희; November 20, 1926 – April 16, 2018) was a South Korean actress, who was one of the country's most popular stars of the 1960s and 1970s.  In 1978, Choi and her then ex-husband, movie director Shin Sang-ok, were abducted to North Korea, where they were forced to make films until they sought asylum at the U. S.  embassy in Vienna in 1986.  They returned to South Korea in 1999 after spending a decade in the United States...", died:date('2018-04-16'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wQzLRtnuhaUO9p4nqjDbumc50GH.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1076615"}}, {tmdbId:"2052043", properties:{name:"Michael Yi", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/2052043"}}, {tmdbId:"220753", properties:{bornIn:"High Wycombe, Buckinghamshire, England, UK", imdbId:"0733919", born:date('1978-03-18'), name:"Charlotte Roche", bio:"Charlotte Elisabeth Grace Roche is a British-German television presenter, producer, actress and author...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/sU0CLa9x32fli3FKPGmyt6BU50c.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/220753"}}, {tmdbId:"18051", properties:{bornIn:"Bremen, Germany", imdbId:"0953220", born:date('1942-10-02'), name:"Manfred Zapatka", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/18051"}}, {tmdbId:"1520857", properties:{imdbId:"0796166", born:date('1976-02-06'), name:"Beau Sia", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1520857"}}, {tmdbId:"146097", properties:{bornIn:"Wendeng, Shandong, China", imdbId:"0508349", born:date('1946-11-28'), name:"Li Baotian", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nKIGAk9nQkhWCN2cI2U0Kl26bw0.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/146097"}}, {tmdbId:"125572", properties:{bornIn:"Beijing, China", imdbId:"0514988", born:date('1958-01-01'), name:"Liu Peiqi", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nLiu Peiqi is a Chinese actor.  He started his training in 1979 when he joined Military Art School.  He joined Military Drama Group in Xinjiang Province in 1983.  In 1985 he starred in his first movie, Father and Son, directed by Wang Bingling.  After transferring to Beijing Military Drama Group, then the China National Drama Group, Liu starred in Days Without Leifeng, directed by Lei Xianhe...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/qsaBDqBqD1olIQgZMnqNxHTe2uc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/125572"}}, {tmdbId:"120673", properties:{imdbId:"0562642", name:"Katherine Mayfield", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/120673"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"66524", properties:{bornIn:"New York City, New York, USA", imdbId:"1715275", born:date('1984-02-28'), name:"Noureen DeWulf", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nNoureen DeWulf (born February 28, 1984) is an American actress of Indian descent.  She is best known for her roles in films like West Bank Story, Ghosts of Girlfriends Past and The Back-Up Plan. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Noureen DeWulf, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6q1Qee80j3GOib6EVKfYqBu6HS1.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/66524"}}, {tmdbId:"83352", properties:{bornIn:"St. Louis, Missouri, USA", imdbId:"1597260", born:date('1982-03-11'), name:"Mircea Monroe", bio:"Mircea Monroe is an American actress and model.   Monroe was born in St.  Louis, Missouri.  Her apparently exotic \"Mircea\", is in fact a typical and common Romanian male surname.   She moved to the South Pacific when she was 2 months old with her family when her father, a United Nations employee, was transferred.  She attended high school in Virginia and shortly after graduation, headed out west to Los Angeles.  Monroe's first professional acting job was in the New Line film, Cellular...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/vdXwOmhoOzl4cSCIvBjKlO6iS4g.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/83352"}}, {tmdbId:"40275", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles, California, USA", imdbId:"0347375", born:date('1962-11-18'), name:"Tim Guinee", bio:"Tim Guinee (born November 18, 1962) is an American stage, television, and film actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/rS2K7cJx6Vm2buE0HhIUp9tuC1g.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/40275"}}, {tmdbId:"107793", properties:{bornIn:"Santa Monica, California, USA", imdbId:"0424453", born:date('1973-05-12'), name:"Adam Johnson", bio:"Adam Johnson is an actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/oFgiM8x3dGk2AQXI7RKcb6j1J7g.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/107793"}}, {tmdbId:"67889", properties:{imdbId:"0154235", born:date('1960-12-22'), name:"Wakin Chau", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/uQSG3L8h5mc9Qd3wmN8FaIEwOV6.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/67889"}}, {tmdbId:"1084911", properties:{bornIn:"Gifu Prefecture, Japan", imdbId:"1687017", born:date('1982-01-26'), name:"Go Ayano", bio:"Go Ayano (綾野 剛, Ayano Gō, born January 26, 1982) is a Japanese actor...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/Ap5IuncBMYnABsvkEtsdoM92VTh.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1084911"}}, {tmdbId:"230660", properties:{bornIn:" Sydney, Australia", imdbId:"3101617", born:date('1992-12-22'), name:"Shiori Kutsuna", bio:"Shiori Kutsuna, sometimes spelled as Shioli Kutsuna, is a Japanese Australian actress and idol.  She is best known for her role as Ran Mori in Shinichi Kudo's Written Challenge and Minami Maho in BECK...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/AuCKmkbCxzfbuhuFs2fd3C8eib6.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/230660"}}, {tmdbId:"89835", properties:{imdbId:"1783075", name:"Ayumi Fujimura", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/5dRWFu7hfO1rUoZh0hF6rzfEmZc.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/89835"}}, {tmdbId:"9708", properties:{bornIn:"Tokyo - Japan", imdbId:"0297873", born:date('1964-10-05'), name:"Keiji Fujiwara", bio:"is a Japanese voice actor.  His best known works are voicing Shinnosuke's father Hiroshi Nohara in the long-running anime series Crayon Shin-chan, Maes Hughes in Fullmetal Alchemist, Holland in Eureka Seven, Axel in Kingdom Hearts, Shiro Fujimoto in Ao no Exorcist and Esidisi in JoJo's Bizarre Adventure: Battle Tendency.  In the live action field, he is mostly known for dubbing actor Robert Downey Jr.  He founded his own talent management and production company, Air Agency, in 2006...", died:date('2020-04-12'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/cK5cLHWfVnQdREHs7SpsBs4g4EI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/9708"}}, {tmdbId:"57189", properties:{bornIn:"Manhattan Beach, California, USA", imdbId:"1707018", born:date('1998-04-24'), name:"Ryan Whitney Newman", bio:"Ryan Whitney Newman  (born April 24, 1998) is a 2010 Young Artist Award winning young actress, model, and singer.  Newman is most famous for her lead roles as Ginger Falcone in Zeke and Luther and Cindy Collins in Zoom.  Newman, as a child model has participated in many photo shoots such as Inspire Magazine, Kaiya Eve Photoshoots 2009 and Dream Magazine.  Newman not only works in films and television shows, she has also filmed many commercials throughout the year...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/lRHnl2pkwycNYwQRlr1Nh5QUjYE.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/57189"}}, {tmdbId:"237040", properties:{bornIn:"Mumbai, Maharashtra, India", imdbId:"2299825", born:date('1987-11-01'), name:"Ileana D'Cruz", bio:"Ileana D'Cruz  is an Indian film actress, who predominantly appears in South Indian cinema and Bollywood.  \n\nShe won the Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut – South for the 2006 Telugu film Devadasu.  In 2012, she made her Bollywood debut with Anurag Basu's critically and commercially successful Barfi!, for which she received critical appreciation and the Filmfare Award for Best Female Debut. \n\nD'Cruz was born to a Goan Catholic family in Mumbai, and raised partly in Mumbai and partly in Goa...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/ceZGAoQ17iGrlWL9OF3SjaYtceT.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/237040"}}, {tmdbId:"85472", properties:{bornIn:" Delhi, India", imdbId:"1480555", born:date('1977-09-03'), name:"Arjan Bajwa", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nArjan Bajwa ( born 3 September 1977) is an Indian actor who has acted in Telugu &amp; Hindi films.  Arjan is derived from the name of the fifth Sikh Guru – Guru Arjan Dev Ji. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Arjan Bajwa licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/xs3nHpwwc4z46EthrTLJjub5nPs.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/85472"}}, {tmdbId:"1255425", properties:{bornIn:"Rosenheim, Germany", imdbId:"0351425", born:date('1893-01-12'), name:"Hermann Göring", died:date('1946-10-15'), url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1255425"}}, {tmdbId:"550842", properties:{imdbId:"4318587", name:"Aron Hijar", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/550842"}}, {tmdbId:"115305", properties:{bornIn:"Tokyo, Tokyo Prefecture, Japan", imdbId:"0620333", born:date('1951-02-05'), name:"Ryusei Nakao", bio:"Ryusei Nakao, born as Tomoharu Takeo, is a Japanese actor, voice actor, and singer affiliated with 81Produce.  He is often typecasted as odd, cold, twisted, cruel, sadistic, and inhumane characters with wry, slightly high-pitched voices...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3h3HTOUmvRN7BL1095xRu9dnIKy.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/115305"}}, {tmdbId:"121196", properties:{bornIn:"New York, New York, U.S.A.", imdbId:"0411699", born:date('1927-07-12'), name:"Jerry Itô", died:date('2007-07-09'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/3i56XICjQxeVmRuZR9oSBnUq3RW.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/121196"}}, {tmdbId:"122903", properties:{bornIn:"Ann Arbor, Michigan", imdbId:"3786342", born:date('1969-12-25'), name:"Michelle Rhee", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia. \n\nMichelle A.  Rhee (born December 25, 1969) is the former chancellor of the District of Columbia Public Schools system of Washington, D. C. , in the United States.  In 1997 she founded The New Teacher Project (TNTP), which in ten years has recruited 10,000 teachers in twenty states.  She announced her resignation as chancellor on October 13, 2010, effective at the end of the month...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/122903"}}, {tmdbId:"97515", properties:{bornIn:"Charleston, South Carolina", imdbId:"1735854", born:date('1970-02-15'), name:"Shepard Fairey", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nFrank Shepard Fairey (born February 15, 1970) is an American contemporary artist, graphic designer, and illustrator who emerged from the skateboarding scene.  He first became known for his \"André the Giant Has a Posse\" (…OBEY…) sticker campaign, in which he appropriated images from the comedic supermarket tabloid Weekly World News.  His work became more widely known in the 2008 U. S.  presidential election, specifically his Barack Obama \"Hope\" poster...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/97515"}}, {tmdbId:"131830", properties:{bornIn:"France", imdbId:"3836285", name:"Thierry Guetta", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nMr.  Brainwash (\"MBW\") is a pseudonym for Thierry Guetta in the film Exit Through the Gift Shop, directed by Banksy.  Guetta is presented in the 2010 film as a French citizen who now lives in Los Angeles, having been a proprietor of a clothing store and videographer who evolved into a street artist and gallery artist, influenced by the street artists he documented through video over the years...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/131830"}}, {tmdbId:"1632927", properties:{bornIn:"London, England", imdbId:"2914657", born:date('1982-10-11'), name:"Humphrey Ker", bio:"David Humphrey Rivers Ker is an Edinburgh Comedy Award-winning British actor, writer and comedian, formerly of the sketch comedy troupe The Penny Dreadfuls...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/4KILXzLkvRqwgLwB3O4z8QxiLPg.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1632927"}}] AS row
CREATE (n:Person{tmdbId: row.tmdbId}) SET n += row.properties SET n:Actor;
UNWIND [{tmdbId:"1182438", properties:{imdbId:"7707962", name:"Elisabeth Gray", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1182438"}}, {tmdbId:"93643", properties:{bornIn:"Canada ", imdbId:"0358095", name:"Patricia Hamilton", bio:"Ms.  Hamilton Is An Actress, She Attended School In Pennsylvannia, USA...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/93643"}}, {tmdbId:"288940", properties:{bornIn:"Nashville, Tennessee, U.S.", imdbId:"0479164", born:date('1872-11-07'), name:"Lucille La Verne", died:date('1945-03-04'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/6L3j9U9IkxJhatF8ASsO3PtNZUN.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/288940"}}, {tmdbId:"124828", properties:{bornIn:"Bristol, England, UK", imdbId:"2632878", born:date('1985-09-24'), name:"Kimberley Nixon", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nKimberley Nixon (born 24 September 1985) is an English-born Welsh actress. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Kimberley Nixon, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/2O9nFOqv7kmsYIhOY2t1laKvnbx.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/124828"}}, {tmdbId:"21911", properties:{bornIn:"Xindian District, Taiwan", imdbId:"0795517", born:date('1976-04-16'), name:"Shu Qi", bio:"Lin Li-hui, better known by her stage name Shu Qi  (Chinese: 舒淇; pinyin: Shū Qí), is a Taiwanese actress and model.  She has also been credited as Hsu Chi and Shu Kei...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/nqYEYVYPf7XJvH0fQZ8bjTcvPNR.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/21911"}}, {tmdbId:"173065", properties:{born:date('1968-01-20'), name:"Melissa Rivers", bio:"Melissa Warburg Rosenberg (born January 20, 1968), better known as Melissa Rivers, is an American actress, television host and producer.  She is the daughter of the late Joan Rivers and Edgar Rosenberg. \n\n As an actress, she has had roles in television shows including Beverly Hills, 90210, Silk Stalkings, The Comeback.  In 1998, she also appeared in the sci-fi/comedy made-for-television movie Men in White and in the 1999 film The Big Tease, a comedy directed by Kevin Allen starring Craig Ferguson...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/173065"}}, {tmdbId:"89176", properties:{bornIn:"Osaka Prefecture, Japan", imdbId:"0357276", born:date('1939-03-20'), name:"Yuko Hamada", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/iKFuFQzry5Je0xr282NUcQvvqxJ.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/89176"}}, {tmdbId:"84505", properties:{bornIn:"Tokyo, Japan", imdbId:"0386286", born:date('1963-08-07'), name:"Hiroaki Hirata", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/wbirlbjye7mfWkaCm0Jy4b2KAdI.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/84505"}}, {tmdbId:"35053", properties:{bornIn:"Dalat, Vietnam", imdbId:"0243121", born:date('1957-08-27'), name:"Đơn Dương", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.   \n\nDon Duong (born August 27, 1957) is a film actor who had been well known in Vietnam long before his first film was even seen in the United States. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Don Duong (actor), licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", died:date('2011-12-08'), url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/35053"}}, {tmdbId:"35055", properties:{imdbId:"0870878", name:"Manh Cuong Tran", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/35055"}}, {tmdbId:"1158109", properties:{imdbId:"0053739", name:"Blayn Barbosa", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1158109"}}, {tmdbId:"12235", properties:{bornIn:"Szeged, Hungary", imdbId:"0005936", born:date('1930-06-16'), name:"Vilmos Zsigmond", bio:"Vilmos Zsigmond, ASC was a Hungarian-American cinematographer.  His work in cinematography helped shape the look of American movies in the 1970s, making him one of the leading figures in the American New Wave movement...", died:date('2016-01-01'), poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/s7DxsMnx7d4JdlmpaxpMNs7Nnyd.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/12235"}}, {tmdbId:"1888238", properties:{name:"Ji Liu", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1888238"}}, {tmdbId:"933627", properties:{imdbId:"0764308", name:"Zenildo Oliveira Santos", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/933627"}}, {tmdbId:"142274", properties:{name:"Megan Faccio", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/142274"}}, {tmdbId:"556514", properties:{imdbId:"0166612", name:"Clark Clifford", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/556514"}}, {tmdbId:"556515", properties:{imdbId:"0170088", name:"George Coker", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/556515"}}, {tmdbId:"143467", properties:{imdbId:"0662603", name:"Sam Parker", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/143467"}}, {tmdbId:"1001612", properties:{imdbId:"0239941", name:"Jacques Duclos", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1001612"}}, {tmdbId:"1071967", properties:{imdbId:"0249075", name:"Anthony Eden", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/1071967"}}] AS row
