e:"Kantz", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/225967"}}, {tmdbId:"72191", properties:{bornIn:"Bologna, Emilia-Romagna, Italia", imdbId:"0002194", born:date('1938-11-03'), name:"Pupi Avati", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/n5hCr4UP9HMhD9MzMCyKPdQ10kO.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/72191"}}, {tmdbId:"227452", properties:{bornIn:"Dar es Salaam, Tanzania", imdbId:"0774582", born:date('1957-06-24'), name:"Keith Scholey", bio:"Keith Scholey is a British producer of nature documentaries for television and cinema, and a former television executive.  He is currently directing the feature film African Cats for Disneynature, in partnership with Alastair Fothergill.   He is also the executive producer of the series 'North America' for the Discovery Channel...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/227452"}}, {tmdbId:"134639", properties:{bornIn:"London, England, UK", imdbId:"0323795", born:date('1936-02-02'), name:"Jim Goddard", bio:"Jim Goddard is an English film and TV director born in London on February 2nd, 1936. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jim Goddard, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/134639"}}, {tmdbId:"139632", properties:{imdbId:"0402383", born:date('1954-10-07'), name:"Chris Hunt", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/139632"}}, {tmdbId:"227851", properties:{imdbId:"4990509", name:"Jonathan Kahn", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/227851"}}, {tmdbId:"46076", properties:{bornIn:"Hanover, New Hampshire", imdbId:"0223359", born:date('1965-04-14'), name:"Tom Dey", bio:"​From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nThomas Ridgeway \"Tom\" Dey (born 14 April 1965) is an American film director.  His credits include Shanghai Noon, Showtime, Failure to Launch and Marmaduke. \n\nDey was born in Hanover, New Hampshire, the son of Phoebe Ann (née Evans) and Charles Frederick Dey, who was Associate Dean at Dartmouth College from 1963–1973 and headmaster of Choate/Rosemary Hall...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/46076"}}, {tmdbId:"46603", properties:{bornIn:"Los Angeles County, California, USA", imdbId:"0926715", born:date('1927-12-03'), name:"William Wiard", died:date('1987-07-03'), url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/46603"}}, {tmdbId:"937109", properties:{name:"Y.K. Kim", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/937109"}}, {tmdbId:"125738", properties:{bornIn:"Trångsund, Svezia", imdbId:"1174251", born:date('1977-03-23'), name:"Daniel Espinosa", bio:"Jorge Daniel Espinosa (born 23 March 1977) is a Swedish film director from Trångsund, Stockholm of Chilean origin.  He attended the National Film School of Denmark and graduated in 2001.  His third feature film, Easy Money, was the Swedish film with most admissions in Sweden in 2010...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/125738"}}, {tmdbId:"130816", properties:{bornIn:"Cambridge, Massachusetts", imdbId:"0673400", born:date('1968-05-19'), name:"Jesse Peretz", bio:"Jesse Peretz (born May 19, 1968) is an American feature film director, bass guitar player, and Grammy-Award winning music video director. \n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Jesse Peretz, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/130816"}}, {tmdbId:"7406", properties:{bornIn:"Rapid City, South Dakota, United States", imdbId:"0825790", born:date('1959-05-15'), name:"Michael Steinberg", bio:"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nMichael Steinberg (born 15 May 1959) is a director, writer and producer.  He is a graduate of the UCLA School of Theater, Film and Television.  He has directed three films that all premiered at the Sundance Film Festival and has written and/or produced four other award winning features since his debut in 1992.  In addition, Steinberg has written, directed, and/or produced several television projects since 2000...", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/7406"}}, {tmdbId:"12523", properties:{bornIn:"Wichita County - Texas - USA", imdbId:"0101385", born:date('1960-05-15'), name:"Rob Bowman", bio:"Rob Stanton Bowman (born May 15, 1960) is an American film director and producer, perhaps most notable for his work on science fiction series, such as The X-Files and Star Trek: The Next Generation...", poster:"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w440_and_h660_face/k6a9XQHJBYi8hqRnwj65yBp0Xdj.jpg", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/12523"}}, {tmdbId:"116584", properties:{imdbId:"0831526", name:"Pablo Stoll", url:"https://themoviedb.org/person/116584"}}] AS row
